<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:05.200" end="00:00:08.400" style="s2">Daddy, I only wanted to look at</p>
<p begin="00:00:06.700" end="00:00:11.700" style="s2">Scarlett&#39;s necklace and she shoved me</p>
<p begin="00:00:08.400" end="00:00:11.700" style="s2">into the floor.</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.300" end="00:00:22.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will give you the performance of your</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.700" end="00:00:24.300" style="s2">life. I grabbed a metal pen from the</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.700" end="00:00:25.500" style="s2">vanity and drove it straight into</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.300" end="00:00:27.510" style="s2">Clara&#39;s palm.</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.500" end="00:00:27.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU [ __ ] PSYCHO, YOU ANSWERED.</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.510" end="00:00:29.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.600" end="00:00:31.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GET THIS ANIMAL OUT OF MY HOUSE. YOU ARE</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.700" end="00:00:33.500" style="s2">NO LONGER WELCOME IN THE VAIL FAMILY.</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.800" end="00:00:35.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The servants dragged me to the door and</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.500" end="00:00:37.400" style="s2">threw my luggage into the mud.</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.600" end="00:00:40.200" style="s2">In my last life, I tried to become his</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.400" end="00:00:41.400" style="s2">perfect wife, obedient, quiet, and easy</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.200" end="00:00:43.000" style="s2">to manage.</p>
<p begin="00:00:41.400" end="00:00:45.700" style="s2">I gave him everything, but he still</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.000" end="00:00:47.700" style="s2">chose my scheming stepsister every time.</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.700" end="00:00:49.600" style="s2">In the end, a car crash killed the woman</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.700" end="00:00:51.400" style="s2">he had spent years trying to cage, but</p>
<p begin="00:00:49.600" end="00:00:53.300" style="s2">death sent me back to the start right</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.400" end="00:00:55.100" style="s2">before our wedding. This time, I will</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.300" end="00:00:57.000" style="s2">not beg for love. I am giving my</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.100" end="00:00:59.300" style="s2">controlling billionaire fiancé to my</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.000" end="00:01:00.800" style="s2">treacherous stepsister, packing my bags</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.300" end="00:01:02.900" style="s2">and leaving New York forever. Their</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.800" end="00:01:06.000" style="s2">perfect world is going to burn and I</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.900" end="00:01:06.000" style="s2">will walk away free.</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.100" end="00:01:11.300" style="s2">Manhattan&#39;s most exclusive VIP night</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.400" end="00:01:14.800" style="s2">club was a blur of neon lights. I sat in</p>
<p begin="00:01:11.300" end="00:01:14.800" style="s2">the center of a private booth.</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.300" end="00:01:24.800" style="s2">In that split second, I could almost</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.400" end="00:01:27.000" style="s2">hear chains pulling tight from another</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.800" end="00:01:29.400" style="s2">life. In my past life, I loved him to</p>
<p begin="00:01:27.000" end="00:01:31.200" style="s2">the point of madness. I told myself his</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.400" end="00:01:33.300" style="s2">control was love. Then the Blackwood</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.200" end="00:01:35.600" style="s2">family code was placed in front of me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.300" end="00:01:37.500" style="s2">No night clubs, no being alone with any</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.600" end="00:01:39.800" style="s2">man, no leaving New York without</p>
<p begin="00:01:37.500" end="00:01:42.000" style="s2">permission. He froze my passport and cut</p>
<p begin="00:01:39.800" end="00:01:44.000" style="s2">off every account I had. Then he clasped</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.000" end="00:01:46.400" style="s2">a diamond bracelet around my wrist and</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.000" end="00:01:49.700" style="s2">called it an engagement gift. It was not</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.400" end="00:01:52.400" style="s2">a gift. It was a GPS tracker. He sanded</p>
<p begin="00:01:49.700" end="00:01:55.000" style="s2">me down piece by piece until I became</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.400" end="00:01:56.800" style="s2">something quiet and hollow, the perfect</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.000" end="00:01:58.700" style="s2">Mrs. Blackwood.</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.800" end="00:02:01.000" style="s2">Then a car crash ended my suffocating</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.700" end="00:02:02.792" style="s2">life.</p>
<p begin="00:02:01.000" end="00:02:04.692" style="s2">I had reborn on the night before our</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.792" end="00:02:06.692" style="s2">wedding. This time, I did not want</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.692" end="00:02:08.892" style="s2">Damian. I wanted to be Scarlett Bale</p>
<p begin="00:02:06.692" end="00:02:10.492" style="s2">again. So the first thing I did was find</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.892" end="00:02:11.392" style="s2">my father. I want to call off the</p>
<p begin="00:02:10.492" end="00:02:12.892" style="s2">engagement.</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.392" end="00:02:14.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell is wrong with you?</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.892" end="00:02:16.092" style="s2">Marrying into the Blackwood family is</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.192" end="00:02:18.292" style="s2">the greatest opportunity of your life.</p>
<p begin="00:02:16.092" end="00:02:20.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He is so perfect. Let Clara marry him.</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.292" end="00:02:23.692" style="s2">She is the dignified obedient one, the</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.292" end="00:02:23.692" style="s2">ideal Blackwood wife, right?</p>
<p begin="00:02:24.292" end="00:02:28.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are really willing to give it up?</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.392" end="00:02:29.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did not wait for the rest.</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.192" end="00:02:31.892" style="s2">I booked an international flight and</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.792" end="00:02:34.392" style="s2">moved my passport somewhere Damius could</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.892" end="00:02:35.992" style="s2">not reach and called my best friend Mia.</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.392" end="00:02:39.492" style="s2">Come drink with me, which brought me</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.992" end="00:02:39.492" style="s2">here till this moment.</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.692" end="00:02:42.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who gave you the nerve to come to a</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.792" end="00:02:43.992" style="s2">place like this?</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.092" end="00:02:46.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I go where I want. What does that have</p>
<p begin="00:02:43.992" end="00:02:46.692" style="s2">to do with you?</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.492" end="00:03:05.392" style="s2">My blood ran cold. That bracelet, the</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.392" end="00:03:09.692" style="s2">same one that had locked away my freedom</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.392" end="00:03:09.692" style="s2">in my last life. Don&#39;t touch me.</p>
<p begin="00:03:11.492" end="00:03:16.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GPS tracking, heart rate monitor, entry</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.092" end="00:03:18.692" style="s2">and exit logs synced in real time.</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.592" end="00:03:20.192" style="s2">Every step you take, I will see it. I</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.692" end="00:03:21.892" style="s2">want a public apology statement by</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.192" end="00:03:23.492" style="s2">tomorrow morning.</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.892" end="00:03:26.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You put diamonds on a cage and think</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.492" end="00:03:26.692" style="s2">that makes it something else?</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.092" end="00:03:30.992" style="s2">I held his gaze and said it clearly, one</p>
<p begin="00:03:28.992" end="00:03:32.292" style="s2">word at a time. I am not marrying you,</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.992" end="00:03:34.992" style="s2">Damian.</p>
<p begin="00:03:32.292" end="00:03:34.992" style="s2">We are done.</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.692" end="00:03:38.692" style="s2">The car went silent. Damian&#39;s eyes</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.792" end="00:03:39.692" style="s2">snapped to mine.</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.692" end="00:03:41.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Done?</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.692" end="00:03:43.192" style="s2">Done what? What the hell is that</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.592" end="00:03:44.792" style="s2">supposed to mean?</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.192" end="00:03:47.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For a second, I almost told him the</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.792" end="00:03:49.292" style="s2">truth, that the bride had already been</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.092" end="00:03:51.692" style="s2">changed, that Clara was the one his</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.292" end="00:03:53.192" style="s2">family would get. Then I stopped myself.</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.692" end="00:03:54.792" style="s2">I wanted him dreading every day until</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.192" end="00:03:57.492" style="s2">the wedding, convinced he was still</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.792" end="00:03:57.492" style="s2">stuck with me.</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.592" end="00:04:01.192" style="s2">Forget it. I was just mad.</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.992" end="00:04:09.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m taking you home. Sit properly.</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.994" end="00:04:11.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I kicked off my heels, pressed my bare</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.294" end="00:04:13.094" style="s2">feet into his expensive floor mat and</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.694" end="00:04:14.194" style="s2">rolled the window down.</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.094" end="00:04:16.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When are you going to learn to behave</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.194" end="00:04:18.994" style="s2">like a Blackwood wife?</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.594" end="00:04:20.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe in my next life. The Rose stopped</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.994" end="00:04:22.294" style="s2">at the Vale estate gates.</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.594" end="00:04:24.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want that apology on my desk by 9:00</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.294" end="00:04:25.894" style="s2">tomorrow. And don&#39;t waste your time</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.094" end="00:04:27.894" style="s2">trying to take off the bracelet.</p>
<p begin="00:04:25.894" end="00:04:29.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I pushed the door open. I looked down at</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.894" end="00:04:32.494" style="s2">the disgusting thing locked around my</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.494" end="00:04:34.294" style="s2">wrist. Then you&#39;d better watch closely.</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.494" end="00:04:36.194" style="s2">I slammed the door and walked inside</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.294" end="00:04:38.094" style="s2">without looking back. Richard, Monica,</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.194" end="00:04:40.294" style="s2">and Clara were all waiting in the living</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.094" end="00:04:42.194" style="s2">room. My father, his ex-mistress turned</p>
<p begin="00:04:40.294" end="00:04:43.994" style="s2">trophy wife, and the bastard daughter</p>
<p begin="00:04:42.194" end="00:04:46.194" style="s2">they&#39;d spent years polishing into</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.994" end="00:04:48.594" style="s2">exactly the kind of obedient,</p>
<p begin="00:04:46.194" end="00:04:50.594" style="s2">presentable girl Damian wanted.</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.594" end="00:04:52.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You reek of alcohol, and you wore a</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.594" end="00:04:55.794" style="s2">Blackwood engagement bracelet to a night</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.594" end="00:04:57.694" style="s2">cup. Have you completely lost your mind?</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.794" end="00:04:59.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be too hard on her, Richard.</p>
<p begin="00:04:57.694" end="00:05:01.094" style="s2">Though honestly, I&#39;m not sure a family</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.594" end="00:05:03.794" style="s2">like the Blackwoods can afford that kind</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.094" end="00:05:05.894" style="s2">of reputation. Scarlett, Dad said he</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.794" end="00:05:07.194" style="s2">already spoke with the Blackwoods.</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.894" end="00:05:08.508" style="s2">Are you really sure you want me to take</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.194" end="00:05:08.594" style="s2">your place?</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.508" end="00:05:11.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.594" end="00:05:13.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 100% sure. You&#39;ve always loved picking</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.594" end="00:05:15.694" style="s2">up what I throw away. This time I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.694" end="00:05:18.594" style="s2">handing it to you myself.</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.694" end="00:05:20.794" style="s2">No need to sneak around for it.</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.594" end="00:05:22.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Watch your mouth. Clara is steadier,</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.794" end="00:05:24.694" style="s2">smarter, and a far better fit for the</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.494" end="00:05:26.094" style="s2">Blackwood family than you ever were.</p>
<p begin="00:05:24.694" end="00:05:27.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perfect.</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.094" end="00:05:30.894" style="s2">Just don&#39;t come crying to me when the</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.294" end="00:05:30.894" style="s2">whole thing blows up in your faces.</p>
<p begin="00:05:31.094" end="00:05:34.594" style="s2">I only hope you won&#39;t regret this. I</p>
<p begin="00:05:33.094" end="00:05:37.894" style="s2">would hate to see you lose everything</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.594" end="00:05:37.894" style="s2">because of one bad mood.</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.494" end="00:05:43.894" style="s2">Scarlett Vale never regrets a damn</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.494" end="00:05:43.894" style="s2">thing.</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.294" end="00:05:48.694" style="s2">A servant came hammering on my door</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.994" end="00:05:50.294" style="s2">first thing in the morning. Damian was</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.694" end="00:05:52.594" style="s2">downstairs. He stood in the living room</p>
<p begin="00:05:50.294" end="00:05:55.094" style="s2">like last night had never happened.</p>
<p begin="00:05:52.594" end="00:05:57.994" style="s2">First thing he checked was my wrist,</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.094" end="00:05:59.194" style="s2">the bracelet, green light blinking.</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.994" end="00:06:00.094" style="s2">Then he looked up.</p>
<p begin="00:05:59.194" end="00:06:01.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The statement.</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.094" end="00:06:02.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t write one.</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.194" end="00:06:04.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Blackwood&#39;s PR team buried those photos.</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.994" end="00:06:05.295" style="s2">I need that statement.</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.294" end="00:06:06.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your rules do not apply</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.295" end="00:06:07.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; to me anymore. I am not signing</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.995" end="00:06:08.495" style="s2">anything.</p>
<p begin="00:06:07.595" end="00:06:09.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When are you going to learn to do</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.495" end="00:06:11.495" style="s2">what&#39;re told?</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.195" end="00:06:13.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not in this lifetime. Right on cue,</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.495" end="00:06:15.195" style="s2">Clara appeared in a white dress, eyes</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.495" end="00:06:16.795" style="s2">faintly red, holding a printed</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.195" end="00:06:18.995" style="s2">statement. Damian, please don&#39;t be angry</p>
<p begin="00:06:16.795" end="00:06:20.695" style="s2">with Scarlett. She was upset last night.</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.995" end="00:06:21.495" style="s2">I wrote the statement for her. Will this</p>
<p begin="00:06:20.695" end="00:06:23.595" style="s2">work?</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.495" end="00:06:25.895" style="s2">Damian scanned it. When he looked back</p>
<p begin="00:06:23.595" end="00:06:27.895" style="s2">at me, the disgust was undisguised.</p>
<p begin="00:06:25.895" end="00:06:30.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at Clara. She knows when to be</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.895" end="00:06:33.795" style="s2">graceful, when to step back, when to put</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.395" end="00:06:36.095" style="s2">the family first. All you do is create</p>
<p begin="00:06:33.795" end="00:06:38.095" style="s2">problems.</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.095" end="00:06:40.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scarlett just needs more time. The</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.095" end="00:06:43.395" style="s2">Blackwood Charity Gala is tonight. I can</p>
<p begin="00:06:40.495" end="00:06:44.695" style="s2">go with her and help her get through it.</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.395" end="00:06:47.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Help me with what?</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.695" end="00:06:49.295" style="s2">How to smile on cue?</p>
<p begin="00:06:47.495" end="00:06:51.295" style="s2">How to play the innocent girl in white</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.295" end="00:06:53.295" style="s2">while hiding the snake underneath?</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.295" end="00:06:54.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. Add her name and release it.</p>
<p begin="00:06:53.295" end="00:06:55.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did not sign it.</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.495" end="00:06:57.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You went to a nightclub as the future</p>
<p begin="00:06:55.795" end="00:06:58.695" style="s2">Mrs. Blackwood. It stopped being your</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.195" end="00:07:00.695" style="s2">personal guest the second you drag my</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.695" end="00:07:01.995" style="s2">family name into it.</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.695" end="00:07:02.995" style="s2">If you refuse to do the right thing, I</p>
<p begin="00:07:01.995" end="00:07:04.595" style="s2">will do it for you.</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.995" end="00:07:05.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then take Clara. She is always so good</p>
<p begin="00:07:04.595" end="00:07:07.095" style="s2">at doing the right thing.</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.495" end="00:07:08.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are my fiance.</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.095" end="00:07:09.995" style="s2">You will be at that gala tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.395" end="00:07:11.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. This life I was going to give him</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.995" end="00:07:13.995" style="s2">exactly what he wanted. Clara linked her</p>
<p begin="00:07:11.995" end="00:07:16.095" style="s2">arm through mine going upstairs, warm</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.995" end="00:07:17.895" style="s2">smiles, nails digging into my skin. The</p>
<p begin="00:07:16.095" end="00:07:20.295" style="s2">second the door closed, I shook her off.</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.895" end="00:07:21.495" style="s2">Nobody is watching. Drop the act.</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.295" end="00:07:22.495" style="s2">Damian will be mine. On the wedding day,</p>
<p begin="00:07:21.495" end="00:07:23.995" style="s2">he will be grateful someone made the</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.495" end="00:07:25.195" style="s2">switch. A disaster like you has no</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.995" end="00:07:26.595" style="s2">business near the Blackwood name. And</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.195" end="00:07:27.695" style="s2">why didn&#39;t you tell him just now? Scared</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.595" end="00:07:29.095" style="s2">that once he knows he still won&#39;t want</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.695" end="00:07:30.695" style="s2">you? I want just keep your mouth shut,</p>
<p begin="00:07:29.095" end="00:07:32.395" style="s2">Scarlett. I don&#39;t care about the you or</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.695" end="00:07:34.695" style="s2">your control freak fiance. Happy</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.395" end="00:07:34.695" style="s2">wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.395" end="00:07:38.595" style="s2">The Blackwood Family Charity Gala was</p>
<p begin="00:07:36.995" end="00:07:40.695" style="s2">packed with Manhattan&#39;s most powerful</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.595" end="00:07:43.095" style="s2">people, old money, new money, and the</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.695" end="00:07:44.295" style="s2">kind of influence that could buy both.</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.095" end="00:07:46.695" style="s2">I showed up deliberately in a</p>
<p begin="00:07:44.295" end="00:07:48.895" style="s2">floor-length red backless gown, bold,</p>
<p begin="00:07:46.695" end="00:07:51.095" style="s2">unapologetic, and everything a Blackwood</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.895" end="00:07:54.795" style="s2">wife was not supposed to be. Clara wore</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.095" end="00:07:56.295" style="s2">white couture, pristine as a lily.</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.795" end="00:07:58.095" style="s2">When the waltz began and every eye in</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.295" end="00:08:00.395" style="s2">the room drifted toward Damis,</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.095" end="00:08:02.595" style="s2">Manhattan&#39;s most coveted air stepped</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.395" end="00:08:04.995" style="s2">forward and reached right past me, his</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.595" end="00:08:06.995" style="s2">actual fiance, to offer his hand to</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.995" end="00:08:09.197" style="s2">Clara. The socialite crowd broke into</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.995" end="00:08:11.097" style="s2">sharp, delighted whispers.</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.197" end="00:08:12.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you see that? He chose the</p>
<p begin="00:08:11.097" end="00:08:13.897" style="s2">stepsister?</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.297" end="00:08:15.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honestly, I get it. Scarless is a</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.897" end="00:08:17.197" style="s2">walking scandal. Clara is everything a</p>
<p begin="00:08:15.697" end="00:08:18.997" style="s2">Blackwood wife should be.</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.197" end="00:08:20.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian led Clara onto the floor without</p>
<p begin="00:08:18.997" end="00:08:21.997" style="s2">looking back, then threw me a cold</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.697" end="00:08:23.497" style="s2">parting shot.</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.997" end="00:08:24.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You do not know how to dance at this</p>
<p begin="00:08:23.497" end="00:08:26.597" style="s2">level.</p>
<p begin="00:08:24.497" end="00:08:30.097" style="s2">Stay where you are and watch Clara.</p>
<p begin="00:08:26.597" end="00:08:30.097" style="s2">Maybe you will finally learn something.</p>
<p begin="00:08:30.297" end="00:08:33.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I watched them turn beneath the</p>
<p begin="00:08:31.597" end="00:08:34.997" style="s2">chandeliers and felt nothing but</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.497" end="00:08:36.697" style="s2">revulsion.</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.997" end="00:08:38.697" style="s2">I slipped upstairs to the terrace for</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.697" end="00:08:40.597" style="s2">air, desperate to breathe something that</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.697" end="00:08:42.897" style="s2">did not feel like a trap. Of course,</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.597" end="00:08:44.497" style="s2">Clara followed. Her heels clicked up the</p>
<p begin="00:08:42.897" end="00:08:46.397" style="s2">stairs like she had been attached to my</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.497" end="00:08:47.997" style="s2">shadow all night. She wore the face of</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.397" end="00:08:49.597" style="s2">someone who had already won, and when</p>
<p begin="00:08:47.997" end="00:08:51.997" style="s2">she spoke, her voice was low and</p>
<p begin="00:08:49.597" end="00:08:53.797" style="s2">vicious. Poor Scarlett.</p>
<p begin="00:08:51.997" end="00:08:56.297" style="s2">Your mother could not beat mine, and now</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.797" end="00:08:58.097" style="s2">you cannot beat me either.</p>
<p begin="00:08:56.297" end="00:08:59.897" style="s2">Losing must run in your blood. She</p>
<p begin="00:08:58.097" end="00:09:01.997" style="s2">should have said anything else, anything</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.897" end="00:09:04.197" style="s2">but that. She had insulted my dead</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.997" end="00:09:05.997" style="s2">mother. My eyes went cold. Without a</p>
<p begin="00:09:04.197" end="00:09:07.597" style="s2">word, I drew back and slapped her hard</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.997" end="00:09:09.297" style="s2">across the face. The crack cut through</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.597" end="00:09:11.097" style="s2">the night air. Clara&#39;s head snapped to</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.297" end="00:09:12.697" style="s2">the side, and her cheek flushed red</p>
<p begin="00:09:11.097" end="00:09:14.597" style="s2">almost instantly.</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.697" end="00:09:17.597" style="s2">She screamed.</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.597" end="00:09:19.497" style="s2">You crazy [ __ ] You actually hit me?</p>
<p begin="00:09:17.597" end="00:09:22.097" style="s2">I closed the distance and grabbed her by</p>
<p begin="00:09:19.497" end="00:09:25.297" style="s2">the neck. Hit you? I can do a lot worse</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.097" end="00:09:27.097" style="s2">than hit you. I trained in MMA, Clara.</p>
<p begin="00:09:25.297" end="00:09:28.797" style="s2">Taking a part of fake fragile little</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.097" end="00:09:30.197" style="s2">thing like you would barely count as</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.797" end="00:09:31.597" style="s2">exercise.</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.197" end="00:09:34.197" style="s2">I whipped one leg up in a clean</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.597" end="00:09:34.197" style="s2">sidekick.</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.097" end="00:09:39.297" style="s2">The courtyard below erupted into</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.597" end="00:09:41.197" style="s2">screaming chaos. I straightened my</p>
<p begin="00:09:39.297" end="00:09:43.297" style="s2">dress, picked up my wrap, and turned to</p>
<p begin="00:09:41.197" end="00:09:45.097" style="s2">leave. But I had not made it three steps</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.297" end="00:09:46.497" style="s2">before Damian&#39;s hand clamped around my</p>
<p begin="00:09:45.097" end="00:09:48.297" style="s2">wrist like a vice. His eyes were</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.497" end="00:09:49.897" style="s2">bloodshot with rage, and his voice was</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.297" end="00:09:50.197" style="s2">cold enough to freeze the air between</p>
<p begin="00:09:49.897" end="00:09:52.397" style="s2">us.</p>
<p begin="00:09:50.197" end="00:09:53.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Clara fell from the terrace.</p>
<p begin="00:09:52.397" end="00:09:56.297" style="s2">Was it you?</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.097" end="00:09:58.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I met his eyes without flinching. Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:09:56.297" end="00:10:00.897" style="s2">She had it coming.</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.697" end="00:10:02.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are beyond saving. Since she refuses</p>
<p begin="00:10:00.897" end="00:10:03.697" style="s2">to apologize, she needs to learn a</p>
<p begin="00:10:02.297" end="00:10:05.297" style="s2">lesson. Throw her into the estate</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.697" end="00:10:05.897" style="s2">fountain. No one lets her out until I</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.297" end="00:10:07.697" style="s2">say so.</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.897" end="00:10:08.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The bodyguards grabbed me before I could</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.697" end="00:10:10.797" style="s2">fight them off.</p>
<p begin="00:10:08.997" end="00:10:12.098" style="s2">No matter how hard I struggled, they</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.797" end="00:10:13.998" style="s2">dragged me across the courtyard and</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.098" end="00:10:15.898" style="s2">threw me straight into the fountain. The</p>
<p begin="00:10:13.998" end="00:10:18.198" style="s2">water was freezing cold, but it was</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.898" end="00:10:20.398" style="s2">liquid water, not ice. The spring night</p>
<p begin="00:10:18.198" end="00:10:22.398" style="s2">air cut like a blade, and the cold sank</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.398" end="00:10:23.798" style="s2">straight into my bones. Every time I</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.398" end="00:10:25.798" style="s2">clawed for the marble rim of the</p>
<p begin="00:10:23.798" end="00:10:27.198" style="s2">fountain, the guards standing along the</p>
<p begin="00:10:25.798" end="00:10:30.098" style="s2">edge pushed me back under without a</p>
<p begin="00:10:27.198" end="00:10:32.098" style="s2">word. The struggle drained me fast. Then</p>
<p begin="00:10:30.098" end="00:10:33.798" style="s2">something worse hit me. A sharp,</p>
<p begin="00:10:32.098" end="00:10:36.698" style="s2">familiar cramp twisted low in my</p>
<p begin="00:10:33.798" end="00:10:38.398" style="s2">abdomen. My period had come early. I was</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.698" end="00:10:39.898" style="s2">trembling, barely conscious, when I</p>
<p begin="00:10:38.398" end="00:10:41.398" style="s2">heard one of the guards call Damian.</p>
<p begin="00:10:39.898" end="00:10:42.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, Miss Vale just got her period.</p>
<p begin="00:10:41.398" end="00:10:43.098" style="s2">There is blood in the water. Should we</p>
<p begin="00:10:42.598" end="00:10:44.298" style="s2">keep going?</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.098" end="00:10:44.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There was a brief silence on the other</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.298" end="00:10:46.198" style="s2">end.</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.598" end="00:10:47.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep going. She will never learn if she</p>
<p begin="00:10:46.198" end="00:10:49.498" style="s2">does not suffer the consequences.</p>
<p begin="00:10:47.698" end="00:10:51.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In that moment, my blood ran colder than</p>
<p begin="00:10:49.498" end="00:10:53.698" style="s2">the fountain ever could. The despair of</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.198" end="00:10:57.698" style="s2">two lifetimes crashed down over me all</p>
<p begin="00:10:53.698" end="00:10:57.698" style="s2">at once, and the world went black.</p>
<p begin="00:10:59.098" end="00:11:01.998" style="s2">When I opened my eyes again, I was in a</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.398" end="00:11:03.798" style="s2">hospital room that smelled sharply of</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.998" end="00:11:06.098" style="s2">antiseptic. Damian was sitting at my</p>
<p begin="00:11:03.798" end="00:11:07.698" style="s2">bedside. When he saw me wake up, he</p>
<p begin="00:11:06.098" end="00:11:08.698" style="s2">released my hand with an expression of</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.698" end="00:11:10.098" style="s2">careful indifference.</p>
<p begin="00:11:08.698" end="00:11:11.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I spoke with your father. He will not</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.098" end="00:11:14.002" style="s2">give you any more trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.698" end="00:11:15.098" style="s2">But do not ever go after Clara.</p>
<p begin="00:11:14.002" end="00:11:16.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:11:15.098" end="00:11:19.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Clara is my father&#39;s precious little</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.698" end="00:11:23.698" style="s2">affair daughter. She is not my problem,</p>
<p begin="00:11:19.398" end="00:11:23.698" style="s2">and I am not promising you a damn thing.</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.498" end="00:11:28.798" style="s2">Mr. Blackwood, Clara is getting very</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.398" end="00:11:32.098" style="s2">upset in the next room. She has been</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.798" end="00:11:32.098" style="s2">crying and asking for you.</p>
<p begin="00:11:32.498" end="00:11:35.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will go check on her.</p>
<p begin="00:11:34.198" end="00:11:39.698" style="s2">She was hurt because of you. As your</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.898" end="00:11:39.698" style="s2">fiancé, it is only proper that I go.</p>
<p begin="00:11:41.598" end="00:11:44.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go on then.</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.698" end="00:11:46.898" style="s2">Run to your real fiancé. On the day I</p>
<p begin="00:11:44.598" end="00:11:48.598" style="s2">was discharged, Damian forced me back</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.898" end="00:11:50.098" style="s2">into the car and drove me to the Vale</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.598" end="00:11:52.498" style="s2">estate. But when I pushed open my</p>
<p begin="00:11:50.098" end="00:11:54.098" style="s2">bedroom door, my blood went cold. Clara</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.498" end="00:11:56.298" style="s2">was sitting at my vanity, dangling a</p>
<p begin="00:11:54.098" end="00:11:58.498" style="s2">sapphire necklace from her fingertips.</p>
<p begin="00:11:56.298" end="00:12:00.498" style="s2">My mother&#39;s sapphire necklace, the only</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.498" end="00:12:02.398" style="s2">thing she had left me. I crossed the</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.498" end="00:12:04.198" style="s2">room in three steps. My voice stripped</p>
<p begin="00:12:02.398" end="00:12:06.498" style="s2">down to nothing. Put it down and get</p>
<p begin="00:12:04.198" end="00:12:06.498" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="00:12:06.798" end="00:12:10.198" style="s2">Yours?</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.198" end="00:12:13.299" style="s2">Scarlett, everything in this house is</p>
<p begin="00:12:10.198" end="00:12:13.299" style="s2">going to mine.</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.193" end="00:12:20.213" style="s2">[laughter and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.399" end="00:12:23.499" style="s2">Daddy, I only wanted to look at</p>
<p begin="00:12:21.799" end="00:12:26.399" style="s2">Scarlett&#39;s necklace and she shoved me</p>
<p begin="00:12:23.499" end="00:12:26.399" style="s2">into the floor.</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.899" end="00:12:32.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell are you smiling at?</p>
<p begin="00:12:31.399" end="00:12:34.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I looked straight at Clara. You love</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.999" end="00:12:36.999" style="s2">putting on a show? Fine, I will give you</p>
<p begin="00:12:34.999" end="00:12:38.999" style="s2">the performance of your life. I grabbed</p>
<p begin="00:12:36.999" end="00:12:40.699" style="s2">a metal pen from the vanity and drove it</p>
<p begin="00:12:38.999" end="00:12:42.428" style="s2">straight into Clara&#39;s palm.</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.699" end="00:12:42.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU [ __ ] PSYCHO, YOU ARE DONE.</p>
<p begin="00:12:42.428" end="00:12:44.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:12:42.699" end="00:12:46.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NOW, GET THIS ANIMAL OUT OF MY HOUSE.</p>
<p begin="00:12:44.699" end="00:12:46.999" style="s2">YOU ARE NO LONGER WELCOME IN THE VALE</p>
<p begin="00:12:46.299" end="00:12:48.699" style="s2">FAMILY.</p>
<p begin="00:12:46.999" end="00:12:50.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The servants dragged me to the door and</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.699" end="00:12:52.299" style="s2">threw my luggage into the mud. I bent</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.499" end="00:12:53.799" style="s2">down, pulled my mother&#39;s sapphire</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.299" end="00:12:55.899" style="s2">necklace out of the dirt and held it</p>
<p begin="00:12:53.799" end="00:12:57.399" style="s2">tight. It was raining. I stood soaked</p>
<p begin="00:12:55.899" end="00:12:58.999" style="s2">under an awning until a black Rolls</p>
<p begin="00:12:57.399" end="00:13:00.799" style="s2">pulled up. Damian got out without a</p>
<p begin="00:12:58.999" end="00:13:02.699" style="s2">word, put me in the car, and drove me to</p>
<p begin="00:13:00.799" end="00:13:04.499" style="s2">his house. He came back with a first aid</p>
<p begin="00:13:02.699" end="00:13:06.099" style="s2">kit and started treating the mark my</p>
<p begin="00:13:04.499" end="00:13:07.599" style="s2">father had left on my face. Then the</p>
<p begin="00:13:06.099" end="00:13:09.899" style="s2">doorbell rang.</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.599" end="00:13:11.399" style="s2">Clara, banded hand, fragile expression.</p>
<p begin="00:13:09.899" end="00:13:12.299" style="s2">She walked straight into Damian&#39;s arms</p>
<p begin="00:13:11.399" end="00:13:13.599" style="s2">like she belonged there.</p>
<p begin="00:13:12.299" end="00:13:14.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian, I had to come. I was worried</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.599" end="00:13:15.899" style="s2">what she did to me. She is still</p>
<p begin="00:13:14.799" end="00:13:18.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian&#39;s face darkened.</p>
<p begin="00:13:15.899" end="00:13:20.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Apologize to her right now, Scarlett.</p>
<p begin="00:13:18.499" end="00:13:21.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not a chance in hell. We started arguing</p>
<p begin="00:13:20.299" end="00:13:23.499" style="s2">by the entryway. Damian reached for my</p>
<p begin="00:13:21.899" end="00:13:25.099" style="s2">arm and I shoved him off. In the</p>
<p begin="00:13:23.499" end="00:13:26.399" style="s2">struggle, his elbow knocked into the</p>
<p begin="00:13:25.099" end="00:13:27.999" style="s2">glass kettle sitting on the side</p>
<p begin="00:13:26.399" end="00:13:29.499" style="s2">cabinet. The kettle reacted to the floor</p>
<p begin="00:13:27.999" end="00:13:30.899" style="s2">and shattered. Scalding water exploded</p>
<p begin="00:13:29.499" end="00:13:33.199" style="s2">across the marble. He threw himself</p>
<p begin="00:13:30.899" end="00:13:34.899" style="s2">around Clara and covered her completely.</p>
<p begin="00:13:33.199" end="00:13:36.399" style="s2">She was fine. Then he glanced at me on</p>
<p begin="00:13:34.899" end="00:13:36.699" style="s2">the floor, bent down, and picked Clara</p>
<p begin="00:13:36.399" end="00:13:38.299" style="s2">up.</p>
<p begin="00:13:36.699" end="00:13:39.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leave her. A little pain might teach her</p>
<p begin="00:13:38.299" end="00:13:40.299" style="s2">to think before she goes after you</p>
<p begin="00:13:39.799" end="00:13:42.099" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:13:40.299" end="00:13:46.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He left me alone on the floor with</p>
<p begin="00:13:42.099" end="00:13:46.099" style="s2">scalding water still spreading around.</p>
<p begin="00:13:46.399" end="00:13:50.299" style="s2">I sat on that floor, holding myself</p>
<p begin="00:13:48.399" end="00:13:52.199" style="s2">together through the pain and called 911</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.299" end="00:13:53.899" style="s2">myself. I got out of the hospital just</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.199" end="00:13:55.199" style="s2">in time for Clara&#39;s birthday party.</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.899" end="00:13:56.799" style="s2">Richard used the occasion to make a</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.199" end="00:13:58.499" style="s2">grand announcement. The majority of the</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.799" end="00:13:59.999" style="s2">Vale family&#39;s trust assets and shares</p>
<p begin="00:13:58.499" end="00:14:01.699" style="s2">would be transferred to Clara. In front</p>
<p begin="00:13:59.999" end="00:14:03.699" style="s2">of every guest in the room, took out a</p>
<p begin="00:14:01.699" end="00:14:05.399" style="s2">velvet box and clasped a diamond</p>
<p begin="00:14:03.699" end="00:14:07.599" style="s2">necklace worth a small fortune around</p>
<p begin="00:14:05.399" end="00:14:09.299" style="s2">Clara&#39;s neck. Clara&#39;s socialite friends</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.599" end="00:14:11.299" style="s2">swept over with their glasses, making</p>
<p begin="00:14:09.299" end="00:14:13.499" style="s2">sure to spill red wine across my dress.</p>
<p begin="00:14:11.299" end="00:14:17.101" style="s2">Look at the ex-fiancée. You clean up</p>
<p begin="00:14:13.499" end="00:14:17.101" style="s2">like somebody&#39;s charity project.</p>
<p begin="00:14:19.801" end="00:14:23.301" style="s2">The bottle shattered. Blood and liquor</p>
<p begin="00:14:22.001" end="00:14:25.901" style="s2">ran together.</p>
<p begin="00:14:23.301" end="00:14:28.001" style="s2">The room erupted in screams. Damian was</p>
<p begin="00:14:25.901" end="00:14:30.501" style="s2">on me in seconds, crushing my wrist in</p>
<p begin="00:14:28.001" end="00:14:32.001" style="s2">his grip, his eyes loaded with contempt.</p>
<p begin="00:14:30.501" end="00:14:35.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scarlett, what the hell is wrong with</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.001" end="00:14:37.301" style="s2">you? Apologize to them now.</p>
<p begin="00:14:35.101" end="00:14:38.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In your dreams. Damian laughed, but</p>
<p begin="00:14:37.301" end="00:14:40.301" style="s2">there was no humor in it. It was the</p>
<p begin="00:14:38.901" end="00:14:42.401" style="s2">laugh of a man who had run out of</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.301" end="00:14:43.601" style="s2">patience completely. He knew exactly</p>
<p begin="00:14:42.401" end="00:14:45.001" style="s2">what I feared most.</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.601" end="00:14:46.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since you refused to listen, you can sit</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.001" end="00:14:48.101" style="s2">in the dark and think about what you</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.201" end="00:14:49.301" style="s2">have done. Lock her in the wine cellar.</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.101" end="00:14:49.901" style="s2">Nobody opens that door without my</p>
<p begin="00:14:49.301" end="00:14:51.401" style="s2">permission.</p>
<p begin="00:14:49.901" end="00:14:53.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They dragged me into the estate&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:14:51.401" end="00:14:56.601" style="s2">basement wine cellar. Stone walls, no</p>
<p begin="00:14:53.901" end="00:14:58.701" style="s2">windows, no light. The heavy iron door</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.601" end="00:15:00.901" style="s2">slammed shut, and total darkness</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.701" end="00:15:04.001" style="s2">swallowed me whole. Three days and three</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.901" end="00:15:06.301" style="s2">nights, no water, no food. The fear</p>
<p begin="00:15:04.001" end="00:15:08.201" style="s2">nearly broke me. On the fourth day, the</p>
<p begin="00:15:06.301" end="00:15:11.001" style="s2">door finally opened, but it was not</p>
<p begin="00:15:08.201" end="00:15:13.201" style="s2">Damian. It was Clara, pushing in a piece</p>
<p begin="00:15:11.001" end="00:15:15.001" style="s2">of equipment I did not recognize. She</p>
<p begin="00:15:13.201" end="00:15:16.501" style="s2">was smiling like something out of hell.</p>
<p begin="00:15:15.001" end="00:15:18.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian said you needed to learn a real</p>
<p begin="00:15:16.501" end="00:15:19.501" style="s2">lesson, so I brought something to make</p>
<p begin="00:15:18.301" end="00:15:21.301" style="s2">sure it sticks.</p>
<p begin="00:15:19.501" end="00:15:23.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two men in black dragged me to a metal</p>
<p begin="00:15:21.301" end="00:15:25.801" style="s2">chair and strapped me down. They pressed</p>
<p begin="00:15:23.101" end="00:15:27.801" style="s2">electrode pads to my temples. Clara hit</p>
<p begin="00:15:25.801" end="00:15:31.001" style="s2">the switch. The current ripped through</p>
<p begin="00:15:27.801" end="00:15:34.101" style="s2">me. The pain had no words. It only had</p>
<p begin="00:15:31.001" end="00:15:37.401" style="s2">sound, and the sound was mine.</p>
<p begin="00:15:34.101" end="00:15:37.401" style="s2">Then there was nothing at all.</p>
<p begin="00:15:37.801" end="00:15:41.701" style="s2">I woke up in the main house in a proper</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.701" end="00:15:42.401" style="s2">bed. Damian was sitting beside me,</p>
<p begin="00:15:41.701" end="00:15:44.101" style="s2">frowning.</p>
<p begin="00:15:42.401" end="00:15:45.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you to stay in there and think.</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.101" end="00:15:48.101" style="s2">Three days. How are you this week?</p>
<p begin="00:15:45.901" end="00:15:49.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I opened my eyes and looked at him.</p>
<p begin="00:15:48.101" end="00:15:51.101" style="s2">Your precious Clara brought men into</p>
<p begin="00:15:49.501" end="00:15:54.801" style="s2">that cellar with an electric shock chair</p>
<p begin="00:15:51.101" end="00:15:54.801" style="s2">and used it on me. Do you believe me?</p>
<p begin="00:15:55.301" end="00:15:58.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Impossible. Clara is gentle. She would</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.001" end="00:16:00.101" style="s2">never do something like that. Scarlett,</p>
<p begin="00:15:58.701" end="00:16:01.301" style="s2">there is a limit to how far you can take</p>
<p begin="00:16:00.101" end="00:16:03.901" style="s2">a lie.</p>
<p begin="00:16:01.301" end="00:16:06.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He would never believe me. Fine. I would</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.901" end="00:16:08.201" style="s2">collect that debt on my own. That night,</p>
<p begin="00:16:06.501" end="00:16:10.401" style="s2">I hired a team and made the arrangements</p>
<p begin="00:16:08.201" end="00:16:12.401" style="s2">myself. That night, Clara had been</p>
<p begin="00:16:10.401" end="00:16:14.101" style="s2">bound, suspended in the open air through</p>
<p begin="00:16:12.401" end="00:16:15.801" style="s2">the entire night.</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.101" end="00:16:17.601" style="s2">Damian kicked my door in, the vein in</p>
<p begin="00:16:15.801" end="00:16:18.402" style="s2">his temple visible from across the room.</p>
<p begin="00:16:17.601" end="00:16:20.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You left Clara hanging</p>
<p begin="00:16:18.402" end="00:16:21.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; off a rooftop all night. If it were NOT</p>
<p begin="00:16:20.102" end="00:16:22.802" style="s2">FOR THE SAFETY NET AT THE base of the</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.502" end="00:16:24.302" style="s2">building, SHE WOULD BE DEAD.</p>
<p begin="00:16:22.802" end="00:16:26.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I sat by the window, trimming my nails</p>
<p begin="00:16:24.302" end="00:16:27.502" style="s2">without looking up. Damian slammed his</p>
<p begin="00:16:26.002" end="00:16:27.702" style="s2">hand on the table hard enough to rattle</p>
<p begin="00:16:27.502" end="00:16:29.402" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:16:27.702" end="00:16:31.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The wedding is in a few days. You are</p>
<p begin="00:16:29.402" end="00:16:32.102" style="s2">staying in this house until then. You</p>
<p begin="00:16:31.002" end="00:16:33.802" style="s2">are not going anywhere. Do you</p>
<p begin="00:16:32.102" end="00:16:35.102" style="s2">understand me?</p>
<p begin="00:16:33.802" end="00:16:36.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The night before the wedding, a still</p>
<p begin="00:16:35.102" end="00:16:38.202" style="s2">shaking Clara was brought back to the</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.402" end="00:16:39.202" style="s2">Vale estate. Richard took one look at me</p>
<p begin="00:16:38.202" end="00:16:40.302" style="s2">and started screaming.</p>
<p begin="00:16:39.202" end="00:16:41.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay away from the wedding tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:16:40.302" end="00:16:43.002" style="s2">Don&#39;t you dare show your face and</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.602" end="00:16:44.702" style="s2">humiliate this family.</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.002" end="00:16:47.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I picked up the luggage I had already</p>
<p begin="00:16:44.702" end="00:16:49.602" style="s2">packed and smiled at him.</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.902" end="00:16:51.302" style="s2">Trust me.</p>
<p begin="00:16:49.602" end="00:16:53.202" style="s2">That suffocating circus is the last</p>
<p begin="00:16:51.302" end="00:16:56.602" style="s2">place I would ever want to be.</p>
<p begin="00:16:53.202" end="00:16:56.602" style="s2">You could not pay me to go.</p>
<p begin="00:16:58.402" end="00:17:02.902" style="s2">Wedding morning. When I came downstairs,</p>
<p begin="00:17:00.902" end="00:17:05.502" style="s2">Damian was already in the house.</p>
<p begin="00:17:02.902" end="00:17:06.902" style="s2">At Clara&#39;s insistence, the ceremony had</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.502" end="00:17:09.202" style="s2">been planned as an elaborate</p>
<p begin="00:17:06.902" end="00:17:11.202" style="s2">old-fashioned church wedding. Damian</p>
<p begin="00:17:09.202" end="00:17:13.502" style="s2">couldn&#39;t see who was underneath it. He</p>
<p begin="00:17:11.202" end="00:17:16.102" style="s2">assumed his lessons had finally worked,</p>
<p begin="00:17:13.502" end="00:17:17.502" style="s2">that the sharp edges had been worn down,</p>
<p begin="00:17:16.102" end="00:17:19.602" style="s2">and the woman walking toward him had</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.502" end="00:17:21.802" style="s2">learned to obey. He stepped forward and</p>
<p begin="00:17:19.602" end="00:17:23.102" style="s2">took the bride&#39;s hand gently.</p>
<p begin="00:17:21.802" end="00:17:24.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be nervous, Scarlett. I&#39;m right</p>
<p begin="00:17:23.102" end="00:17:26.502" style="s2">here. I will teach you everything you</p>
<p begin="00:17:24.902" end="00:17:29.102" style="s2">need to know to become the perfect Mrs.</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.502" end="00:17:29.102" style="s2">Blackwood.</p>
<p begin="00:17:29.302" end="00:17:34.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go on, Damian. Marry your dream wife.</p>
<p begin="00:17:32.102" end="00:17:36.302" style="s2">Consider it my wedding gift to you both.</p>
<p begin="00:17:34.502" end="00:17:38.002" style="s2">Once the procession left for Saint Heart</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.302" end="00:17:40.902" style="s2">Cathedral, the Vale estate went</p>
<p begin="00:17:38.002" end="00:17:43.802" style="s2">completely quiet</p>
<p begin="00:17:40.902" end="00:17:46.002" style="s2">and flagged a cab to JFK.</p>
<p begin="00:17:43.802" end="00:17:47.502" style="s2">Inside the car, I pulled a small remote</p>
<p begin="00:17:46.002" end="00:17:49.102" style="s2">from my coat pocket</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.502" end="00:17:50.202" style="s2">and looked back at the house one last</p>
<p begin="00:17:49.102" end="00:17:51.902" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="00:17:50.202" end="00:17:53.902" style="s2">My mother had designed it. Now it</p>
<p begin="00:17:51.902" end="00:17:55.402" style="s2">sheltered the woman who had replaced her</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.902" end="00:17:59.502" style="s2">and the daughter who had spent years</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.402" end="00:17:59.502" style="s2">making my life hell. I was done with it.</p>
<p begin="00:18:01.702" end="00:18:05.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss, was was that your house?</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.902" end="00:18:09.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.202" end="00:18:09.802" style="s2">I blew it up.</p>
<p begin="00:18:11.002" end="00:18:14.202" style="s2">Saint Heart Cathedral. The vaulted</p>
<p begin="00:18:12.602" end="00:18:15.502" style="s2">ceiling soared overhead, and the pipe</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.202" end="00:18:16.902" style="s2">organ filled the nave and transept with</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.502" end="00:18:18.302" style="s2">something Every name that mattered in</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.902" end="00:18:19.702" style="s2">Hatton had shown up. At the end of the</p>
<p begin="00:18:18.302" end="00:18:21.503" style="s2">aisle, Damian stood in a perfectly</p>
<p begin="00:18:19.702" end="00:18:22.803" style="s2">tailored suit, precise, untouchable,</p>
<p begin="00:18:21.503" end="00:18:24.403" style="s2">watching the bride walk toward him.</p>
<p begin="00:18:22.803" end="00:18:26.103" style="s2">Today&#39;s bride was a long-usual lace veil</p>
<p begin="00:18:24.403" end="00:18:27.803" style="s2">fell all the way down, hiding her face</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.103" end="00:18:29.403" style="s2">completely. Damian assumed all those</p>
<p begin="00:18:27.803" end="00:18:31.103" style="s2">cold lessons had finally worked. He</p>
<p begin="00:18:29.403" end="00:18:32.203" style="s2">assumed I had finally been worn smooth</p>
<p begin="00:18:31.103" end="00:18:33.303" style="s2">and that the woman walking towards him</p>
<p begin="00:18:32.203" end="00:18:34.503" style="s2">had learned how to submit.</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.303" end="00:18:35.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The priest began the vows.</p>
<p begin="00:18:34.503" end="00:18:37.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian lowered his voice, speaking only</p>
<p begin="00:18:35.903" end="00:18:38.403" style="s2">to the bride in front of him.</p>
<p begin="00:18:37.003" end="00:18:40.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After today, I will personally teach you</p>
<p begin="00:18:38.403" end="00:18:41.803" style="s2">how to be a proper Mrs. Blackwood.</p>
<p begin="00:18:40.103" end="00:18:43.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He took the bride&#39;s hand and guided her</p>
<p begin="00:18:41.803" end="00:18:45.303" style="s2">toward the altar as camera flashes</p>
<p begin="00:18:43.603" end="00:18:46.803" style="s2">stirred across the room. Then came the</p>
<p begin="00:18:45.303" end="00:18:48.403" style="s2">moment everyone had been waiting for.</p>
<p begin="00:18:46.803" end="00:18:50.103" style="s2">The groom lifted the veil. Damian</p>
<p begin="00:18:48.403" end="00:18:51.303" style="s2">reached up with calm, certain fingers,</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.103" end="00:18:53.103" style="s2">caught the edge of the lace, and swept</p>
<p begin="00:18:51.303" end="00:18:54.703" style="s2">it back. For one breath, the cathedral</p>
<p begin="00:18:53.103" end="00:18:56.003" style="s2">seemed to freeze.</p>
<p begin="00:18:54.703" end="00:18:57.803" style="s2">The face in front of him was not the one</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.003" end="00:18:59.803" style="s2">burned into his memory. It was not the</p>
<p begin="00:18:57.803" end="00:19:02.103" style="s2">proud, defiant face he had spent years</p>
<p begin="00:18:59.803" end="00:19:03.603" style="s2">trying to control. It was Clara, flushed</p>
<p begin="00:19:02.103" end="00:19:05.503" style="s2">with excitement, her eyes bright with</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.603" end="00:19:07.503" style="s2">smug satisfaction. The cathedral went</p>
<p begin="00:19:05.503" end="00:19:09.203" style="s2">silent for one stunned second before the</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.503" end="00:19:10.503" style="s2">whole room broke into chaos.</p>
<p begin="00:19:09.203" end="00:19:11.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why is the younger veiled daughter</p>
<p begin="00:19:10.503" end="00:19:13.903" style="s2">wearing the wedding dress?</p>
<p begin="00:19:11.703" end="00:19:16.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The half smile on Damian&#39;s face frozen,</p>
<p begin="00:19:13.903" end="00:19:17.603" style="s2">then vanished completely.</p>
<p begin="00:19:16.003" end="00:19:19.903" style="s2">His pupils tightened like someone had</p>
<p begin="00:19:17.603" end="00:19:21.703" style="s2">struck him. In one violent motion, he</p>
<p begin="00:19:19.903" end="00:19:23.903" style="s2">flung the veil away as if it had burned</p>
<p begin="00:19:21.703" end="00:19:25.903" style="s2">his hand. Clara had no warning. The</p>
<p begin="00:19:23.903" end="00:19:27.903" style="s2">force sent her stumbling back and</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.903" end="00:19:29.703" style="s2">crashing to the floor, her headpiece</p>
<p begin="00:19:27.903" end="00:19:31.903" style="s2">crooked, and her white gown tangled</p>
<p begin="00:19:29.703" end="00:19:34.503" style="s2">around her legs in front of the entire</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.903" end="00:19:35.903" style="s2">congregation. Damian&#39;s voice tore</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.503" end="00:19:40.203" style="s2">through the cathedral.</p>
<p begin="00:19:35.903" end="00:19:40.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHERE IS SCARLETT? TELL ME WHERE SHE IS!</p>
<p begin="00:19:40.703" end="00:19:44.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THE MOST PRESTIGIOUS society wedding in</p>
<p begin="00:19:42.503" end="00:19:45.563" style="s2">New York had just turned into the city&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:19:44.303" end="00:19:46.503" style="s2">biggest scandal.</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.563" end="00:19:49.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:19:46.503" end="00:19:51.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian, just finish the ceremony.</p>
<p begin="00:19:49.503" end="00:19:53.503" style="s2">Richard told us a few days ago that the</p>
<p begin="00:19:51.103" end="00:19:55.503" style="s2">bride was being changed to Clara.</p>
<p begin="00:19:53.503" end="00:19:56.603" style="s2">We thought Clara was more suitable, more</p>
<p begin="00:19:55.503" end="00:19:58.103" style="s2">composed.</p>
<p begin="00:19:56.603" end="00:19:59.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The arrangement benefits both families&#39;</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.103" end="00:20:01.303" style="s2">trusts and shareholding, so we agreed to</p>
<p begin="00:19:59.803" end="00:20:03.303" style="s2">it privately. She had assumed he would</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.303" end="00:20:04.903" style="s2">be relieved. His reaction told her she</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.303" end="00:20:06.703" style="s2">had never understood her son at all.</p>
<p begin="00:20:04.903" end="00:20:08.703" style="s2">Damian&#39;s personal assistant pushed past</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.703" end="00:20:09.803" style="s2">security and sprinted into the hall, his</p>
<p begin="00:20:08.703" end="00:20:11.703" style="s2">face drained of color.</p>
<p begin="00:20:09.803" end="00:20:12.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, it is bad. The Vale estate exploded</p>
<p begin="00:20:11.703" end="00:20:14.303" style="s2">half an hour ago.</p>
<p begin="00:20:12.503" end="00:20:15.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The entire mansion is gone. There is</p>
<p begin="00:20:14.303" end="00:20:17.303" style="s2">nothing left but rubble.</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.503" end="00:20:19.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That sentence snapped the last thread of</p>
<p begin="00:20:17.303" end="00:20:21.803" style="s2">Damian&#39;s composure. If I had not come to</p>
<p begin="00:20:19.503" end="00:20:23.703" style="s2">the wedding, I had to be at the estate.</p>
<p begin="00:20:21.803" end="00:20:23.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That reckless, insane woman, did she</p>
<p begin="00:20:23.703" end="00:20:25.005" style="s2">burn</p>
<p begin="00:20:23.905" end="00:20:26.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; herself alive in there?</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.005" end="00:20:28.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was enormous and bottomless, the kind</p>
<p begin="00:20:26.705" end="00:20:30.205" style="s2">of fear that only came when loss had</p>
<p begin="00:20:28.405" end="00:20:32.405" style="s2">already reached for your throat. He</p>
<p begin="00:20:30.205" end="00:20:34.405" style="s2">shoved his mother aside, ignored every</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.405" end="00:20:36.105" style="s2">voice calling after him and ran. The</p>
<p begin="00:20:34.405" end="00:20:37.605" style="s2">black Rolls tore through red lights one</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.105" end="00:20:39.005" style="s2">after another before screeching to a</p>
<p begin="00:20:37.605" end="00:20:41.205" style="s2">stop in front of what remained of the</p>
<p begin="00:20:39.005" end="00:20:43.705" style="s2">Vale estate. Damian stumbled out of the</p>
<p begin="00:20:41.205" end="00:20:45.505" style="s2">car and stood before the scorched ruins,</p>
<p begin="00:20:43.705" end="00:20:47.305" style="s2">feeling as if something had been carved</p>
<p begin="00:20:45.505" end="00:20:49.305" style="s2">straight out of his chest. He screamed</p>
<p begin="00:20:47.305" end="00:20:51.705" style="s2">my name into the rubble until his voice</p>
<p begin="00:20:49.305" end="00:20:53.805" style="s2">broke. Then he shoved past the emergency</p>
<p begin="00:20:51.705" end="00:20:55.905" style="s2">crew and tore into the debris with his</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.805" end="00:20:58.105" style="s2">bare hands. The entire structure could</p>
<p begin="00:20:55.905" end="00:20:58.905" style="s2">have caved in at any second, but he did</p>
<p begin="00:20:58.105" end="00:21:01.505" style="s2">not stop.</p>
<p begin="00:20:58.905" end="00:21:04.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GET OFF ME. SHE MIGHT STILL BE IN THERE.</p>
<p begin="00:21:01.505" end="00:21:04.205" style="s2">LET ME THROUGH.</p>
<p begin="00:21:04.605" end="00:21:07.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HIS DESIGNER SUIT WAS shredded where the</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.205" end="00:21:09.905" style="s2">debris had caught it, but he did not</p>
<p begin="00:21:07.705" end="00:21:11.605" style="s2">notice. Rebar sliced his palms open.</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.905" end="00:21:13.005" style="s2">Smoldering cinders burned blisters</p>
<p begin="00:21:11.605" end="00:21:15.405" style="s2">straight into his skin. There was only</p>
<p begin="00:21:13.005" end="00:21:17.005" style="s2">one thought left in him.</p>
<p begin="00:21:15.405" end="00:21:18.405" style="s2">He had to find her.</p>
<p begin="00:21:17.005" end="00:21:21.705" style="s2">His voice had gone raw.</p>
<p begin="00:21:18.405" end="00:21:23.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SCARLETT, ANSWER ME. COME OUT HERE. I</p>
<p begin="00:21:21.705" end="00:21:25.305" style="s2">WILL NEVER MAKE YOU write another</p>
<p begin="00:21:23.105" end="00:21:26.505" style="s2">apology. I will never lock you down</p>
<p begin="00:21:25.305" end="00:21:28.105" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:21:26.505" end="00:21:28.905" style="s2">Whatever you want, I will give it to</p>
<p begin="00:21:28.105" end="00:21:30.605" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:21:28.905" end="00:21:32.405" style="s2">Just answer me.</p>
<p begin="00:21:30.605" end="00:21:34.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In the area where my bedroom had been,</p>
<p begin="00:21:32.405" end="00:21:35.905" style="s2">he finally dug out a small jewelry box,</p>
<p begin="00:21:34.605" end="00:21:37.505" style="s2">warped and half melted with the</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.905" end="00:21:39.305" style="s2">blackwood crest barely recognizable on</p>
<p begin="00:21:37.505" end="00:21:41.305" style="s2">the surface. His hands shook as he pried</p>
<p begin="00:21:39.305" end="00:21:43.205" style="s2">it open. Inside lay a diamond necklace</p>
<p begin="00:21:41.305" end="00:21:45.005" style="s2">fused into a molten shape. He closed his</p>
<p begin="00:21:43.205" end="00:21:46.905" style="s2">fist around it. The scorched twisted</p>
<p begin="00:21:45.005" end="00:21:48.705" style="s2">metal cut into his palm, but he held on</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.905" end="00:21:50.505" style="s2">anyway. Guilt hit him like drowning,</p>
<p begin="00:21:48.705" end="00:21:52.205" style="s2">cold and total with no way back to the</p>
<p begin="00:21:50.505" end="00:21:53.905" style="s2">surface. For the first time, he</p>
<p begin="00:21:52.205" end="00:21:55.505" style="s2">understood what his control had done to</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.905" end="00:21:57.205" style="s2">the woman he to love.</p>
<p begin="00:21:55.505" end="00:21:58.705" style="s2">I had always been bright, defiant, but</p>
<p begin="00:21:57.205" end="00:22:00.705" style="s2">he had spent years trying to grind that</p>
<p begin="00:21:58.705" end="00:22:02.605" style="s2">fire out of me. His certainty, his</p>
<p begin="00:22:00.705" end="00:22:04.405" style="s2">rules, and his need to own every part of</p>
<p begin="00:22:02.605" end="00:22:05.905" style="s2">my life had driven me to this. Then his</p>
<p begin="00:22:04.405" end="00:22:07.705" style="s2">assistant came sprinting across the</p>
<p begin="00:22:05.905" end="00:22:08.805" style="s2">debris field, holding a tablet and</p>
<p begin="00:22:07.705" end="00:22:10.805" style="s2">barely able to breathe.</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.805" end="00:22:11.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, we found something. You need to see</p>
<p begin="00:22:10.805" end="00:22:12.905" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="00:22:11.305" end="00:22:14.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was security footage from a discrete</p>
<p begin="00:22:12.905" end="00:22:16.505" style="s2">camera at a side exit near the estate.</p>
<p begin="00:22:14.905" end="00:22:18.805" style="s2">The timestamp was 10 minutes before the</p>
<p begin="00:22:16.505" end="00:22:21.105" style="s2">explosion. A slender figure in a plain</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.805" end="00:22:23.005" style="s2">coat pulling a small carry-on walked out</p>
<p begin="00:22:21.105" end="00:22:24.805" style="s2">of the Vale estate at an easy pace. She</p>
<p begin="00:22:23.005" end="00:22:26.006" style="s2">flagged a cab on the street. Just before</p>
<p begin="00:22:24.805" end="00:22:27.906" style="s2">getting in, she looked back at the</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.006" end="00:22:29.306" style="s2">house, raised her hand and pressed</p>
<p begin="00:22:27.906" end="00:22:31.706" style="s2">something. Behind her, the fireball</p>
<p begin="00:22:29.306" end="00:22:33.006" style="s2">rose. The image was grainy, but Damian</p>
<p begin="00:22:31.706" end="00:22:35.506" style="s2">knew that face he&#39;d burned into him for</p>
<p begin="00:22:33.006" end="00:22:36.906" style="s2">years. It was me, alive and untouched,</p>
<p begin="00:22:35.506" end="00:22:39.406" style="s2">walking out of the house by my own</p>
<p begin="00:22:36.906" end="00:22:39.406" style="s2">choice.</p>
<p begin="00:22:40.106" end="00:22:43.506" style="s2">Relief and a deeper, darker panic hit</p>
<p begin="00:22:42.106" end="00:22:45.806" style="s2">him at the same time, nearly knocking</p>
<p begin="00:22:43.506" end="00:22:47.306" style="s2">him off his feet. She was alive.</p>
<p begin="00:22:45.806" end="00:22:48.706" style="s2">That was everything, but she had done</p>
<p begin="00:22:47.306" end="00:22:50.006" style="s2">this with clear eyes and steady She had</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.706" end="00:22:51.806" style="s2">blown up the house she had grown up in,</p>
<p begin="00:22:50.006" end="00:22:53.606" style="s2">set up a wedding day decoy, and walked</p>
<p begin="00:22:51.806" end="00:22:55.306" style="s2">away without looking back. This was not</p>
<p begin="00:22:53.606" end="00:22:57.506" style="s2">a tantrum, and it was not a cry for</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.306" end="00:22:59.206" style="s2">attention. She truly did not want him.</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.506" end="00:23:00.906" style="s2">She hated him enough to erase her old</p>
<p begin="00:22:59.206" end="00:23:02.706" style="s2">life in one morning, and she had meant</p>
<p begin="00:23:00.906" end="00:23:04.306" style="s2">every word she said. Damian pulled</p>
<p begin="00:23:02.706" end="00:23:05.706" style="s2">himself up from the wreckage. His eyes</p>
<p begin="00:23:04.306" end="00:23:07.306" style="s2">shot through with red and his voice</p>
<p begin="00:23:05.706" end="00:23:08.906" style="s2">scraped raw, but there was something in</p>
<p begin="00:23:07.306" end="00:23:10.706" style="s2">it now beyond rage, something</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.906" end="00:23:12.906" style="s2">dangerously close to desperation.</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.706" end="00:23:14.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Listen to me. Use every private aviation</p>
<p begin="00:23:12.906" end="00:23:16.106" style="s2">resource and every security network the</p>
<p begin="00:23:14.506" end="00:23:17.606" style="s2">Blackwood family has. I want every</p>
<p begin="00:23:16.106" end="00:23:18.606" style="s2">private terminal and border crossing in</p>
<p begin="00:23:17.606" end="00:23:20.106" style="s2">this country locked down.</p>
<p begin="00:23:18.606" end="00:23:21.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He locked eyes with his assistant.</p>
<p begin="00:23:20.106" end="00:23:23.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Track that cab. Pull passenger manifests</p>
<p begin="00:23:21.906" end="00:23:25.306" style="s2">and facial recognition data from every</p>
<p begin="00:23:23.506" end="00:23:26.706" style="s2">transatlantic departure. Search every</p>
<p begin="00:23:25.306" end="00:23:27.006" style="s2">route, every airport name she could have</p>
<p begin="00:23:26.706" end="00:23:28.906" style="s2">used.</p>
<p begin="00:23:27.006" end="00:23:29.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want her found, and I want her found</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.906" end="00:23:30.906" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:23:29.506" end="00:23:32.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After giving the orders, he drove</p>
<p begin="00:23:30.906" end="00:23:33.906" style="s2">straight to the Four Seasons where</p>
<p begin="00:23:32.106" end="00:23:35.806" style="s2">Richard&#39;s family had taken a suite.</p>
<p begin="00:23:33.906" end="00:23:37.506" style="s2">Inside, Richard, Monica, and a shaken,</p>
<p begin="00:23:35.806" end="00:23:39.606" style="s2">pale-faced Clara were still trying to</p>
<p begin="00:23:37.506" end="00:23:41.406" style="s2">recover from the morning&#39;s disasters.</p>
<p begin="00:23:39.606" end="00:23:43.206" style="s2">Damian kicked the door open and walked</p>
<p begin="00:23:41.406" end="00:23:43.806" style="s2">in like something feral, hands raised,</p>
<p begin="00:23:43.206" end="00:23:44.806" style="s2">who scrambled</p>
<p begin="00:23:43.806" end="00:23:46.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please let me explain.</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.806" end="00:23:47.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scarlett refused the marriage herself.</p>
<p begin="00:23:46.306" end="00:23:49.306" style="s2">She voluntarily handed the contract over</p>
<p begin="00:23:47.806" end="00:23:50.906" style="s2">to Clara. We had no choice. Clara is</p>
<p begin="00:23:49.306" end="00:23:52.306" style="s2">gracious, she&#39;s well-behaved, and she is</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.906" end="00:23:53.106" style="s2">far more appropriate for you than that</p>
<p begin="00:23:52.306" end="00:23:54.206" style="s2">reckless Clara.</p>
<p begin="00:23:53.106" end="00:23:56.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She handed it over.</p>
<p begin="00:23:54.206" end="00:23:58.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian laughed. Low and terrible was the</p>
<p begin="00:23:56.706" end="00:24:00.406" style="s2">look you gave something already dead.</p>
<p begin="00:23:58.706" end="00:24:01.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you have any idea what you have done?</p>
<p begin="00:24:00.406" end="00:24:03.106" style="s2">Do you think I am some piece of property</p>
<p begin="00:24:01.606" end="00:24:03.706" style="s2">your family can pass around whenever it</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.106" end="00:24:06.406" style="s2">suits you?</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.706" end="00:24:09.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He overturned the marble coffee table.</p>
<p begin="00:24:06.406" end="00:24:11.206" style="s2">Shards scattered across the carpet.</p>
<p begin="00:24:09.506" end="00:24:13.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There is one woman who carries the name</p>
<p begin="00:24:11.206" end="00:24:15.306" style="s2">Damian Blackwood&#39;s wife. That woman is</p>
<p begin="00:24:13.806" end="00:24:19.606" style="s2">Scarlett, and it has always been</p>
<p begin="00:24:15.306" end="00:24:19.606" style="s2">Scarlett. Now tell me where she is.</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.606" end="00:24:24.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Clara had been terrified from the moment</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.606" end="00:24:26.106" style="s2">Damian walked in.</p>
<p begin="00:24:24.406" end="00:24:28.507" style="s2">But watching him fall apart like this</p>
<p begin="00:24:26.106" end="00:24:30.807" style="s2">over the woman who had run away made her</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.507" end="00:24:33.107" style="s2">envy curdle into something vicious. It</p>
<p begin="00:24:30.807" end="00:24:35.007" style="s2">became stronger than fear. She threw</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.107" end="00:24:36.507" style="s2">herself forward and grabbed the leg of</p>
<p begin="00:24:35.007" end="00:24:38.607" style="s2">his trousers,</p>
<p begin="00:24:36.507" end="00:24:40.607" style="s2">looking up at him with tears streaming</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.607" end="00:24:42.807" style="s2">down her face.</p>
<p begin="00:24:40.607" end="00:24:46.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian, what does she have that I do</p>
<p begin="00:24:42.807" end="00:24:48.007" style="s2">not? I love you more than she ever did.</p>
<p begin="00:24:46.107" end="00:24:49.007" style="s2">I will follow every rule in that family</p>
<p begin="00:24:48.007" end="00:24:52.807" style="s2">code.</p>
<p begin="00:24:49.007" end="00:24:52.807" style="s2">I will be the perfect Mrs. Blackwood.</p>
<p begin="00:24:54.408" end="00:24:57.607" style="s2">Just look at me, please.</p>
<p begin="00:24:56.207" end="00:24:59.107" style="s2">Look at me for once.</p>
<p begin="00:24:57.607" end="00:25:01.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian looked down at her. There was</p>
<p begin="00:24:59.107" end="00:25:03.707" style="s2">nothing in his eyes, not anger, not</p>
<p begin="00:25:01.107" end="00:25:05.408" style="s2">pity, just naked, undisguised disgust.</p>
<p begin="00:25:03.707" end="00:25:06.807" style="s2">He stepped back, then kicked her away</p>
<p begin="00:25:05.408" end="00:25:09.207" style="s2">from him. Clara crashed into the corner</p>
<p begin="00:25:06.807" end="00:25:12.507" style="s2">of the sofa and gasped from the impact.</p>
<p begin="00:25:09.207" end="00:25:14.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do not ever compare yourself to her.</p>
<p begin="00:25:12.507" end="00:25:16.107" style="s2">You do not even get to come close to a</p>
<p begin="00:25:14.107" end="00:25:17.408" style="s2">single hair on her head.</p>
<p begin="00:25:16.107" end="00:25:19.007" style="s2">The only reason you and your entire</p>
<p begin="00:25:17.408" end="00:25:21.007" style="s2">family ever mattered to me was because</p>
<p begin="00:25:19.007" end="00:25:22.507" style="s2">of Scarlett.</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.007" end="00:25:23.908" style="s2">Without her, you are nothing I would</p>
<p begin="00:25:22.507" end="00:25:25.607" style="s2">waste a second looking at.</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.908" end="00:25:26.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He did not stay to hear Richard and</p>
<p begin="00:25:25.607" end="00:25:28.007" style="s2">Monica beg.</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.807" end="00:25:30.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Clara,</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.007" end="00:25:30.207" style="s2">no good.</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.607" end="00:25:34.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He walked out.</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.107" end="00:25:35.908" style="s2">Back at Blackwood Tower, in the top</p>
<p begin="00:25:34.307" end="00:25:37.607" style="s2">floor office,</p>
<p begin="00:25:35.908" end="00:25:39.607" style="s2">he moved through the dark like something</p>
<p begin="00:25:37.607" end="00:25:41.707" style="s2">trapped in a cage,</p>
<p begin="00:25:39.607" end="00:25:43.507" style="s2">pacing because he could not stop and</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.707" end="00:25:45.107" style="s2">could not think.</p>
<p begin="00:25:43.507" end="00:25:46.807" style="s2">Hours later, his assistant came in</p>
<p begin="00:25:45.107" end="00:25:49.207" style="s2">looking worse than before, holding a</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.807" end="00:25:50.507" style="s2">file with both hands.</p>
<p begin="00:25:49.207" end="00:25:52.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, we found new records.</p>
<p begin="00:25:50.507" end="00:25:54.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Vale filed an expedited single</p>
<p begin="00:25:52.707" end="00:25:56.707" style="s2">entry exit visa through a private</p>
<p begin="00:25:54.908" end="00:25:58.408" style="s2">channel one week before the nightclub</p>
<p begin="00:25:56.707" end="00:26:00.707" style="s2">incident.</p>
<p begin="00:25:58.408" end="00:26:02.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One week before the nightclub?</p>
<p begin="00:26:00.707" end="00:26:05.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His feet stopped moving.</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.908" end="00:26:07.707" style="s2">The realization hit him like ice water.</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.807" end="00:26:10.107" style="s2">The nightclub, the dancer, the</p>
<p begin="00:26:07.707" end="00:26:12.908" style="s2">paparazzi, and even the bracelet had all</p>
<p begin="00:26:10.107" end="00:26:15.408" style="s2">been part of the same plan.</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.908" end="00:26:17.707" style="s2">Every time she pushed him, provoked him,</p>
<p begin="00:26:15.408" end="00:26:19.908" style="s2">and refused him,</p>
<p begin="00:26:17.707" end="00:26:21.507" style="s2">it had never been recklessness.</p>
<p begin="00:26:19.908" end="00:26:23.707" style="s2">It had never been a tantrum or some</p>
<p begin="00:26:21.507" end="00:26:25.908" style="s2">desperate game for attention. She had</p>
<p begin="00:26:23.707" end="00:26:27.807" style="s2">planned everything carefully, putting</p>
<p begin="00:26:25.908" end="00:26:30.107" style="s2">every piece in place long before he had</p>
