<p begin="00:26:30.107" end="00:26:35.809" style="s2">She had not stumbled into by accident.</p>
<p begin="00:26:33.409" end="00:26:37.509" style="s2">She had built her escape step by step</p>
<p begin="00:26:35.809" end="00:26:39.709" style="s2">and she had never once intended to come</p>
<p begin="00:26:37.509" end="00:26:39.709" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="00:26:40.509" end="00:26:44.509" style="s2">Damian braced himself against his desk,</p>
