<p begin="00:26:50.309" end="00:26:56.009" style="s2">His stomach twisted violently and regret</p>
<p begin="00:26:53.109" end="00:26:57.809" style="s2">hit him so hard it felt almost physical.</p>
<p begin="00:26:56.009" end="00:27:00.009" style="s2">He suddenly remembered how different I</p>
<p begin="00:26:57.809" end="00:27:02.009" style="s2">had been during those days. I had</p>
