<p begin="00:27:02.009" end="00:27:06.109" style="s2">again. I told him I was not marrying</p>
<p begin="00:27:04.009" end="00:27:07.509" style="s2">him. I told him we were done.</p>
<p begin="00:27:06.109" end="00:27:09.609" style="s2">Back then he had thought it was just a</p>
