<p begin="00:27:09.609" end="00:27:13.809" style="s2">thought all he had to do was snap a</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.309" end="00:27:16.509" style="s2">tracking bracelet around my wrist, lock</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.809" end="00:27:18.509" style="s2">me up for a few days, force me to sign a</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.509" end="00:27:21.609" style="s2">public statement, and I would stay</p>
<p begin="00:27:18.509" end="00:27:24.309" style="s2">trapped inside that beautiful cage. But</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.609" end="00:27:27.009" style="s2">the truth was that I had already decided</p>
<p begin="00:27:24.309" end="00:27:28.709" style="s2">I did not want him anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.009" end="00:27:30.209" style="s2">Was it the insane family code that had</p>
<p begin="00:27:28.709" end="00:27:31.809" style="s2">driven me away?</p>
<p begin="00:27:30.209" end="00:27:35.109" style="s2">Was it the way he kept taking Clara&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.809" end="00:27:36.709" style="s2">side and blaming me every single time?</p>
<p begin="00:27:35.109" end="00:27:38.809" style="s2">Or was it the simple fact that he had</p>
