<p begin="00:27:38.809" end="00:27:43.309" style="s2">The question spread through Damian&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.509" end="00:27:46.309" style="s2">mind like poison, but none of it changed</p>
<p begin="00:27:43.309" end="00:27:48.209" style="s2">the only thing he cared about now.</p>
<p begin="00:27:46.309" end="00:27:50.309" style="s2">No matter what it took,</p>
<p begin="00:27:48.209" end="00:27:52.909" style="s2">even if he had to use every dirty trick</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.309" end="00:27:54.209" style="s2">the Blackwood family had, he had to get</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.909" end="00:27:56.309" style="s2">me back.</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.209" end="00:27:58.109" style="s2">Even if I hated him, even if I resented</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.309" end="00:28:00.109" style="s2">him, even if I made him suffer for the</p>
<p begin="00:27:58.109" end="00:28:03.509" style="s2">rest of his life, he was going to keep</p>
<p begin="00:28:00.109" end="00:28:03.509" style="s2">me by his side forever.</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.509" end="00:28:07.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep searching. Don&#39;t stop until you</p>
<p begin="00:28:06.309" end="00:28:09.009" style="s2">find it.</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.109" end="00:28:10.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He told him to use every connection the</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.009" end="00:28:13.109" style="s2">Blackwood family had,</p>
<p begin="00:28:10.909" end="00:28:16.009" style="s2">from finance circles to private security</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.109" end="00:28:17.409" style="s2">networks. He did not care what it cost.</p>
<p begin="00:28:16.009" end="00:28:21.509" style="s2">He did not care who they had to</p>
