<p begin="00:28:33.310" end="00:28:38.010" style="s2">find. Anxiety burned through Damian&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:28:35.810" end="00:28:39.910" style="s2">nerves every second of every day. Since</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.010" end="00:28:41.410" style="s2">he could not take that rage out on me,</p>
<p begin="00:28:39.910" end="00:28:44.510" style="s2">he poured all of it onto the already</p>
<p begin="00:28:41.410" end="00:28:44.510" style="s2">broken Vale family.</p>
<p begin="00:28:45.910" end="00:28:48.910" style="s2">Blackwood Group launched a full-scale</p>
<p begin="00:28:47.610" end="00:28:50.310" style="s2">commercial attack on the Vale</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.910" end="00:28:52.610" style="s2">businesses. Their methods were</p>
<p begin="00:28:50.310" end="00:28:55.110" style="s2">merciless, and they left no room for</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.610" end="00:28:57.910" style="s2">survival. The Vale company had already</p>
<p begin="00:28:55.110" end="00:29:00.110" style="s2">been falling apart. Within two weeks,</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.910" end="00:29:02.410" style="s2">its assets were liquidated, its stock</p>
<p begin="00:29:00.110" end="00:29:05.410" style="s2">price collapsed, and bankruptcy was</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.410" end="00:29:05.410" style="s2">waiting at the door.</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.010" end="00:29:13.210" style="s2">Richard was completely losing his mind.</p>
