<p begin="00:29:17.310" end="00:29:21.910" style="s2">the ground floor. After the bankruptcy,</p>
<p begin="00:29:20.010" end="00:29:24.910" style="s2">Clara became the easiest target for</p>
<p begin="00:29:21.910" end="00:29:24.910" style="s2">Damian&#39;s despair.</p>
<p begin="00:29:26.510" end="00:29:31.210" style="s2">She could not accept it.</p>
<p begin="00:29:29.110" end="00:29:33.110" style="s2">She kept trying to use the media to get</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.210" end="00:29:34.910" style="s2">Damian&#39;s attention. She even stood</p>
<p begin="00:29:33.110" end="00:29:36.610" style="s2">outside Blackwood Tower in the pouring</p>
