<p begin="00:29:44.110" end="00:29:47.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Clara pressed her face against the</p>
<p begin="00:29:45.610" end="00:29:49.910" style="s2">rain-streaked window, crying so hard she</p>
<p begin="00:29:47.910" end="00:29:51.810" style="s2">could barely speak.</p>
<p begin="00:29:49.910" end="00:29:54.510" style="s2">She begged Damian to stop destroying the</p>
