<p begin="00:30:05.910" end="00:30:11.210" style="s2">the stubble along his jaw. He did not</p>
<p begin="00:30:08.010" end="00:30:11.210" style="s2">even give her a proper look.</p>
<p begin="00:30:12.310" end="00:30:15.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get her out of my way.</p>
<p begin="00:30:17.410" end="00:30:21.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The guards got out and dragged Clara</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.310" end="00:30:24.210" style="s2">away like she was nothing, ignoring her</p>
<p begin="00:30:21.510" end="00:30:24.210" style="s2">screams.</p>
<p begin="00:30:24.810" end="00:30:29.910" style="s2">The limousine drove off, leaving Clara</p>
