<p begin="00:30:35.010" end="00:30:40.312" style="s2">He He relying on heavy doses of sleeping</p>
<p begin="00:30:37.312" end="00:30:42.412" style="s2">pills just to get a few hours of rest.</p>
<p begin="00:30:40.312" end="00:30:45.612" style="s2">But every time he fell asleep, the same</p>
