<p begin="00:32:25.612" end="00:32:30.712" style="s2">Another week passed.</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.112" end="00:32:32.712" style="s2">The thick curtains were drawn shut.</p>
<p begin="00:32:30.712" end="00:32:33.812" style="s2">The ashtrays were overflowing with cigar</p>
