<p begin="00:33:06.313" end="00:33:09.513" style="s2">He swallowed hard before speaking.</p>
<p begin="00:33:08.613" end="00:33:11.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir,</p>
<p begin="00:33:09.513" end="00:33:13.313" style="s2">we have new information.</p>
<p begin="00:33:11.413" end="00:33:14.813" style="s2">We cross-checked blurry facial matches</p>
<p begin="00:33:13.313" end="00:33:16.513" style="s2">from every non-standard exit channel</p>
<p begin="00:33:14.813" end="00:33:18.113" style="s2">over the past three months.</p>
<p begin="00:33:16.513" end="00:33:19.313" style="s2">We found someone who looks a lot like</p>
<p begin="00:33:18.113" end="00:33:21.713" style="s2">Ms. Vale.</p>
<p begin="00:33:19.313" end="00:33:23.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian&#39;s head snapped up. His bloodshot</p>
<p begin="00:33:21.713" end="00:33:24.713" style="s2">eyes locked onto the assistant like a</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.413" end="00:33:26.413" style="s2">starving wolf.</p>
<p begin="00:33:24.713" end="00:33:28.213" style="s2">The assistant quickly continued.</p>
<p begin="00:33:26.413" end="00:33:31.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She appeared in the transit area of</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.213" end="00:33:31.713" style="s2">Heathrow Airport in London.</p>
<p begin="00:33:32.013" end="00:33:37.113" style="s2">The timing matches. It was three days</p>
<p begin="00:33:34.013" end="00:33:37.113" style="s2">after the mansion exploded.</p>
<p begin="00:33:38.213" end="00:33:42.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian grabbed the classified file from</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.013" end="00:33:44.313" style="s2">his assistant, his fingers shaking so</p>
<p begin="00:33:42.213" end="00:33:46.413" style="s2">badly from desperation and excitement</p>
<p begin="00:33:44.313" end="00:33:48.213" style="s2">that he could barely hold it steady. He</p>
<p begin="00:33:46.413" end="00:33:49.313" style="s2">stared at the enlarged surveillance</p>
<p begin="00:33:48.213" end="00:33:51.413" style="s2">photo.</p>
<p begin="00:33:49.313" end="00:33:53.313" style="s2">The image was blurry, but it showed</p>
<p begin="00:33:51.413" end="00:33:55.213" style="s2">someone in a coat walking towards a</p>
<p begin="00:33:53.313" end="00:33:56.713" style="s2">quieter boarding gate with a small</p>
<p begin="00:33:55.213" end="00:33:58.813" style="s2">suitcase.</p>
<p begin="00:33:56.713" end="00:34:01.113" style="s2">The figure was familiar enough to burn</p>
<p begin="00:33:58.813" end="00:34:02.413" style="s2">through his bones. He knew it was a new</p>
<p begin="00:34:01.113" end="00:34:04.013" style="s2">lead on me.</p>
<p begin="00:34:02.413" end="00:34:05.513" style="s2">Hope lit up the near extinguished</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.013" end="00:34:08.413" style="s2">madness in his eyes like the last</p>
<p begin="00:34:05.513" end="00:34:10.413" style="s2">lifeline thrown to a drowning man.</p>
<p begin="00:34:08.413" end="00:34:12.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where was the connecting flight going?</p>
<p begin="00:34:10.413" end="00:34:14.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We are still working on it.</p>
<p begin="00:34:12.213" end="00:34:15.513" style="s2">Heathrow transit records are complicated</p>
<p begin="00:34:14.313" end="00:34:17.013" style="s2">and she seems to have avoided the major</p>
<p begin="00:34:15.513" end="00:34:18.413" style="s2">national flights that required stricter</p>
<p begin="00:34:17.013" end="00:34:20.113" style="s2">identity checks.</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.413" end="00:34:21.613" style="s2">She chose smaller, cheaper airlines that</p>
<p begin="00:34:20.113" end="00:34:25.213" style="s2">attracted less attention.</p>
<p begin="00:34:21.613" end="00:34:25.213" style="s2">It will take time. We do not have time.</p>
<p begin="00:34:26.213" end="00:34:28.913" style="s2">Get the jet ready. We are leaving for</p>
<p begin="00:34:27.913" end="00:34:31.113" style="s2">Heathrow right now.</p>
<p begin="00:34:28.913" end="00:34:32.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir. Sir, the Federal Reserve Board</p>
<p begin="00:34:31.113" end="00:34:33.713" style="s2">meeting is this afternoon.</p>
<p begin="00:34:32.613" end="00:34:35.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cancel it.</p>
<p begin="00:34:33.713" end="00:34:36.613" style="s2">Cancel everything. Nothing matters more</p>
<p begin="00:34:35.613" end="00:34:38.213" style="s2">than finding her.</p>
<p begin="00:34:36.613" end="00:34:39.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Three hours later, the Blackwood</p>
<p begin="00:34:38.213" end="00:34:41.714" style="s2">family&#39;s private jet tore through the</p>
<p begin="00:34:39.913" end="00:34:43.914" style="s2">clouds above Manhattan and landed at</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.714" end="00:34:45.814" style="s2">Heathrow Airport in London. The plane</p>
<p begin="00:34:43.914" end="00:34:47.714" style="s2">had not even fully stopped before Damian</p>
<p begin="00:34:45.814" end="00:34:49.414" style="s2">was already opening the door. He could</p>
<p begin="00:34:47.714" end="00:34:51.614" style="s2">not wait for the stairs to lower all the</p>
<p begin="00:34:49.414" end="00:34:53.214" style="s2">way and jump down. His tie was crooked,</p>
<p begin="00:34:51.614" end="00:34:55.314" style="s2">his shirt collar was torn open, and deep</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.214" end="00:34:56.914" style="s2">circles shadowed his eyes. Messy stubble</p>
<p begin="00:34:55.314" end="00:34:59.114" style="s2">covered his jaw. He looked nothing like</p>
<p begin="00:34:56.914" end="00:35:00.814" style="s2">the perfectly dressed, untouchable CEO</p>
<p begin="00:34:59.114" end="00:35:02.414" style="s2">he used to be. Damian repeated the city</p>
<p begin="00:35:00.814" end="00:35:04.414" style="s2">name under his breath as he ran through</p>
<p begin="00:35:02.414" end="00:35:07.114" style="s2">the crowded airport, his sharp eyes</p>
<p begin="00:35:04.414" end="00:35:08.814" style="s2">scanning every woman he passed. Finally,</p>
<p begin="00:35:07.114" end="00:35:11.614" style="s2">he saw the boarding gate just as it was</p>
<p begin="00:35:08.814" end="00:35:11.614" style="s2">about to close.</p>
<p begin="00:35:11.814" end="00:35:15.714" style="s2">Damian&#39;s eyes locked onto the end of the</p>
<p begin="00:35:13.614" end="00:35:17.814" style="s2">boarding line. The slender figure in a</p>
<p begin="00:35:15.714" end="00:35:19.414" style="s2">cream linen dress, wide-brimmed hat, and</p>
<p begin="00:35:17.814" end="00:35:21.814" style="s2">sunglasses was the woman he had been</p>
<p begin="00:35:19.414" end="00:35:23.114" style="s2">hunting for an entire month.</p>
<p begin="00:35:21.814" end="00:35:25.014" style="s2">Scarlett.</p>
<p begin="00:35:23.114" end="00:35:26.514" style="s2">He ran toward her, not caring that</p>
<p begin="00:35:25.014" end="00:35:27.614" style="s2">travelers around him were staring in</p>
<p begin="00:35:26.514" end="00:35:29.314" style="s2">shock.</p>
<p begin="00:35:27.614" end="00:35:33.814" style="s2">He grabbed my wrist and held on like his</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.314" end="00:35:33.814" style="s2">life depended on it. My body went stiff.</p>
<p begin="00:35:35.414" end="00:35:39.014" style="s2">Let go of me, Mr. Blackwood.</p>
<p begin="00:35:37.514" end="00:35:41.214" style="s2">Grabbing a woman in public like this is</p>
<p begin="00:35:39.014" end="00:35:43.114" style="s2">not very appropriate, is it? I thought</p>
<p begin="00:35:41.214" end="00:35:45.214" style="s2">your precious family code cared about</p>
<p begin="00:35:43.114" end="00:35:47.814" style="s2">appearances. The cold sarcasm in my</p>
<p begin="00:35:45.214" end="00:35:49.614" style="s2">voice hit Damian like ice water, but he</p>
<p begin="00:35:47.814" end="00:35:52.814" style="s2">did not care anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:35:49.614" end="00:35:55.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scarlett, come back with me. Please.</p>
<p begin="00:35:52.814" end="00:35:58.114" style="s2">I know I was wrong. I screwed up. I will</p>
<p begin="00:35:55.014" end="00:36:00.314" style="s2">fix it. Just come home with me.</p>
<p begin="00:35:58.114" end="00:36:03.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I laughed and pried his fingers off me</p>
<p begin="00:36:00.314" end="00:36:03.114" style="s2">one by one.</p>
<p begin="00:36:03.514" end="00:36:07.714" style="s2">Come back to what?</p>
<p begin="00:36:04.914" end="00:36:09.114" style="s2">That cage with 3,000 stupid rules?</p>
<p begin="00:36:07.714" end="00:36:12.114" style="s2">Am I supposed to go back and play Mrs.</p>
<p begin="00:36:09.114" end="00:36:14.614" style="s2">Blackwood again? His face turned paler.</p>
<p begin="00:36:12.114" end="00:36:16.114" style="s2">I looked at him with open disgust.</p>
<p begin="00:36:14.614" end="00:36:17.614" style="s2">Did you forget your perfect bride is</p>
<p begin="00:36:16.114" end="00:36:19.314" style="s2">Clara now?</p>
<p begin="00:36:17.614" end="00:36:20.714" style="s2">Your sweet, sensible little bride is</p>
<p begin="00:36:19.314" end="00:36:22.314" style="s2">waiting for you.</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.714" end="00:36:24.514" style="s2">Chasing your ex-fiancée through an</p>
<p begin="00:36:22.314" end="00:36:26.114" style="s2">airport is a bad look, Damian. The man</p>
<p begin="00:36:24.514" end="00:36:27.614" style="s2">who had once been Manhattan&#39;s coldest</p>
<p begin="00:36:26.114" end="00:36:29.014" style="s2">and most untouchable heir fell to his</p>
<p begin="00:36:27.614" end="00:36:30.914" style="s2">knees in that foreign airport,</p>
<p begin="00:36:29.014" end="00:36:32.614" style="s2">surrounded by cameras and strangers,</p>
<p begin="00:36:30.914" end="00:36:34.214" style="s2">looking smaller than dirt.</p>
<p begin="00:36:32.614" end="00:36:35.314" style="s2">Damian looked up at me, and tears</p>
<p begin="00:36:34.214" end="00:36:37.214" style="s2">finally broke through.</p>
<p begin="00:36:35.314" end="00:36:39.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The wedding did not count. I never</p>
<p begin="00:36:37.214" end="00:36:41.414" style="s2">wanted her. I do not care about the</p>
<p begin="00:36:39.314" end="00:36:43.214" style="s2">family code anymore. If you come back</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.414" end="00:36:45.216" style="s2">with me, you You do whatever you want. I</p>
<p begin="00:36:43.214" end="00:36:46.316" style="s2">will agree to anything. Just do not</p>
<p begin="00:36:45.216" end="00:36:48.016" style="s2">leave me like this.</p>
<p begin="00:36:46.316" end="00:36:49.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I took a step back as if avoiding</p>
<p begin="00:36:48.016" end="00:36:52.516" style="s2">something filthy.</p>
<p begin="00:36:49.916" end="00:36:54.716" style="s2">Your apology came too late.</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.516" end="00:36:56.916" style="s2">And honestly I do not need it. Then I</p>
<p begin="00:36:54.716" end="00:36:58.716" style="s2">turned around, handed my boarding pass</p>
<p begin="00:36:56.916" end="00:37:00.116" style="s2">to the gate agent and walked straight</p>
<p begin="00:36:58.716" end="00:37:02.916" style="s2">into the jet bridge with my back</p>
<p begin="00:37:00.116" end="00:37:04.816" style="s2">straight. Damian tried to follow, but</p>
<p begin="00:37:02.916" end="00:37:05.916" style="s2">airport security and his assistant held</p>
<p begin="00:37:04.816" end="00:37:07.216" style="s2">him back.</p>
<p begin="00:37:05.916" end="00:37:09.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scarlett!</p>
<p begin="00:37:07.216" end="00:37:11.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He screamed my name toward the closing</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.116" end="00:37:13.516" style="s2">door, sounding like a man being torn</p>
<p begin="00:37:11.016" end="00:37:13.516" style="s2">apart.</p>
<p begin="00:37:15.616" end="00:37:19.616" style="s2">Three months later in Monaco, inside the</p>
<p begin="00:37:17.716" end="00:37:20.916" style="s2">Monte Carlo Casino, money and desire</p>
<p begin="00:37:19.616" end="00:37:22.916" style="s2">blurred together under the glittering</p>
<p begin="00:37:20.916" end="00:37:25.016" style="s2">lights. The sound of poker chips never</p>
<p begin="00:37:22.916" end="00:37:26.816" style="s2">stopped. At a crowded baccarat table,</p>
<p begin="00:37:25.016" end="00:37:28.116" style="s2">every man nearby had his eyes fixed on</p>
<p begin="00:37:26.816" end="00:37:30.516" style="s2">the woman sitting across from the</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.116" end="00:37:30.516" style="s2">dealer.</p>
<p begin="00:37:31.116" end="00:37:35.716" style="s2">That woman was me.</p>
<p begin="00:37:33.316" end="00:37:38.416" style="s2">I wore a black silk slip dress with thin</p>
<p begin="00:37:35.716" end="00:37:41.016" style="s2">straps and a high clip that revealed my</p>
<p begin="00:37:38.416" end="00:37:43.216" style="s2">pale ankles and silver heels. The next</p>
<p begin="00:37:41.016" end="00:37:44.916" style="s2">round of cards came out. I barely</p>
<p begin="00:37:43.216" end="00:37:48.116" style="s2">glanced at my hand before tapping my</p>
<p begin="00:37:44.916" end="00:37:48.816" style="s2">fingers lightly on the table.</p>
<p begin="00:37:48.116" end="00:37:51.116" style="s2">Raise.</p>
<p begin="00:37:48.816" end="00:37:52.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Player wins.</p>
<p begin="00:37:51.116" end="00:37:53.816" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then he pushed a mountain of chips</p>
<p begin="00:37:52.616" end="00:37:55.616" style="s2">toward me.</p>
<p begin="00:37:53.816" end="00:37:57.716" style="s2">The crowd around us broke into amazed</p>
<p begin="00:37:55.616" end="00:38:00.316" style="s2">whispers. They said the socialite from</p>
<p begin="00:37:57.716" end="00:38:01.916" style="s2">New York had won seven hands in a row.</p>
<p begin="00:38:00.316" end="00:38:03.616" style="s2">They said my psychological game was</p>
<p begin="00:38:01.916" end="00:38:05.516" style="s2">terrifying.</p>
<p begin="00:38:03.616" end="00:38:08.316" style="s2">I took a sip of champagne and almost</p>
<p begin="00:38:05.516" end="00:38:10.116" style="s2">laughed at the irony. This was not luck.</p>
<p begin="00:38:08.316" end="00:38:12.516" style="s2">It was probability, statistics, and</p>
<p begin="00:38:10.116" end="00:38:13.816" style="s2">psychology, all the things Damian had</p>
<p begin="00:38:12.516" end="00:38:16.416" style="s2">once forced me to learn so I could</p>
<p begin="00:38:13.816" end="00:38:17.616" style="s2">become the perfect high society wife.</p>
<p begin="00:38:16.416" end="00:38:19.116" style="s2">I never thought those lessons would</p>
<p begin="00:38:17.616" end="00:38:21.116" style="s2">become my best weapon for burning</p>
<p begin="00:38:19.116" end="00:38:23.016" style="s2">through money in a place like this. Just</p>
<p begin="00:38:21.116" end="00:38:25.116" style="s2">as I was about to place another bet, a</p>
<p begin="00:38:23.016" end="00:38:27.416" style="s2">drunk local heir named Charles shoved</p>
<p begin="00:38:25.116" end="00:38:29.316" style="s2">through the crowd. His face was red from</p>
<p begin="00:38:27.416" end="00:38:30.616" style="s2">losing too much money and he reeked of</p>
<p begin="00:38:29.316" end="00:38:33.116" style="s2">alcohol.</p>
<p begin="00:38:30.616" end="00:38:34.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come play with me tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.116" end="00:38:36.616" style="s2">I will split my winnings with you.</p>
<p begin="00:38:34.916" end="00:38:38.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Before his hand could touch me, I</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.616" end="00:38:40.816" style="s2">stepped back and lifted my right foot in</p>
<p begin="00:38:38.416" end="00:38:42.316" style="s2">its 7 cm heel.</p>
<p begin="00:38:40.816" end="00:38:44.116" style="s2">I was about to leave with my chip card</p>
<p begin="00:38:42.316" end="00:38:45.716" style="s2">when the crowd suddenly parted. A young</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.116" end="00:38:47.517" style="s2">mixed-race man walked toward me with his</p>
<p begin="00:38:45.716" end="00:38:49.217" style="s2">hands in his pockets. He wore a black</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.517" end="00:38:50.617" style="s2">suit with the top three buttons undone,</p>
<p begin="00:38:49.217" end="00:38:51.917" style="s2">looking relaxed and arrogant in a way</p>
<p begin="00:38:50.617" end="00:38:53.517" style="s2">that came naturally to men who had never</p>
<p begin="00:38:51.917" end="00:38:55.017" style="s2">been told no. A limited edition watch</p>
<p begin="00:38:53.517" end="00:38:57.817" style="s2">gleamed on his wrist.</p>
<p begin="00:38:55.017" end="00:38:59.617" style="s2">It was Nathaniel.</p>
<p begin="00:38:57.817" end="00:39:01.217" style="s2">Nathaniel had an unlit cigar between his</p>
<p begin="00:38:59.617" end="00:39:02.817" style="s2">lips. He used the polished tip of his</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.217" end="00:39:04.417" style="s2">shoe to nudge Charles, who was still</p>
<p begin="00:39:02.817" end="00:39:05.817" style="s2">curled up on the floor groaning. His</p>
<p begin="00:39:04.417" end="00:39:07.317" style="s2">expression was pure contempt.</p>
<p begin="00:39:05.817" end="00:39:09.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You put your hands on someone I am</p>
<p begin="00:39:07.317" end="00:39:11.417" style="s2">interested in in my casino. That is not</p>
<p begin="00:39:09.617" end="00:39:14.617" style="s2">flirting, Charles.</p>
<p begin="00:39:11.417" end="00:39:14.617" style="s2">That is a death wish.</p>
<p begin="00:39:14.917" end="00:39:18.917" style="s2">If I ever see you near her again, what</p>
<p begin="00:39:16.817" end="00:39:20.117" style="s2">she broke tonight will be the least of</p>
<p begin="00:39:18.917" end="00:39:21.517" style="s2">your problems.</p>
<p begin="00:39:20.117" end="00:39:23.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Charles scrambled away with the help of</p>
<p begin="00:39:21.517" end="00:39:25.717" style="s2">his friends, too scared to look back.</p>
<p begin="00:39:23.617" end="00:39:27.517" style="s2">Then Nathaniel turned to me. His deep,</p>
<p begin="00:39:25.717" end="00:39:29.217" style="s2">flirtatious eyes landed on mine, and he</p>
<p begin="00:39:27.517" end="00:39:31.217" style="s2">did not bother hiding his interest. He</p>
<p begin="00:39:29.217" end="00:39:32.617" style="s2">stepped forward naturally, slid one arm</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.217" end="00:39:33.917" style="s2">around my waist, and pulled me closer</p>
<p begin="00:39:32.617" end="00:39:36.017" style="s2">with a confidence that was almost</p>
<p begin="00:39:33.917" end="00:39:38.317" style="s2">insulting. His hold was intimate,</p>
<p begin="00:39:36.017" end="00:39:40.317" style="s2">possessive, and far too practiced. My</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.317" end="00:39:41.917" style="s2">body tensed, and I tried to pull away,</p>
<p begin="00:39:40.317" end="00:39:43.717" style="s2">but his arm stayed relaxed while still</p>
<p begin="00:39:41.917" end="00:39:45.817" style="s2">leaving no room to escape. He lowered</p>
<p begin="00:39:43.717" end="00:39:47.517" style="s2">his head close to my ear, his warm</p>
<p begin="00:39:45.817" end="00:39:49.117" style="s2">breath brushing my skin.</p>
<p begin="00:39:47.517" end="00:39:51.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have been watching the little wildcat</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.117" end="00:39:52.317" style="s2">from New York for a while now. Those</p>
<p begin="00:39:51.117" end="00:39:54.117" style="s2">claws are impressive.</p>
<p begin="00:39:52.317" end="00:39:55.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then he lifted his head and announced it</p>
<p begin="00:39:54.117" end="00:39:57.517" style="s2">to the whole casino with the kenless</p>
<p begin="00:39:55.617" end="00:39:59.317" style="s2">arrogance of a spoiled playboy.</p>
<p begin="00:39:57.517" end="00:40:02.567" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian Blackwood was blind enough not to</p>
<p begin="00:39:59.317" end="00:40:03.417" style="s2">want her. Lucky me, because I do.</p>
<p begin="00:40:02.567" end="00:40:05.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:40:03.417" end="00:40:07.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Monaco socialites watching from</p>
<p begin="00:40:05.017" end="00:40:09.317" style="s2">nearby immediately started buzzing with</p>
<p begin="00:40:07.017" end="00:40:11.617" style="s2">gossip. Everyone knew Nathaniel had</p>
<p begin="00:40:09.317" end="00:40:13.517" style="s2">impossibly high standards, and now he</p>
<p begin="00:40:11.617" end="00:40:14.717" style="s2">was publicly chasing a runaway bride</p>
<p begin="00:40:13.517" end="00:40:17.017" style="s2">from New York.</p>
<p begin="00:40:14.717" end="00:40:20.417" style="s2">I looked up at him, met his burning</p>
<p begin="00:40:17.017" end="00:40:22.617" style="s2">gaze, and smiled.</p>
<p begin="00:40:20.417" end="00:40:24.417" style="s2">I appreciate the offer,</p>
<p begin="00:40:22.617" end="00:40:26.517" style="s2">but do I look like I need a man to get</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.417" end="00:40:28.617" style="s2">whatever I want? Nathaniel did not get</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.517" end="00:40:30.817" style="s2">angry. Instead, he pulled me a little</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.617" end="00:40:32.917" style="s2">closer, and the admiration in his eyes</p>
<p begin="00:40:30.817" end="00:40:35.317" style="s2">almost overflowed.</p>
<p begin="00:40:32.917" end="00:40:38.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That mouth of yours is dangerous.</p>
<p begin="00:40:35.317" end="00:40:38.717" style="s2">I like dangerous.</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.817" end="00:40:43.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I stayed in Monaco for a while, and</p>
<p begin="00:40:41.417" end="00:40:44.717" style="s2">Nathaniel kept his word. He pursued me</p>
<p begin="00:40:43.317" end="00:40:46.517" style="s2">loudly, aggressively, and with</p>
<p begin="00:40:44.717" end="00:40:47.617" style="s2">absolutely no shame. The next morning, a</p>
<p begin="00:40:46.517" end="00:40:49.017" style="s2">limited edition bright yellow</p>
<p begin="00:40:47.617" end="00:40:50.218" style="s2">Lamborghini was parked outside my</p>
<p begin="00:40:49.017" end="00:40:51.718" style="s2">apartment building. The keys were</p>
<p begin="00:40:50.218" end="00:40:53.318" style="s2">delivered with a card written in messy</p>
<p begin="00:40:51.718" end="00:40:55.318" style="s2">handwriting. It was just a way to get</p>
<p begin="00:40:53.318" end="00:40:57.118" style="s2">around. If you crash it, I will pay for</p>
<p begin="00:40:55.318" end="00:40:58.518" style="s2">it. A few days later, he rented a</p>
<p begin="00:40:57.118" end="00:40:59.818" style="s2">massive luxury yacht and threw an</p>
<p begin="00:40:58.518" end="00:41:03.718" style="s2">extravagant party on the water,</p>
<p begin="00:40:59.818" end="00:41:03.718" style="s2">insisting that I be the center of it.</p>
<p begin="00:41:07.318" end="00:41:11.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have fun anywhere you want.</p>
<p begin="00:41:09.518" end="00:41:14.118" style="s2">Use my name if anyone gets in your way.</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.918" end="00:41:16.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He took me skydiving, deep sea diving,</p>
<p begin="00:41:14.118" end="00:41:17.718" style="s2">and even snuck us onto an F1 track to</p>
<p begin="00:41:16.018" end="00:41:19.618" style="s2">race cars in the middle of the night. He</p>
<p begin="00:41:17.718" end="00:41:20.918" style="s2">did every crazy, dangerous, reckless</p>
<p begin="00:41:19.618" end="00:41:22.918" style="s2">thing with me, and none of it had</p>
<p begin="00:41:20.918" end="00:41:24.918" style="s2">anything to do with family codes, rules,</p>
<p begin="00:41:22.918" end="00:41:26.518" style="s2">or proper behavior. What got to me most</p>
<p begin="00:41:24.918" end="00:41:28.518" style="s2">was that he never asked me to be gentle,</p>
<p begin="00:41:26.518" end="00:41:30.218" style="s2">quiet, or obedient. He never wanted me</p>
<p begin="00:41:28.518" end="00:41:32.918" style="s2">to behave. Whenever I pushed a race car</p>
<p begin="00:41:30.218" end="00:41:34.518" style="s2">up to 200 mph, showing every wild edge I</p>
<p begin="00:41:32.918" end="00:41:35.918" style="s2">had, he sat in the passenger seat,</p>
<p begin="00:41:34.518" end="00:41:37.718" style="s2">whistling and cheering like he had never</p>
<p begin="00:41:35.918" end="00:41:40.118" style="s2">seen anything better. After we landed on</p>
<p begin="00:41:37.718" end="00:41:41.718" style="s2">the soft sand from a 10,000 m skydive,</p>
<p begin="00:41:40.118" end="00:41:43.218" style="s2">Nathaniel pulled off his goggles. His</p>
<p begin="00:41:41.718" end="00:41:44.518" style="s2">hair was a mess, and he was smoking a</p>
<p begin="00:41:43.218" end="00:41:45.818" style="s2">cigarette while looking at my flushed</p>
<p begin="00:41:44.518" end="00:41:46.918" style="s2">face with a chalky smile.</p>
<p begin="00:41:45.818" end="00:41:49.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is how you are supposed to live,</p>
<p begin="00:41:46.918" end="00:41:50.618" style="s2">Scarlett. Wild, loud, and impossible to</p>
<p begin="00:41:49.218" end="00:41:52.118" style="s2">leash. It suits you a hell of a lot</p>
<p begin="00:41:50.618" end="00:41:52.918" style="s2">better than playing some polished fake</p>
<p begin="00:41:52.118" end="00:41:54.718" style="s2">heiress in New York.</p>
<p begin="00:41:52.918" end="00:41:56.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looking at this loud, arrogant man, I</p>
<p begin="00:41:54.718" end="00:41:57.918" style="s2">felt something inside me start to</p>
<p begin="00:41:56.018" end="00:41:59.918" style="s2">loosen. A frozen part of my heart,</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.918" end="00:42:01.418" style="s2">locked away by Damian for two lifetimes,</p>
<p begin="00:41:59.918" end="00:42:03.118" style="s2">began to thaw just a little. When I was</p>
<p begin="00:42:01.418" end="00:42:04.618" style="s2">with Daniel, I did not have to pretend.</p>
<p begin="00:42:03.118" end="00:42:06.618" style="s2">I did not have to be careful. I could</p>
<p begin="00:42:04.618" end="00:42:08.318" style="s2">let every sharp edge show. One night, we</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.618" end="00:42:09.718" style="s2">were playing a huge game of Texas Hold</p>
<p begin="00:42:08.318" end="00:42:11.618" style="s2">&#39;Em at a private club, and I had lost</p>
<p begin="00:42:09.718" end="00:42:12.918" style="s2">several hands in a row. I was hesitating</p>
<p begin="00:42:11.618" end="00:42:14.518" style="s2">over whether to call the bet when</p>
<p begin="00:42:12.918" end="00:42:15.518" style="s2">Nathaniel lazily pushed more than half</p>
<p begin="00:42:14.518" end="00:42:17.618" style="s2">of his chips towards me.</p>
<p begin="00:42:15.518" end="00:42:20.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Call it. Do not get scared now. If you</p>
<p begin="00:42:17.618" end="00:42:21.118" style="s2">lose, it is on me. If you win,</p>
<p begin="00:42:20.318" end="00:42:22.718" style="s2">it&#39;s your fun money.</p>
<p begin="00:42:21.118" end="00:42:24.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; On the way home that night, with the</p>
<p begin="00:42:22.718" end="00:42:26.218" style="s2">wind blowing through the car, he was</p>
<p begin="00:42:24.518" end="00:42:30.218" style="s2">quiet for once.</p>
<p begin="00:42:26.218" end="00:42:34.218" style="s2">Then he said something I did not expect.</p>
<p begin="00:42:30.218" end="00:42:34.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know, we met a long time ago.</p>
<p begin="00:42:36.518" end="00:42:42.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I turned my head in surprise and looked</p>
<p begin="00:42:38.618" end="00:42:42.018" style="s2">at his handsome profile.</p>
<p begin="00:42:43.218" end="00:42:46.918" style="s2">Nathaniel kept his eyes on the road and</p>
<p begin="00:42:45.218" end="00:42:50.218" style="s2">let out a bitter laugh.</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.918" end="00:42:52.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Years ago, at a horse track in New York,</p>
<p begin="00:42:50.218" end="00:42:54.320" style="s2">you You 18.</p>
<p begin="00:42:52.318" end="00:42:56.020" style="s2">Richard brought Monica and Clara there</p>
<p begin="00:42:54.320" end="00:42:57.820" style="s2">to embarrass you in front of half the</p>
<p begin="00:42:56.020" end="00:43:00.820" style="s2">social crowded.</p>
<p begin="00:42:57.820" end="00:43:00.820" style="s2">Do you remember what you did?</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.020" end="00:43:04.020" style="s2">You jumped your horse over the highest</p>
<p begin="00:43:02.520" end="00:43:06.020" style="s2">obstacle and beat the guy who had been</p>
<p begin="00:43:04.020" end="00:43:07.820" style="s2">looking down on you all day.</p>
<p begin="00:43:06.020" end="00:43:09.720" style="s2">You were sitting on that horse, laughing</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.820" end="00:43:12.220" style="s2">like you owned the whole world, loud,</p>
<p begin="00:43:09.720" end="00:43:14.220" style="s2">arrogant, impossible to ignore.</p>
<p begin="00:43:12.220" end="00:43:16.920" style="s2">I remember thinking, damn, that girl is</p>
<p begin="00:43:14.220" end="00:43:16.920" style="s2">something else.</p>
<p begin="00:43:17.320" end="00:43:20.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was stunned.</p>
<p begin="00:43:19.020" end="00:43:23.220" style="s2">I had almost forgotten that miserable</p>
<p begin="00:43:20.720" end="00:43:24.964" style="s2">day when Richard had tried so hard to</p>
<p begin="00:43:23.220" end="00:43:25.320" style="s2">humiliate me.</p>
<p begin="00:43:24.964" end="00:43:27.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:43:25.320" end="00:43:29.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too bad your eyes were only on that fake</p>
<p begin="00:43:27.120" end="00:43:32.220" style="s2">gentleman Damian Blackwood.</p>
<p begin="00:43:29.820" end="00:43:33.420" style="s2">I was wild back then too, but I knew one</p>
<p begin="00:43:32.220" end="00:43:36.320" style="s2">thing.</p>
<p begin="00:43:33.420" end="00:43:37.820" style="s2">You cannot force someone to want you.</p>
<p begin="00:43:36.320" end="00:43:39.120" style="s2">So I did not step in just to get</p>
<p begin="00:43:37.820" end="00:43:41.120" style="s2">rejected.</p>
<p begin="00:43:39.120" end="00:43:44.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His words landed like a stone dropped</p>
<p begin="00:43:41.120" end="00:43:44.920" style="s2">into the dead still lake of my heart.</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.820" end="00:43:50.020" style="s2">So there here had been someone watching</p>
<p begin="00:43:47.420" end="00:43:52.220" style="s2">the real Scarlett Valse all along,</p>
<p begin="00:43:50.020" end="00:43:53.620" style="s2">even when I had not known it. What truly</p>
<p begin="00:43:52.220" end="00:43:55.420" style="s2">changed the way I saw him happened</p>
<p begin="00:43:53.620" end="00:43:56.820" style="s2">during a dirt bike accident. We were</p>
<p begin="00:43:55.420" end="00:43:58.420" style="s2">racing on a mountain road in Southern</p>
<p begin="00:43:56.820" end="00:44:00.120" style="s2">Europe. On the way down, the pavement</p>
<p begin="00:43:58.420" end="00:44:01.920" style="s2">was wet and I was going too fast. My</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.120" end="00:44:03.520" style="s2">tire lost traction on a sharp turn and</p>
<p begin="00:44:01.920" end="00:44:05.120" style="s2">both my bike and I flew toward a steep</p>
<p begin="00:44:03.520" end="00:44:06.720" style="s2">drop hundreds of feet below. In that</p>
<p begin="00:44:05.120" end="00:44:08.720" style="s2">split second, Nathaniel was right behind</p>
<p begin="00:44:06.720" end="00:44:10.120" style="s2">me. He did not hesitate. He hit the gas</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.720" end="00:44:11.620" style="s2">and shot toward me using his heavier</p>
<p begin="00:44:10.120" end="00:44:13.320" style="s2">bike to slam into mine and change the</p>
<p begin="00:44:11.620" end="00:44:14.920" style="s2">direction of my fall. But because of the</p>
<p begin="00:44:13.320" end="00:44:16.220" style="s2">force and the rebound, he and his bike</p>
<p begin="00:44:14.920" end="00:44:18.020" style="s2">went tumbling down the steep slope</p>
<p begin="00:44:16.220" end="00:44:19.620" style="s2">instead. When I scrambled down the hill</p>
<p begin="00:44:18.020" end="00:44:21.320" style="s2">and found him among the rocks, his right</p>
<p begin="00:44:19.620" end="00:44:23.120" style="s2">leg was pinned under the heavy bike.</p>
<p begin="00:44:21.320" end="00:44:24.420" style="s2">Blood covered his forehead and his face</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.120" end="00:44:26.320" style="s2">was white from pain.</p>
<p begin="00:44:24.420" end="00:44:28.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do not cry. I am too damn tough to die</p>
<p begin="00:44:26.320" end="00:44:30.420" style="s2">like this.</p>
<p begin="00:44:28.820" end="00:44:31.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In the private hospital in Monaco,</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.420" end="00:44:33.320" style="s2">Nathaniel had thick bandages wrapped</p>
<p begin="00:44:31.920" end="00:44:35.120" style="s2">around his head and a cast on his right</p>
<p begin="00:44:33.320" end="00:44:37.220" style="s2">arm, but he still acted like the same</p>
<p begin="00:44:35.120" end="00:44:39.120" style="s2">wild, careless trouble mayor. He lay in</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.220" end="00:44:40.920" style="s2">the hospital bed, looking at me as I sat</p>
<p begin="00:44:39.120" end="00:44:43.120" style="s2">beside him with slightly red eyes. For</p>
<p begin="00:44:40.920" end="00:44:46.020" style="s2">once, he put away all his cocky,</p>
<p begin="00:44:43.120" end="00:44:48.220" style="s2">unserious attitude. His deep, flirty</p>
<p begin="00:44:46.020" end="00:44:50.020" style="s2">eyes locked onto mine with a seriousness</p>
<p begin="00:44:48.220" end="00:44:52.620" style="s2">I had never seen from him before.</p>
<p begin="00:44:50.020" end="00:44:54.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know you&#39;ve been hurt.</p>
<p begin="00:44:52.620" end="00:44:57.721" style="s2">I I Black Hill broke you.</p>
<p begin="00:44:54.621" end="00:44:57.721" style="s2">With his rules and chains.</p>
<p begin="00:44:58.221" end="00:45:02.521" style="s2">am not asking you to get over it for me.</p>
<p begin="00:45:00.821" end="00:45:04.121" style="s2">Take all the time you need.</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.521" end="00:45:06.221" style="s2">I can wait.</p>
<p begin="00:45:04.121" end="00:45:07.321" style="s2">I can wait.</p>
<p begin="00:45:06.221" end="00:45:09.321" style="s2">When you are ready to want someone</p>
<p begin="00:45:07.321" end="00:45:10.721" style="s2">again,</p>
<p begin="00:45:09.321" end="00:45:12.421" style="s2">I want you to think of me first.</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.721" end="00:45:14.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His honesty, the way he had risked his</p>
<p begin="00:45:12.421" end="00:45:15.521" style="s2">life to save me and the way he accepted</p>
<p begin="00:45:14.021" end="00:45:17.321" style="s2">every wild part of me without trying to</p>
<p begin="00:45:15.521" end="00:45:18.621" style="s2">change it all hit me at once. It felt</p>
<p begin="00:45:17.321" end="00:45:20.221" style="s2">like hot sunlight breaking through the</p>
<p begin="00:45:18.621" end="00:45:21.221" style="s2">frozen walls around my heart. For the</p>
<p begin="00:45:20.221" end="00:45:22.821" style="s2">first time when I did not answer with</p>
<p begin="00:45:21.221" end="00:45:24.521" style="s2">something sharp, I only lowered my eyes</p>
<p begin="00:45:22.821" end="00:45:26.321" style="s2">and felt some of those cold hard chains</p>
<p begin="00:45:24.521" end="00:45:29.221" style="s2">inside me begin to crack. But the peace</p>
<p begin="00:45:26.321" end="00:45:31.421" style="s2">did not last long. A few days later, the</p>
<p begin="00:45:29.221" end="00:45:33.321" style="s2">nightmare found me again. Late one</p>
<p begin="00:45:31.421" end="00:45:35.621" style="s2">night, after I&#39;d been out dancing with</p>
<p begin="00:45:33.321" end="00:45:37.421" style="s2">Mia, I was walking back to my apartment</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.621" end="00:45:39.621" style="s2">when the air around me turned cold in a</p>
<p begin="00:45:37.421" end="00:45:40.821" style="s2">way I knew too well. A thin, worn-out</p>
<p begin="00:45:39.621" end="00:45:42.621" style="s2">figure stood under the shadow of a</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.821" end="00:45:44.721" style="s2">street light. His eyes red with endless</p>
<p begin="00:45:42.621" end="00:45:46.421" style="s2">obsession. Damian Blackwood. He looked</p>
<p begin="00:45:44.721" end="00:45:47.721" style="s2">terrifying. His suit was wrinkled. His</p>
<p begin="00:45:46.421" end="00:45:49.121" style="s2">eyes were bloodshot and violent</p>
<p begin="00:45:47.721" end="00:45:50.821" style="s2">desperation seemed to radiate from his</p>
<p begin="00:45:49.121" end="00:45:52.521" style="s2">entire body like he was one step away</p>
<p begin="00:45:50.821" end="00:45:54.621" style="s2">from losing his mind. He stepped forward</p>
<p begin="00:45:52.521" end="00:45:56.321" style="s2">and grabbed my arm, squeezing so hard it</p>
<p begin="00:45:54.621" end="00:45:58.721" style="s2">felt like he was trying to break it. His</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.321" end="00:45:59.921" style="s2">voice was rough like sandpaper dragged</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.721" end="00:46:02.421" style="s2">over concrete.</p>
<p begin="00:45:59.921" end="00:46:03.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scarlett, are you done playing games?</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.421" end="00:46:06.321" style="s2">Come back with me.</p>
<p begin="00:46:03.921" end="00:46:06.321" style="s2">Now.</p>
<p begin="00:46:06.821" end="00:46:11.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go of me, Mr. Blackwood.</p>
<p begin="00:46:08.821" end="00:46:11.921" style="s2">Do we even know each other?</p>
<p begin="00:46:19.921" end="00:46:23.721" style="s2">Just as Damian was about to force me</p>
<p begin="00:46:21.521" end="00:46:25.721" style="s2">into his car, a hand with long defined</p>
<p begin="00:46:23.721" end="00:46:27.021" style="s2">fingers and a limited edition watch cut</p>
<p begin="00:46:25.721" end="00:46:29.221" style="s2">through the air faster than anyone</p>
<p begin="00:46:27.021" end="00:46:32.821" style="s2">expected. It caught Damian&#39;s wrist with</p>
<p begin="00:46:29.221" end="00:46:32.821" style="s2">a sharp smack and held tight.</p>
<p begin="00:46:33.821" end="00:46:39.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A Blackwood CEO should know better than</p>
<p begin="00:46:35.921" end="00:46:41.321" style="s2">to put his hands on my woman in public.</p>
<p begin="00:46:39.621" end="00:46:43.121" style="s2">Even a three-year-old knows you cannot</p>
<p begin="00:46:41.321" end="00:46:45.121" style="s2">force someone to want you.</p>
<p begin="00:46:43.121" end="00:46:47.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He twisted Damian&#39;s wrist with sudden</p>
<p begin="00:46:45.121" end="00:46:49.421" style="s2">explosive strength, forcing him to let</p>
<p begin="00:46:47.421" end="00:46:51.921" style="s2">go of me.</p>
<p begin="00:46:49.421" end="00:46:54.121" style="s2">At the same time, he slid his arm around</p>
<p begin="00:46:51.921" end="00:46:56.721" style="s2">my waist and pulled me behind him,</p>
<p begin="00:46:54.121" end="00:46:58.922" style="s2">natural and protective. The jealousy and</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.721" end="00:47:01.023" style="s2">rage burned through the thread of sanity</p>
<p begin="00:46:58.922" end="00:47:02.823" style="s2">the New York air had left. Damian&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:47:01.023" end="00:47:05.122" style="s2">veins stood out on his forehead and he</p>
<p begin="00:47:02.823" end="00:47:07.323" style="s2">spat Nathaniel&#39;s name through his teeth.</p>
<p begin="00:47:05.122" end="00:47:09.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take your hands off her.</p>
<p begin="00:47:07.323" end="00:47:11.823" style="s2">You are a spoiled piece of trash who</p>
<p begin="00:47:09.223" end="00:47:14.622" style="s2">changes women more often than cars.</p>
<p begin="00:47:11.823" end="00:47:16.422" style="s2">Do not touch her with your filthy hands.</p>
<p begin="00:47:14.622" end="00:47:18.422" style="s2">If you do not let go,</p>
<p begin="00:47:16.422" end="00:47:19.457" style="s2">I will destroy your entire family in</p>
<p begin="00:47:18.422" end="00:47:21.477" style="s2">Europe.</p>
<p begin="00:47:19.457" end="00:47:21.477" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:47:23.523" end="00:47:27.523" style="s2">I am a mess, sure.</p>
<p begin="00:47:25.622" end="00:47:29.122" style="s2">I sleep around and I have never</p>
<p begin="00:47:27.523" end="00:47:31.422" style="s2">pretended to be a saint.</p>
<p begin="00:47:29.122" end="00:47:34.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then his tones changed completely and</p>
<p begin="00:47:31.422" end="00:47:35.723" style="s2">every word came out cold and poison.</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.122" end="00:47:37.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But I have never been sick enough to</p>
<p begin="00:47:35.723" end="00:47:40.122" style="s2">make a woman write a 10,000 word Tumblr</p>
<p begin="00:47:37.823" end="00:47:42.523" style="s2">apology. I&#39;ve never locked her in a dark</p>
<p begin="00:47:40.122" end="00:47:44.723" style="s2">wine cellar for 3 days without food what</p>
<p begin="00:47:42.523" end="00:47:47.223" style="s2">water. I have never thrown her into a</p>
<p begin="00:47:44.723" end="00:47:49.223" style="s2">freezing fountain at a gala.</p>
<p begin="00:47:47.223" end="00:47:51.223" style="s2">Watched her bleed in the water and then</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.223" end="00:47:54.323" style="s2">told my guards to keep going because she</p>
<p begin="00:47:51.223" end="00:47:54.323" style="s2">needed to learn a lesson.</p>
<p begin="00:47:59.823" end="00:48:04.323" style="s2">So tell me Blackwood,</p>
<p begin="00:48:02.223" end="00:48:06.723" style="s2">what the hell kind of man do you think</p>
<p begin="00:48:04.323" end="00:48:06.723" style="s2">you are?</p>
<p begin="00:48:08.023" end="00:48:11.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every word out of Nathaniel&#39;s mouth cut</p>
<p begin="00:48:09.723" end="00:48:13.422" style="s2">open the guilt Damian had been trying</p>
<p begin="00:48:11.223" end="00:48:15.422" style="s2">not to face. Right there on a foreign</p>
<p begin="00:48:13.422" end="00:48:17.122" style="s2">street, Nathaniel stripped away every</p>
<p begin="00:48:15.422" end="00:48:19.323" style="s2">pathetic excuse Damian had ever made</p>
<p begin="00:48:17.122" end="00:48:21.122" style="s2">about love, discipline, and protection,</p>
<p begin="00:48:19.323" end="00:48:23.223" style="s2">leaving him with nothing to hide behind.</p>
<p begin="00:48:21.122" end="00:48:25.023" style="s2">The color drained from Damian&#39;s face.</p>
<p begin="00:48:23.223" end="00:48:27.023" style="s2">His lips trembled and he tried to argue</p>
<p begin="00:48:25.023" end="00:48:28.823" style="s2">back, but his throat was so dry that not</p>
<p begin="00:48:27.023" end="00:48:30.622" style="s2">a single word came out.</p>
<p begin="00:48:28.823" end="00:48:32.723" style="s2">2 months of guilt and regret crashed</p>
<p begin="00:48:30.622" end="00:48:35.323" style="s2">over him all at once. His vision went</p>
<p begin="00:48:32.723" end="00:48:37.023" style="s2">dark and he could barely stand.</p>
<p begin="00:48:35.323" end="00:48:39.023" style="s2">Then he snapped.</p>
<p begin="00:48:37.023" end="00:48:43.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up.</p>
<p begin="00:48:39.023" end="00:48:43.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His voice was hoarse and shaking.</p>
<p begin="00:48:44.323" end="00:48:47.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SHUT YOUR MOUTH.</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.922" end="00:48:49.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THE LAST thread holding him to get</p>
<p begin="00:48:47.622" end="00:48:52.122" style="s2">broke. He pulled his fist back and</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.823" end="00:48:53.523" style="s2">charged forward, trying to tear me away</p>
<p begin="00:48:52.122" end="00:48:55.723" style="s2">from Nathaniel.</p>
<p begin="00:48:53.523" end="00:48:57.323" style="s2">Nathaniel had run out of patience. His</p>
<p begin="00:48:55.723" end="00:48:59.122" style="s2">eyes went cold</p>
<p begin="00:48:57.323" end="00:49:01.424" style="s2">and he lunged forward, throwing a punch</p>
<p begin="00:48:59.122" end="00:49:02.724" style="s2">straight at Damian. Two powerful men who</p>
<p begin="00:49:01.424" end="00:49:04.624" style="s2">were used to commanding boardrooms and</p>
<p begin="00:49:02.724" end="00:49:06.224" style="s2">making entire markets moved started</p>
<p begin="00:49:04.624" end="00:49:08.124" style="s2">brawling on the streets of Monaco like</p>
<p begin="00:49:06.224" end="00:49:10.024" style="s2">common street thugs. The heavy sound of</p>
<p begin="00:49:08.124" end="00:49:11.924" style="s2">fists hitting flesh and the raw grails</p>
<p begin="00:49:10.024" end="00:49:14.324" style="s2">of age made casino guests scream and</p>
<p begin="00:49:11.924" end="00:49:16.524" style="s2">scattered. In the chaos, Damian used</p>
<p begin="00:49:14.324" end="00:49:18.024" style="s2">that reckless, almost suicidal force to</p>
<p begin="00:49:16.524" end="00:49:19.724" style="s2">break through the guards and reach me</p>
<p begin="00:49:18.024" end="00:49:22.324" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:49:19.724" end="00:49:23.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come with me. I am not losing you again.</p>
<p begin="00:49:22.324" end="00:49:26.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He grabbed my shoulders with his bloody</p>
<p begin="00:49:23.724" end="00:49:28.624" style="s2">hands, his eyes obsessive and unhinged.</p>
<p begin="00:49:26.624" end="00:49:30.524" style="s2">Damian forced me into the black armored</p>
<p begin="00:49:28.624" end="00:49:31.924" style="s2">car waiting on the street and ordered</p>
<p begin="00:49:30.524" end="00:49:34.924" style="s2">his men to clear a path.</p>
<p begin="00:49:31.924" end="00:49:34.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Clear the way, now.</p>
<p begin="00:49:35.424" end="00:49:40.724" style="s2">Drive to the private airport, now. We</p>
<p begin="00:49:37.724" end="00:49:40.724" style="s2">are leaving for New York.</p>
<p begin="00:49:44.524" end="00:49:47.924" style="s2">Find Blackwood&#39;s private flight path</p>
<p begin="00:49:46.324" end="00:49:50.324" style="s2">across the Atlantic. Get my people</p>
<p begin="00:49:47.924" end="00:49:53.824" style="s2">ready. I am going to New York and I am</p>
<p begin="00:49:50.324" end="00:49:55.824" style="s2">tearing his tower down if I have to.</p>
<p begin="00:49:53.824" end="00:49:57.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 12 hours later, the Gulfstream landed at</p>
<p begin="00:49:55.824" end="00:49:59.324" style="s2">a heavily guarded private estate outside</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.524" end="00:50:01.424" style="s2">New York City, completely isolated from</p>
<p begin="00:49:59.324" end="00:50:03.524" style="s2">the outside world. It was Damian&#39;s most</p>
<p begin="00:50:01.424" end="00:50:05.024" style="s2">hidden asset, a beautiful golden cage</p>
<p begin="00:50:03.524" end="00:50:06.924" style="s2">built with the best security systems</p>
<p begin="00:50:05.024" end="00:50:08.724" style="s2">money could buy. I was locked inside the</p>
<p begin="00:50:06.924" end="00:50:11.724" style="s2">luxurious living room, but I stayed</p>
<p begin="00:50:08.724" end="00:50:14.624" style="s2">completely silent. I did not cry. I did</p>
<p begin="00:50:11.724" end="00:50:16.524" style="s2">not scream. I did not make a scene. I</p>
<p begin="00:50:14.624" end="00:50:18.224" style="s2">only looked at Damian with a coldness</p>
<p begin="00:50:16.524" end="00:50:19.824" style="s2">that made it clear he was already dead</p>
<p begin="00:50:18.224" end="00:50:21.524" style="s2">to me.</p>
<p begin="00:50:19.824" end="00:50:22.924" style="s2">Damian&#39;s heart cracked piece by piece</p>
<p begin="00:50:21.524" end="00:50:24.624" style="s2">under that look.</p>
<p begin="00:50:22.924" end="00:50:26.524" style="s2">He desperately wanted to make things</p>
<p begin="00:50:24.624" end="00:50:28.124" style="s2">right.</p>
<p begin="00:50:26.524" end="00:50:30.124" style="s2">Then he suddenly remembered that I had</p>
<p begin="00:50:28.124" end="00:50:32.124" style="s2">once mentioned liking a certain French</p>
<p begin="00:50:30.124" end="00:50:34.124" style="s2">dessert. He had never been in a kitchen</p>
<p begin="00:50:32.124" end="00:50:35.724" style="s2">in his life, but he took off his jacket</p>
<p begin="00:50:34.124" end="00:50:37.124" style="s2">and walked into the kitchen anyway,</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.724" end="00:50:39.324" style="s2">clumsily cutting ingredients with his</p>
<p begin="00:50:37.124" end="00:50:40.724" style="s2">ruined hands. Hot oil splashed up and</p>
<p begin="00:50:39.324" end="00:50:42.724" style="s2">burned blisters across the backs of his</p>
<p begin="00:50:40.724" end="00:50:44.424" style="s2">hands, but he did not seem to notice. An</p>
<p begin="00:50:42.724" end="00:50:45.724" style="s2">hour later, he came out carrying a plate</p>
<p begin="00:50:44.424" end="00:50:46.924" style="s2">of dessert that looked terrible and</p>
<p begin="00:50:45.724" end="00:50:48.224" style="s2">slightly burnt.</p>
<p begin="00:50:46.924" end="00:50:49.724" style="s2">He walked up to me with a tired,</p>
<p begin="00:50:48.224" end="00:50:51.424" style="s2">worn-out face that carried a pathetic</p>
<p begin="00:50:49.724" end="00:50:53.624" style="s2">kind of hope. His whole body was</p>
<p begin="00:50:51.424" end="00:50:55.324" style="s2">shaking. His eyes were red and he could</p>
<p begin="00:50:53.624" end="00:50:55.724" style="s2">barely stand as he held the plate out to</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.324" end="00:50:57.524" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.724" end="00:50:59.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You used to say you liked this. I made</p>
<p begin="00:50:57.524" end="00:51:01.024" style="s2">it myself. Please, Scarlett, just try</p>
<p begin="00:50:59.924" end="00:51:02.624" style="s2">one bite.</p>
<p begin="00:51:01.024" end="00:51:03.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I leaned against the couch, completely</p>
<p begin="00:51:02.624" end="00:51:04.825" style="s2">different,</p>
<p begin="00:51:03.325" end="00:51:06.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; and did not even bother to look at him.</p>
<p begin="00:51:04.825" end="00:51:07.825" style="s2">I treated him like he was invisible.</p>
<p begin="00:51:06.325" end="00:51:09.525" style="s2">Damian&#39;s heart sank deeper into that</p>
<p begin="00:51:07.825" end="00:51:11.525" style="s2">frozen silence until there was nothing</p>
<p begin="00:51:09.525" end="00:51:12.925" style="s2">left but despair. All his pride fell</p>
<p begin="00:51:11.525" end="00:51:14.125" style="s2">away as he dropped to his knees in front</p>
<p begin="00:51:12.925" end="00:51:15.325" style="s2">of me and looked up like a beggar.</p>
<p begin="00:51:14.125" end="00:51:16.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know that now. I do want the family</p>
<p begin="00:51:15.325" end="00:51:18.125" style="s2">code anymore. I will never lock you down</p>
<p begin="00:51:16.625" end="00:51:20.025" style="s2">again. Just do not look at me like I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:51:18.125" end="00:51:23.225" style="s2">already dead. It&#39;s driving me insane.</p>
<p begin="00:51:20.025" end="00:51:23.225" style="s2">Why you can&#39;t forgive me?</p>
<p begin="00:51:24.325" end="00:51:28.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I finally turned my head and looked at</p>
<p begin="00:51:26.125" end="00:51:30.825" style="s2">his broken face.</p>
<p begin="00:51:28.625" end="00:51:33.325" style="s2">Beneath my calm surface was the frozen</p>
<p begin="00:51:30.825" end="00:51:36.225" style="s2">cold of two lifetimes. You really want</p>
<p begin="00:51:33.325" end="00:51:38.225" style="s2">to know why? Fine, Damian.</p>
<p begin="00:51:36.225" end="00:51:39.325" style="s2">I will tell you. I looked at him without</p>
<p begin="00:51:38.225" end="00:51:41.825" style="s2">blinking.</p>
<p begin="00:51:39.325" end="00:51:43.625" style="s2">Because at the charity gala,</p>
<p begin="00:51:41.825" end="00:51:45.425" style="s2">you let your guards throw me into a</p>
<p begin="00:51:43.625" end="00:51:47.525" style="s2">freezing fountain.</p>
<p begin="00:51:45.425" end="00:51:49.325" style="s2">You knew I was bleeding, and when they</p>
<p begin="00:51:47.525" end="00:51:51.425" style="s2">asked if they should stop, you told them</p>
<p begin="00:51:49.325" end="00:51:53.525" style="s2">to keep going.</p>
<p begin="00:51:51.425" end="00:51:55.825" style="s2">His face went white because in the</p>
<p begin="00:51:53.525" end="00:51:58.225" style="s2">pouring rain you brought me back to your</p>
<p begin="00:51:55.825" end="00:52:00.525" style="s2">mansion. But the second Clara put on her</p>
<p begin="00:51:58.225" end="00:52:02.925" style="s2">innocent little act, you protected her</p>
<p begin="00:52:00.525" end="00:52:05.425" style="s2">from the boiling water and left me on</p>
<p begin="00:52:02.925" end="00:52:07.425" style="s2">the floor while my skin peeled off. His</p>
<p begin="00:52:05.425" end="00:52:09.525" style="s2">breathing turned unsteady because you</p>
<p begin="00:52:07.425" end="00:52:11.725" style="s2">locked me in that dark wine cellar and</p>
<p begin="00:52:09.525" end="00:52:13.725" style="s2">gave Clara the perfect chance to torture</p>
<p begin="00:52:11.725" end="00:52:15.725" style="s2">me with an electroshock chair.</p>
<p begin="00:52:13.725" end="00:52:19.525" style="s2">When I told you the truth with injuries</p>
<p begin="00:52:15.725" end="00:52:21.925" style="s2">all over my body, you called me a liar.</p>
<p begin="00:52:19.525" end="00:52:23.725" style="s2">His face went pale. Every time you had</p>
<p begin="00:52:21.925" end="00:52:26.425" style="s2">to choose between me and Clara, you</p>
<p begin="00:52:23.725" end="00:52:26.425" style="s2">chose her.</p>
<p begin="00:52:26.725" end="00:52:31.525" style="s2">You chose your family&#39;s reputation. You</p>
<p begin="00:52:29.325" end="00:52:35.025" style="s2">chose control, and now you are kneeling</p>
<p begin="00:52:31.525" end="00:52:36.525" style="s2">here asking me to believe you loved me.</p>
<p begin="00:52:35.025" end="00:52:38.525" style="s2">Every word struck Damian like a</p>
<p begin="00:52:36.525" end="00:52:40.425" style="s2">judgment. Damian&#39;s face was completely</p>
<p begin="00:52:38.525" end="00:52:42.725" style="s2">pale. His body shook so hard he could</p>
<p begin="00:52:40.425" end="00:52:44.425" style="s2">barely stay upright. He tried to argue,</p>
<p begin="00:52:42.725" end="00:52:46.525" style="s2">to say I had misunderstood, but in front</p>
<p begin="00:52:44.425" end="00:52:48.825" style="s2">of those brutal facts he realized words</p>
<p begin="00:52:46.525" end="00:52:50.525" style="s2">meant nothing. Regret tore through him.</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.825" end="00:52:52.125" style="s2">He tried to stand but accidentally</p>
<p begin="00:52:50.525" end="00:52:54.425" style="s2">knocked over the bag tucked between the</p>
<p begin="00:52:52.125" end="00:52:56.625" style="s2">couch hips. Everything inside spilled</p>
<p begin="00:52:54.425" end="00:52:58.625" style="s2">onto the floor. As he scrambled to pick</p>
<p begin="00:52:56.625" end="00:53:02.025" style="s2">it up, his fingers touched a medical</p>
<p begin="00:52:58.625" end="00:53:02.025" style="s2">file hidden deep inside.</p>
<p begin="00:53:03.825" end="00:53:07.827" style="s2">Damian opened the medical report from</p>
<p begin="00:53:05.827" end="00:53:09.727" style="s2">the private hospital in Monaco before he</p>
<p begin="00:53:07.827" end="00:53:11.527" style="s2">could think better of it. Large area</p>
<p begin="00:53:09.727" end="00:53:14.427" style="s2">deep second degree burns with severe</p>
<p begin="00:53:11.527" end="00:53:16.327" style="s2">PTSD caused prolonged psychological</p>
<p begin="00:53:14.427" end="00:53:19.127" style="s2">pressure. Burns,</p>
<p begin="00:53:16.327" end="00:53:19.127" style="s2">boiling water.</p>
<p begin="00:53:19.327" end="00:53:23.527" style="s2">He stared at the date on the report.</p>
<p begin="00:53:21.827" end="00:53:25.227" style="s2">It was the same day he had knocked over</p>
<p begin="00:53:23.527" end="00:53:27.327" style="s2">the hot water and carried Clara away</p>
<p begin="00:53:25.227" end="00:53:28.527" style="s2">from the mansion. That was how badly I</p>
<p begin="00:53:27.327" end="00:53:30.627" style="s2">had been hurt.</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.527" end="00:53:32.527" style="s2">It had not only been my body, my mind</p>
<p begin="00:53:30.627" end="00:53:33.927" style="s2">had been damaged too.</p>
<p begin="00:53:32.527" end="00:53:35.527" style="s2">And what had he been doing then, the man</p>
<p begin="00:53:33.927" end="00:53:37.327" style="s2">who claimed to love me?</p>
<p begin="00:53:35.527" end="00:53:38.927" style="s2">He had been holding Clara,</p>
<p begin="00:53:37.327" end="00:53:40.927" style="s2">the person at the center of all of it,</p>
<p begin="00:53:38.927" end="00:53:42.827" style="s2">asking if she was okay. Meanwhile, he</p>
<p begin="00:53:40.927" end="00:53:44.627" style="s2">had left me in boiling water to suffer.</p>
<p begin="00:53:42.827" end="00:53:46.127" style="s2">Damian completely lost control. He</p>
<p begin="00:53:44.627" end="00:53:47.827" style="s2">punched the wall so hard that the crack</p>
<p begin="00:53:46.127" end="00:53:49.427" style="s2">of his knuckles breaking was audible.</p>
<p begin="00:53:47.827" end="00:53:50.927" style="s2">Blood splattered across the wall, but</p>
<p begin="00:53:49.427" end="00:53:52.127" style="s2">the physical pain was nothing compared</p>
<p begin="00:53:50.927" end="00:53:54.027" style="s2">to the feeling of his heart being</p>
<p begin="00:53:52.127" end="00:53:55.927" style="s2">crushed piece by piece. He crawled back</p>
<p begin="00:53:54.027" end="00:53:57.627" style="s2">to my feet like a dying dog and grabbed</p>
<p begin="00:53:55.927" end="00:53:59.127" style="s2">the hem of my dress with his broken</p>
<p begin="00:53:57.627" end="00:54:01.127" style="s2">bleeding hand.</p>
<p begin="00:53:59.127" end="00:54:02.827" style="s2">His voice was wrecked as he apologized</p>
<p begin="00:54:01.127" end="00:54:04.927" style="s2">over and over again.</p>
<p begin="00:54:02.827" end="00:54:07.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did not know it was that bad.</p>
<p begin="00:54:04.927" end="00:54:09.127" style="s2">Scarlett, I swear I did not know.</p>
<p begin="00:54:07.727" end="00:54:10.927" style="s2">Kill me if you want.</p>
<p begin="00:54:09.127" end="00:54:12.727" style="s2">Take a knife and do it right now. Just</p>
<p begin="00:54:10.927" end="00:54:14.027" style="s2">give me one chance.</p>
<p begin="00:54:12.727" end="00:54:17.127" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:54:14.027" end="00:54:19.727" style="s2">Just one chance.</p>
<p begin="00:54:17.127" end="00:54:22.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I looked down at him, my long lashes</p>
<p begin="00:54:19.727" end="00:54:25.127" style="s2">casting cold shadows over my eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:54:22.527" end="00:54:27.327" style="s2">There was no emotion in them at all.</p>
<p begin="00:54:25.127" end="00:54:30.327" style="s2">I heard your apology, Damian.</p>
<p begin="00:54:27.327" end="00:54:30.327" style="s2">I just do not forgive you.</p>
<p begin="00:54:33.127" end="00:54:36.827" style="s2">At that moment, the roar of motorcycle</p>
<p begin="00:54:35.227" end="00:54:38.827" style="s2">engines, screaming security alarms</p>
<p begin="00:54:36.827" end="00:54:40.927" style="s2">exploded outside the villa. Through the</p>
<p begin="00:54:38.827" end="00:54:42.527" style="s2">chaos of guards yelling and fighting,</p>
<p begin="00:54:40.927" end="00:54:44.127" style="s2">the thick bulletproof front door of the</p>
<p begin="00:54:42.527" end="00:54:46.027" style="s2">living room was slammed open from the</p>
<p begin="00:54:44.127" end="00:54:48.127" style="s2">outside. Nathaniel burst in, covered in</p>
<p begin="00:54:46.027" end="00:54:49.527" style="s2">injuries, his eyes wild with rage,</p>
<p begin="00:54:48.127" end="00:54:52.127" style="s2">carrying the kind of fury that looked</p>
<p begin="00:54:49.527" end="00:54:54.027" style="s2">ready to kill.</p>
<p begin="00:54:52.127" end="00:54:56.427" style="s2">Nathaniel strode in over the shattered</p>
<p begin="00:54:54.027" end="00:54:58.927" style="s2">glass, his black leather jacket stained</p>
<p begin="00:54:56.427" end="00:55:01.127" style="s2">with the blood of Damian&#39;s guards.</p>
<p begin="00:54:58.927" end="00:55:02.327" style="s2">The usual lazy charm in his eyes was</p>
<p begin="00:55:01.127" end="00:55:06.527" style="s2">gone,</p>
<p begin="00:55:02.327" end="00:55:06.527" style="s2">replaced by something savage and deadly.</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.027" end="00:55:11.428" style="s2">He pulled me behind him in one swift</p>
<p begin="00:55:08.928" end="00:55:13.628" style="s2">motion.</p>
<p begin="00:55:11.428" end="00:55:17.128" style="s2">His right fist trembled from the force</p>
<p begin="00:55:13.628" end="00:55:17.128" style="s2">he was barely holding back.</p>
<p begin="00:55:18.528" end="00:55:23.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian Blackwood, you really had the</p>
<p begin="00:55:20.428" end="00:55:24.928" style="s2">nerve to take her right under my nose.</p>
<p begin="00:55:23.128" end="00:55:26.328" style="s2">You think because your family runs New</p>
<p begin="00:55:24.928" end="00:55:27.628" style="s2">York</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.328" end="00:55:29.228" style="s2">I cannot touch you?</p>
<p begin="00:55:27.628" end="00:55:30.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian was still on the floor, his</p>
<p begin="00:55:29.228" end="00:55:32.328" style="s2">broken hand hung at his side, blood</p>
<p begin="00:55:30.928" end="00:55:35.028" style="s2">dripping from his fingertips onto the</p>
<p begin="00:55:32.328" end="00:55:36.928" style="s2">expensive wool carpet. Slowly he stood.</p>
<p begin="00:55:35.028" end="00:55:38.928" style="s2">His proud untouchable spine looked bent</p>
<p begin="00:55:36.928" end="00:55:40.428" style="s2">now, but the moment he saw Nathaniel,</p>
<p begin="00:55:38.928" end="00:55:42.428" style="s2">jealousy and violence flared back to</p>
<p begin="00:55:40.428" end="00:55:43.628" style="s2">life in his hollow eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:55:42.428" end="00:55:47.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let her go.</p>
<p begin="00:55:43.628" end="00:55:47.128" style="s2">Nathaniel, this is New York.</p>
<p begin="00:55:49.328" end="00:55:56.028" style="s2">THIS IS MY TERRITORY. WHEN THE COUNT</p>
<p begin="00:55:52.028" end="00:55:57.728" style="s2">HIMSELF YOU ARE NOT TAKING HER ANYWHERE.</p>
<p begin="00:55:56.028" end="00:56:01.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NATHANIEL looked as if he had just heard</p>
<p begin="00:55:57.728" end="00:56:01.328" style="s2">the funniest thing in the world.</p>
<p begin="00:56:03.328" end="00:56:07.128" style="s2">He stepped forward and grabbed Damian by</p>
<p begin="00:56:05.228" end="00:56:08.028" style="s2">the collar, lifting him with brutal</p>
<p begin="00:56:07.128" end="00:56:09.628" style="s2">force.</p>
<p begin="00:56:08.028" end="00:56:10.668" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your territory?</p>
<p begin="00:56:09.628" end="00:56:11.828" style="s2">Look outside.</p>
<p begin="00:56:10.668" end="00:56:13.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:56:11.828" end="00:56:15.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Beyond the windows, countless armored</p>
<p begin="00:56:13.728" end="00:56:17.128" style="s2">vehicles flashed with warning lights</p>
<p begin="00:56:15.528" end="00:56:18.928" style="s2">surrounding the private estate.</p>
<p begin="00:56:17.128" end="00:56:21.528" style="s2">Nathaniel&#39;s men had already formed a</p>
<p begin="00:56:18.928" end="00:56:23.128" style="s2">standoff with Blackwood&#39;s guards.</p>
<p begin="00:56:21.528" end="00:56:25.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am not just taking her out of here</p>
<p begin="00:56:23.128" end="00:56:25.528" style="s2">today.</p>
<p begin="00:56:26.128" end="00:56:30.628" style="s2">I am going to going to collect I collect</p>
<p begin="00:56:28.628" end="00:56:34.028" style="s2">the life you should have lost in Monaco</p>
<p begin="00:56:30.628" end="00:56:34.028" style="s2">right here in New York.</p>
<p begin="00:56:35.928" end="00:56:39.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian did not fight back. He let</p>
<p begin="00:56:37.828" end="00:56:41.128" style="s2">Nathaniel hold him by the collar, but</p>
<p begin="00:56:39.328" end="00:56:42.728" style="s2">his eyes stayed locked on my face over</p>
<p begin="00:56:41.128" end="00:56:44.528" style="s2">Nathaniel&#39;s shoulder.</p>
<p begin="00:56:42.728" end="00:56:46.628" style="s2">There was no trace of his old arrogance</p>
<p begin="00:56:44.528" end="00:56:49.128" style="s2">left in that look, only a plea so</p>
<p begin="00:56:46.628" end="00:56:53.828" style="s2">desperate it had sunk into his bones.</p>
<p begin="00:56:49.128" end="00:56:53.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scarlett, do not go. I am begging you.</p>
<p begin="00:56:54.928" end="00:56:59.928" style="s2">Stay even if all you want is to kill me.</p>
<p begin="00:56:57.828" end="00:57:02.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I looked at him without emotion, as if I</p>
<p begin="00:56:59.928" end="00:57:03.928" style="s2">were looking at something already dead.</p>
<p begin="00:57:02.428" end="00:57:05.228" style="s2">Damian,</p>
<p begin="00:57:03.928" end="00:57:07.328" style="s2">the moment you threw yourself in front</p>
<p begin="00:57:05.228" end="00:57:08.928" style="s2">of Clara, we became enemies in both</p>
<p begin="00:57:07.328" end="00:57:10.229" style="s2">lifetimes.</p>
<p begin="00:57:08.928" end="00:57:11.629" style="s2">Do not make me hate you more than</p>
<p begin="00:57:10.229" end="00:57:13.329" style="s2">already do.</p>
<p begin="00:57:11.629" end="00:57:16.529" style="s2">Then I turned and took Nathaniel&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:57:13.329" end="00:57:17.529" style="s2">blooded hand myself. Nathaniel, let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:57:16.529" end="00:57:19.429" style="s2">go.</p>
<p begin="00:57:17.529" end="00:57:21.729" style="s2">Nathaniel froze for half a second, then</p>
<p begin="00:57:19.429" end="00:57:23.029" style="s2">clasped my hand tightly, locking his</p>
<p begin="00:57:21.729" end="00:57:25.329" style="s2">fingers with mine. With a look of</p>
<p begin="00:57:23.029" end="00:57:27.729" style="s2">disgust, he shoved Damian away as if</p>
<p begin="00:57:25.329" end="00:57:29.629" style="s2">pushing aside trash. Damian staggered</p>
<p begin="00:57:27.729" end="00:57:32.029" style="s2">back and crashed into the luxury wine</p>
<p begin="00:57:29.629" end="00:57:34.229" style="s2">cabinet behind him. Countless bottles</p>
<p begin="00:57:32.029" end="00:57:35.729" style="s2">shattered across the floor, and dark red</p>
<p begin="00:57:34.229" end="00:57:38.129" style="s2">wine spread over the wreckage like</p>
<p begin="00:57:35.729" end="00:57:38.129" style="s2">blood.</p>
<p begin="00:57:38.429" end="00:57:42.629" style="s2">He sat collapsed in the ruin, able to do</p>
<p begin="00:57:40.429" end="00:57:44.529" style="s2">nothing but watch as Nathaniel shielded</p>
<p begin="00:57:42.629" end="00:57:47.629" style="s2">me and led me out of that beautiful</p>
<p begin="00:57:44.529" end="00:57:49.429" style="s2">golden cage without looking back.</p>
<p begin="00:57:47.629" end="00:57:52.429" style="s2">Nathaniel shielded me and led me out</p>
<p begin="00:57:49.429" end="00:57:52.429" style="s2">without looking back.</p>
<p begin="00:57:55.129" end="00:58:00.129" style="s2">The door slammed shut behind us.</p>
<p begin="00:57:57.729" end="00:58:03.129" style="s2">Behind it came Damian&#39;s broken,</p>
<p begin="00:58:00.129" end="00:58:03.129" style="s2">desperate growl.</p>
<p begin="00:58:09.329" end="00:58:13.829" style="s2">The suffocating gloom of New York was</p>
<p begin="00:58:11.929" end="00:58:16.229" style="s2">left behind on the other side of the</p>
<p begin="00:58:13.829" end="00:58:18.029" style="s2">Atlantic. Nathaniel did not take me back</p>
<p begin="00:58:16.229" end="00:58:20.429" style="s2">to Monaco and its glittering, noisy</p>
<p begin="00:58:18.029" end="00:58:22.129" style="s2">world of money and pleasure. Instead, he</p>
<p begin="00:58:20.429" end="00:58:24.029" style="s2">put me on his private jet and flew me</p>
<p begin="00:58:22.129" end="00:58:26.429" style="s2">straight to an extremely private estate</p>
<p begin="00:58:24.029" end="00:58:28.529" style="s2">in the south of France. The estate sat</p>
<p begin="00:58:26.429" end="00:58:31.729" style="s2">deep in the quiet Provence countryside,</p>
<p begin="00:58:28.529" end="00:58:31.729" style="s2">far away from the world.</p>
<p begin="00:58:33.029" end="00:58:37.629" style="s2">When I opened the windows, I could see</p>
<p begin="00:58:35.029" end="00:58:41.129" style="s2">endless fields of lavender. The air</p>
<p begin="00:58:37.629" end="00:58:43.029" style="s2">smelled clean, full of grass, sunlight,</p>
<p begin="00:58:41.129" end="00:58:45.129" style="s2">and peace. There was no Richard Will</p>
<p begin="00:58:43.029" end="00:58:46.929" style="s2">calculating what I was worth. There was</p>
<p begin="00:58:45.129" end="00:58:49.229" style="s2">no Damian Blackfield haunting me with</p>
<p begin="00:58:46.929" end="00:58:50.829" style="s2">his obsession. There was only a silence</p>
<p begin="00:58:49.229" end="00:58:52.129" style="s2">gentle enough to make breathing feel</p>
<p begin="00:58:50.829" end="00:58:54.029" style="s2">easy again.</p>
<p begin="00:58:52.129" end="00:58:55.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cancel all meetings.</p>
<p begin="00:58:54.029" end="00:58:57.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nathaniel threw away every bit of his</p>
<p begin="00:58:55.729" end="00:59:00.629" style="s2">southern European playboy image and</p>
<p begin="00:58:57.729" end="00:59:02.629" style="s2">became surprisingly patient.</p>
<p begin="00:59:00.629" end="00:59:04.629" style="s2">He canceled business meetings, turned</p>
<p begin="00:59:02.629" end="00:59:06.329" style="s2">down parties, and simply sat with me</p>
<p begin="00:59:04.629" end="00:59:09.029" style="s2">during breakfast in the flower-filled</p>
<p begin="00:59:06.329" end="00:59:10.829" style="s2">garden. At sunset, he would lie half on</p>
<p begin="00:59:09.029" end="00:59:12.329" style="s2">the grass beneath the grapevines with a</p>
<p begin="00:59:10.829" end="00:59:14.231" style="s2">book in his hand.</p>
<p begin="00:59:12.329" end="00:59:16.331" style="s2">Every now and then, he would look up and</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.231" end="00:59:18.831" style="s2">flashed me that lazy, trouble-making</p>
<p begin="00:59:16.331" end="00:59:20.931" style="s2">smile. He never mentioned New York. He</p>
<p begin="00:59:18.831" end="00:59:22.731" style="s2">never mentioned Damian Blackwood. He</p>
<p begin="00:59:20.931" end="00:59:24.031" style="s2">never mentioned any part of the past</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.731" end="00:59:26.031" style="s2">that hurt me.</p>
<p begin="00:59:24.031" end="00:59:28.231" style="s2">With that strange, reckless tenderness</p>
<p begin="00:59:26.031" end="00:59:30.231" style="s2">only he had, he slowly chased the</p>
<p begin="00:59:28.231" end="00:59:32.731" style="s2">shadows of my last life from between my</p>
<p begin="00:59:30.231" end="00:59:32.731" style="s2">brows.</p>
<p begin="00:59:33.931" end="00:59:38.331" style="s2">The skin burned by deep second-degree</p>
<p begin="00:59:35.931" end="00:59:41.131" style="s2">scald still arched at night,</p>
<p begin="00:59:38.331" end="00:59:43.131" style="s2">and the PTSD left by my past life often</p>
<p begin="00:59:41.131" end="00:59:45.031" style="s2">dragged me awake from nightmares. Every</p>
<p begin="00:59:43.131" end="00:59:46.731" style="s2">time I sat up covered in cold sweat, I</p>
<p begin="00:59:45.031" end="00:59:48.731" style="s2">saw a faint light glowing outside on the</p>
<p begin="00:59:46.731" end="00:59:50.031" style="s2">terrace. Nathaniel was always there,</p>
<p begin="00:59:48.731" end="00:59:51.931" style="s2">guarding my bedroom from the sofa</p>
<p begin="00:59:50.031" end="00:59:53.831" style="s2">outside the glass doors. He held an old</p>
<p begin="00:59:51.931" end="00:59:55.531" style="s2">guitar in his arms, his long fingers</p>
<p begin="00:59:53.831" end="00:59:57.231" style="s2">moving over the strings. The melodies</p>
<p begin="00:59:55.531" end="01:00:00.731" style="s2">were never perfect, but somehow they</p>
<p begin="00:59:57.231" end="01:00:00.731" style="s2">were gentle enough to calm my heart.</p>
<p begin="01:00:01.031" end="01:00:05.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nightmare again, wildcat?</p>
<p begin="01:00:03.331" end="01:00:09.431" style="s2">Do not be scared. I am right here. Not</p>
<p begin="01:00:05.931" end="01:00:09.431" style="s2">even God gets past me tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:00:11.831" end="01:00:15.331" style="s2">Paint whatever you want.</p>
<p begin="01:00:13.631" end="01:00:17.631" style="s2">Turn my face into a pig if it makes you</p>
<p begin="01:00:15.331" end="01:00:17.631" style="s2">happy.</p>
<p begin="01:00:19.231" end="01:00:23.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; During the years Damian controlled me,</p>
<p begin="01:00:21.931" end="01:00:27.231" style="s2">painting had been dismissed as a useless</p>
<p begin="01:00:23.831" end="01:00:30.831" style="s2">distraction, but here it was freedom.</p>
<p begin="01:00:27.231" end="01:00:30.831" style="s2">It belonged to Scarlett O&#39;Hara Vale.</p>
<p begin="01:00:31.031" end="01:00:34.931" style="s2">Under Nathaniel&#39;s shameless indulgences</p>
<p begin="01:00:32.931" end="01:00:36.031" style="s2">and steady companionship, I smiled more</p>
<p begin="01:00:34.931" end="01:00:37.531" style="s2">and more.</p>
<p begin="01:00:36.031" end="01:00:39.331" style="s2">It was the kind of joy that came from</p>
<p begin="01:00:37.531" end="01:00:40.931" style="s2">being accepted without conditions and</p>
<p begin="01:00:39.331" end="01:00:43.231" style="s2">encouraged to release every part of</p>
<p begin="01:00:40.931" end="01:00:45.431" style="s2">myself. One day, he secretly arranged a</p>
<p begin="01:00:43.231" end="01:00:47.431" style="s2">10,000 m skydive. The helicopter climbed</p>
<p begin="01:00:45.431" end="01:00:48.631" style="s2">higher and higher with a violent roar.</p>
<p begin="01:00:47.431" end="01:00:50.331" style="s2">Beneath us were the jewel blue</p>
<p begin="01:00:48.631" end="01:00:52.131" style="s2">Mediterranean and the distant line of</p>
<p begin="01:00:50.331" end="01:00:54.031" style="s2">the Alps. Wind poured in through the</p>
<p begin="01:00:52.131" end="01:00:55.931" style="s2">open cabin door, whipping my hair into</p>
<p begin="01:00:54.031" end="01:00:57.531" style="s2">chaos. The instructor checked our gear</p>
<p begin="01:00:55.931" end="01:00:59.331" style="s2">one final time. I looked at the</p>
<p begin="01:00:57.531" end="01:01:01.031" style="s2">shrinking world outside the door, took a</p>
<p begin="01:00:59.331" end="01:01:02.631" style="s2">deep breath, and felt the brightest rush</p>
<p begin="01:01:01.031" end="01:01:05.231" style="s2">of anticipation I had known since my</p>
<p begin="01:01:02.631" end="01:01:07.631" style="s2">rebirth. Nathaniel inhaled my tightly,</p>
<p begin="01:01:05.231" end="01:01:09.231" style="s2">his palm burning hot against mine. He</p>
<p begin="01:01:07.631" end="01:01:11.031" style="s2">leaned close to my ear and shouted over</p>
<p begin="01:01:09.231" end="01:01:13.131" style="s2">the engine. He grinned wild and</p>
<p begin="01:01:11.031" end="01:01:14.531" style="s2">dazzling. Just as the green light came</p>
<p begin="01:01:13.131" end="01:01:16.132" style="s2">on and the instructor signaled that we</p>
<p begin="01:01:14.531" end="01:01:17.932" style="s2">were ready to jump, He suddenly gestured</p>
<p begin="01:01:16.132" end="01:01:19.732" style="s2">for him to wait. He turned to me and</p>
<p begin="01:01:17.932" end="01:01:21.732" style="s2">stared straight into my eyes, deep and</p>
<p begin="01:01:19.732" end="01:01:23.732" style="s2">burning. Above the deafening engine, his</p>
<p begin="01:01:21.732" end="01:01:27.132" style="s2">voice somehow reached me clearly.</p>
<p begin="01:01:23.732" end="01:01:29.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scarlett, before we jump, Scarlett Vale,</p>
<p begin="01:01:27.132" end="01:01:31.232" style="s2">I know you are hurt. I know that bastard</p>
<p begin="01:01:29.232" end="01:01:33.332" style="s2">in New York broke something in you. I am</p>
<p begin="01:01:31.232" end="01:01:34.932" style="s2">not going to feed you pretty lies. I am</p>
<p begin="01:01:33.332" end="01:01:37.732" style="s2">asking you straight.</p>
<p begin="01:01:34.932" end="01:01:37.732" style="s2">Give me a chance.</p>
<p begin="01:01:39.332" end="01:01:43.632" style="s2">Let me take care of you.</p>
<p begin="01:01:41.532" end="01:01:46.532" style="s2">Everything Damian Blackwood did to you,</p>
<p begin="01:01:43.632" end="01:01:49.632" style="s2">I will spend the rest of my life</p>
<p begin="01:01:46.532" end="01:01:49.632" style="s2">helping you heal from it.</p>
<p begin="01:01:49.732" end="01:01:53.432" style="s2">If the sky falls, I will hold it up for</p>
<p begin="01:01:51.632" end="01:01:55.132" style="s2">you. If you want to walk through the</p>
<p begin="01:01:53.432" end="01:01:57.132" style="s2">world like you own it, I will clear the</p>
<p begin="01:01:55.132" end="01:01:59.232" style="s2">road. If you want the stars, I will</p>
<p begin="01:01:57.132" end="01:02:00.832" style="s2">build you a damn ladder.</p>
<p begin="01:01:59.232" end="01:02:03.432" style="s2">I have never been this serious about</p>
<p begin="01:02:00.832" end="01:02:04.332" style="s2">anyone, Scarlett.</p>
<p begin="01:02:03.432" end="01:02:06.532" style="s2">I choose you.</p>
<p begin="01:02:04.332" end="01:02:08.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His complexion was direct, arrogant, and</p>
<p begin="01:02:06.532" end="01:02:09.932" style="s2">rough around the edges just like him,</p>
<p begin="01:02:08.332" end="01:02:12.032" style="s2">but it burned through me like sunlight,</p>
<p begin="01:02:09.932" end="01:02:13.932" style="s2">melting the deepest ice inside my heart.</p>
<p begin="01:02:12.032" end="01:02:17.232" style="s2">There was no profit binding us together,</p>
<p begin="01:02:13.932" end="01:02:19.432" style="s2">no rules, no cage, only the purest kind</p>
<p begin="01:02:17.232" end="01:02:21.632" style="s2">of desire to love someone as they were.</p>
<p begin="01:02:19.432" end="01:02:23.732" style="s2">I looked into those flirtatious eyes,</p>
<p begin="01:02:21.632" end="01:02:25.332" style="s2">now filled with love and nervousness,</p>
<p begin="01:02:23.732" end="01:02:27.732" style="s2">and the string that had been pulled in</p>
<p begin="01:02:25.332" end="01:02:29.032" style="s2">my heart for two lives finally snapped</p>
<p begin="01:02:27.732" end="01:02:30.932" style="s2">loose.</p>
<p begin="01:02:29.032" end="01:02:33.832" style="s2">The heavy chains were scattered by the</p>
<p begin="01:02:30.932" end="01:02:35.132" style="s2">wind 10,000 m above the earth.</p>
<p begin="01:02:33.832" end="01:02:38.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:02:35.132" end="01:02:38.732" style="s2">I will give you that chance.</p>
<p begin="01:02:46.632" end="01:02:51.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The wind thundered past my ears as I</p>
<p begin="01:02:48.732" end="01:02:54.932" style="s2">opened my arms to freedom. This time, my</p>
<p begin="01:02:51.132" end="01:02:54.932" style="s2">guardian was falling beside me.</p>
<p begin="01:02:56.432" end="01:03:01.432" style="s2">The sun in Southern France was warm and</p>
<p begin="01:02:58.832" end="01:03:03.132" style="s2">gentle, but the top floor of Blackwood</p>
<p begin="01:03:01.432" end="01:03:04.532" style="s2">Tower in New York, the heavy curtains</p>
<p begin="01:03:03.132" end="01:03:06.532" style="s2">were drawn tight, shutting out every</p>
<p begin="01:03:04.532" end="01:03:08.032" style="s2">trace of daylight. Damian sat collapsed</p>
<p begin="01:03:06.532" end="01:03:10.132" style="s2">in his oversized leather chair,</p>
<p begin="01:03:08.032" end="01:03:12.032" style="s2">surrounded by empty vodka bottles. He</p>
<p begin="01:03:10.132" end="01:03:14.032" style="s2">had grown painfully thin. His face was</p>
<p begin="01:03:12.032" end="01:03:15.432" style="s2">hangered, his eyes sunken, and the hair</p>
<p begin="01:03:14.032" end="01:03:16.932" style="s2">he had once kept perfectly styled for</p>
<p begin="01:03:15.432" end="01:03:18.833" style="s2">the sake of the family code now hung in</p>
<p begin="01:03:16.932" end="01:03:20.533" style="s2">a His phone screen was still lit. On it</p>
<p begin="01:03:18.833" end="01:03:22.433" style="s2">was a blurry paparazzi photo taken in</p>
<p begin="01:03:20.533" end="01:03:24.333" style="s2">Southern France. Sunlight poured over an</p>
<p begin="01:03:22.433" end="01:03:25.833" style="s2">outdoor cafe. I was wearing a bright</p>
<p begin="01:03:24.333" end="01:03:27.333" style="s2">yellow dress, laughing with Nathaniel a</p>
<p begin="01:03:25.833" end="01:03:28.833" style="s2">spoonful of ice cream. Nathaniel was</p>
<p begin="01:03:27.333" end="01:03:30.533" style="s2">looking at me with open affection,</p>
<p begin="01:03:28.833" end="01:03:32.433" style="s2">gently tapping my nose with his finger.</p>
<p begin="01:03:30.533" end="01:03:34.333" style="s2">The photo was beautiful enough to hurt.</p>
<p begin="01:03:32.433" end="01:03:36.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scarlett, I only found out recently that</p>
<p begin="01:03:34.333" end="01:03:38.133" style="s2">Clara used an electroshock chair on you</p>
<p begin="01:03:36.233" end="01:03:39.433" style="s2">in the wine cellar. I have locked her</p>
<p begin="01:03:38.133" end="01:03:41.133" style="s2">away.</p>
<p begin="01:03:39.433" end="01:03:42.433" style="s2">I will make her pay back every bit of</p>
<p begin="01:03:41.133" end="01:03:44.633" style="s2">pain she caused you.</p>
<p begin="01:03:42.433" end="01:03:45.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tears mixed with blood at the corner of</p>
<p begin="01:03:44.633" end="01:03:48.033" style="s2">his mouth.</p>
<p begin="01:03:45.833" end="01:03:50.733" style="s2">He whispered my name like a prayer and a</p>
<p begin="01:03:48.033" end="01:03:53.733" style="s2">punishment.</p>
<p begin="01:03:50.733" end="01:03:55.533" style="s2">I was smiling, bright and unryned, but</p>
<p begin="01:03:53.733" end="01:03:56.733" style="s2">that happiness no longer belonged to</p>
<p begin="01:03:55.533" end="01:03:58.233" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="01:03:56.733" end="01:03:59.533" style="s2">That place beside me should have been</p>
<p begin="01:03:58.233" end="01:04:01.033" style="s2">his.</p>
<p begin="01:03:59.533" end="01:04:04.333" style="s2">He was the one who had pushed me away</p>
<p begin="01:04:01.033" end="01:04:04.333" style="s2">with those damned rules.</p>
<p begin="01:04:06.859" end="01:04:08.879" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:04:12.133" end="01:04:16.633" style="s2">He wrote like a madman.</p>
<p begin="01:04:14.233" end="01:04:19.133" style="s2">Sometimes his handwriting was messy.</p>
<p begin="01:04:16.633" end="01:04:21.133" style="s2">Sometimes it was painfully neat. Before</p>
<p begin="01:04:19.133" end="01:04:23.533" style="s2">long, the white paper was covered in</p>
<p begin="01:04:21.133" end="01:04:25.233" style="s2">tear marks and bloody fingerprints from</p>
<p begin="01:04:23.533" end="01:04:27.233" style="s2">his broken hand.</p>
<p begin="01:04:25.233" end="01:04:29.633" style="s2">He wrote about how stupid he had been to</p>
<p begin="01:04:27.233" end="01:04:31.533" style="s2">believe the Vale family&#39;s act. He wrote</p>
<p begin="01:04:29.633" end="01:04:33.333" style="s2">about forcing me to write apologies,</p>
<p begin="01:04:31.533" end="01:04:35.333" style="s2">locking me in the wine cellar. I bled in</p>
<p begin="01:04:33.333" end="01:04:37.133" style="s2">bounty standing spilled about then hot</p>
<p begin="01:04:35.333" end="01:04:40.433" style="s2">water to protect Clara while leaving me</p>
<p begin="01:04:37.133" end="01:04:42.333" style="s2">with second degree burns and PTSD.</p>
<p begin="01:04:40.433" end="01:04:44.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scarlett, I only found out recently that</p>
<p begin="01:04:42.333" end="01:04:46.133" style="s2">Clara used an electroshock chair on you</p>
<p begin="01:04:44.233" end="01:04:47.333" style="s2">in the wine cellar. I have locked her</p>
<p begin="01:04:46.133" end="01:04:49.033" style="s2">away.</p>
<p begin="01:04:47.333" end="01:04:52.133" style="s2">I will make her pay back every bit of</p>
<p begin="01:04:49.033" end="01:04:52.133" style="s2">pain she caused you.</p>
<p begin="01:04:57.733" end="01:05:01.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The letter was sent by International</p>
<p begin="01:04:59.333" end="01:05:03.733" style="s2">Courier to Southern France and</p>
<p begin="01:05:01.233" end="01:05:05.933" style="s2">eventually reached my hands.</p>
<p begin="01:05:03.733" end="01:05:07.433" style="s2">I did not read a single line.</p>
<p begin="01:05:05.933" end="01:05:08.833" style="s2">I threw it straight into the roaring</p>
<p begin="01:05:07.433" end="01:05:10.733" style="s2">fireplace.</p>
<p begin="01:05:08.833" end="01:05:14.333" style="s2">The pages curled in the flailed in the</p>
<p begin="01:05:10.733" end="01:05:14.333" style="s2">flames and turned to ash.</p>
<p begin="01:05:19.033" end="01:05:22.235" style="s2">No answer ever came.</p>
<p begin="01:05:22.835" end="01:05:27.635" style="s2">After the letter was sent, no reply came</p>
<p begin="01:05:25.035" end="01:05:28.835" style="s2">back. Damian&#39;s last bit of hope died</p>
<p begin="01:05:27.635" end="01:05:30.535" style="s2">completely.</p>
<p begin="01:05:28.835" end="01:05:32.735" style="s2">Ignoring the furious objections of his</p>
<p begin="01:05:30.535" end="01:05:34.635" style="s2">private doctor, he tore the IV from his</p>
<p begin="01:05:32.735" end="01:05:36.035" style="s2">hand and booked the nearest flight to</p>
<p begin="01:05:34.635" end="01:05:37.835" style="s2">the south of France. Through the</p>
<p begin="01:05:36.035" end="01:05:39.635" style="s2">Blackwood family&#39;s underground channels</p>
<p begin="01:05:37.835" end="01:05:41.435" style="s2">in Europe, he eventually located the</p>
<p begin="01:05:39.635" end="01:05:42.735" style="s2">quiet estate surrounded by lavender</p>
<p begin="01:05:41.435" end="01:05:44.735" style="s2">fields.</p>
<p begin="01:05:42.735" end="01:05:46.835" style="s2">But he did not dare go near it. He was</p>
<p begin="01:05:44.735" end="01:05:48.435" style="s2">afraid of disturbing me. Even more than</p>
<p begin="01:05:46.835" end="01:05:50.735" style="s2">that, he was afraid of seeing the</p>
<p begin="01:05:48.435" end="01:05:52.535" style="s2">disgust in my eyes. So he stayed outside</p>
<p begin="01:05:50.735" end="01:05:54.135" style="s2">the thorny fence like a ghost, watching</p>
<p begin="01:05:52.535" end="01:05:56.035" style="s2">from far away day and night. He saw</p>
<p begin="01:05:54.135" end="01:05:57.635" style="s2">Nathaniel&#39;s Lamborghini come and go. He</p>
<p begin="01:05:56.035" end="01:05:59.635" style="s2">saw us walking hand in hand along the</p>
<p begin="01:05:57.635" end="01:06:01.035" style="s2">country road at sunset. At night, he saw</p>
<p begin="01:05:59.635" end="01:06:02.535" style="s2">Nathaniel&#39;s shadow on the second floor</p>
<p begin="01:06:01.035" end="01:06:04.835" style="s2">balcony as he gently held me in his</p>
<p begin="01:06:02.535" end="01:06:06.235" style="s2">arms. Every scene was a dull knife</p>
<p begin="01:06:04.835" end="01:06:08.535" style="s2">slowly cutting through his body and</p>
<p begin="01:06:06.235" end="01:06:10.235" style="s2">soul. One day, a violent storm broke</p>
<p begin="01:06:08.535" end="01:06:12.135" style="s2">over southern France. Lightning split</p>
<p begin="01:06:10.235" end="01:06:13.835" style="s2">the night sky. Damian stood outside the</p>
<p begin="01:06:12.135" end="01:06:15.535" style="s2">fence without moving, letting the cold</p>
<p begin="01:06:13.835" end="01:06:18.135" style="s2">rain soak him through. He was running a</p>
<p begin="01:06:15.535" end="01:06:19.735" style="s2">fever of 104 degrees, his body burning</p>
<p begin="01:06:18.135" end="01:06:21.535" style="s2">under the creasing rain, but he stood</p>
<p begin="01:06:19.735" end="01:06:23.935" style="s2">there like a statue and refused to</p>
<p begin="01:06:21.535" end="01:06:23.935" style="s2">leave.</p>
<p begin="01:06:24.335" end="01:06:29.235" style="s2">In his sick, desperate mind, he imagined</p>
<p begin="01:06:27.235" end="01:06:31.135" style="s2">that maybe the rain was heavy enough to</p>
<p begin="01:06:29.235" end="01:06:33.235" style="s2">soften my heart.</p>
<p begin="01:06:31.135" end="01:06:35.535" style="s2">Maybe I would come out with an umbrella</p>
<p begin="01:06:33.235" end="01:06:37.735" style="s2">and look at him just once.</p>
<p begin="01:06:35.535" end="01:06:40.130" style="s2">Only when his body finally gave out did</p>
<p begin="01:06:37.735" end="01:06:41.335" style="s2">he collapse into the muddy water.</p>
<p begin="01:06:40.130" end="01:06:43.435" style="s2">[sighs and gasps] Before he lost</p>
<p begin="01:06:41.335" end="01:06:45.135" style="s2">consciousness completely,</p>
<p begin="01:06:43.435" end="01:06:48.335" style="s2">he thought he saw the curtain move in a</p>
<p begin="01:06:45.135" end="01:06:48.335" style="s2">second floor window.</p>
<p begin="01:06:54.335" end="01:06:58.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scarlett,</p>
<p begin="01:06:55.935" end="01:06:58.735" style="s2">let me see her.</p>
<p begin="01:06:59.335" end="01:07:03.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep dreaming, Blackwood.</p>
<p begin="01:07:01.435" end="01:07:05.635" style="s2">She does not want to see you.</p>
<p begin="01:07:03.635" end="01:07:08.635" style="s2">She would feel dirty wasting even one</p>
<p begin="01:07:05.635" end="01:07:08.635" style="s2">second on you.</p>
<p begin="01:07:11.235" end="01:07:16.735" style="s2">She told me to give you four words.</p>
<p begin="01:07:14.035" end="01:07:18.635" style="s2">No forgiveness.</p>
<p begin="01:07:16.735" end="01:07:21.335" style="s2">No pity.</p>
<p begin="01:07:18.635" end="01:07:21.335" style="s2">No return.</p>
<p begin="01:07:23.361" end="01:07:25.536" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:07:23.935" end="01:07:27.336" style="s2">Keep whatever dignity the Blackwood</p>
<p begin="01:07:25.536" end="01:07:29.336" style="s2">family still has.</p>
<p begin="01:07:27.336" end="01:07:30.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every word struck Damian like an ice</p>
<p begin="01:07:29.336" end="01:07:33.036" style="s2">pick through the heart, shattering the</p>
<p begin="01:07:30.936" end="01:07:34.536" style="s2">last bit of hope left in him.</p>
<p begin="01:07:33.036" end="01:07:36.136" style="s2">He understood.</p>
<p begin="01:07:34.536" end="01:07:38.136" style="s2">I was not even willing to waste hatred</p>
<p begin="01:07:36.136" end="01:07:39.836" style="s2">on him anymore. Between us, everything</p>
<p begin="01:07:38.136" end="01:07:41.536" style="s2">had ended in the second of the car crash</p>
<p begin="01:07:39.836" end="01:07:42.736" style="s2">in my last life and in the moment he</p>
<p begin="01:07:41.536" end="01:07:44.436" style="s2">ordered the guards to keep me in the</p>
<p begin="01:07:42.736" end="01:07:46.436" style="s2">fountain in this life.</p>
<p begin="01:07:44.436" end="01:07:48.236" style="s2">After his fever broke, he was put on a</p>
<p begin="01:07:46.436" end="01:07:50.736" style="s2">plane back to New York by Nathaniel&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:07:48.236" end="01:07:52.436" style="s2">private guards.</p>
<p begin="01:07:50.736" end="01:07:55.036" style="s2">He left like a puppet with its soul</p>
<p begin="01:07:52.436" end="01:07:55.036" style="s2">pulled out.</p>
<p begin="01:07:59.036" end="01:08:03.236" style="s2">Damian&#39;s forced departure did not stop</p>
<p begin="01:08:01.036" end="01:08:05.136" style="s2">the next storm from arriving.</p>
<p begin="01:08:03.236" end="01:08:06.836" style="s2">After recovering in southern France, I</p>
<p begin="01:08:05.136" end="01:08:09.036" style="s2">was no longer the weak woman from my</p>
<p begin="01:08:06.836" end="01:08:10.736" style="s2">past life who could only endure pain.</p>
<p begin="01:08:09.036" end="01:08:12.536" style="s2">With Nathaniel&#39;s financial power and</p>
<p begin="01:08:10.736" end="01:08:14.136" style="s2">international underground network behind</p>
<p begin="01:08:12.536" end="01:08:16.236" style="s2">me, I personally planned the final</p>
<p begin="01:08:14.136" end="01:08:17.936" style="s2">reckoning against the Vale family. Using</p>
<p begin="01:08:16.236" end="01:08:19.836" style="s2">hackers, I gathered hard evidence of</p>
<p begin="01:08:17.936" end="01:08:21.536" style="s2">Richard&#39;s years of tax evasion, money</p>
<p begin="01:08:19.836" end="01:08:23.536" style="s2">laundering, embezzlement of my mother&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:08:21.536" end="01:08:25.136" style="s2">trust assets, and massive commercial</p>
<p begin="01:08:23.536" end="01:08:26.436" style="s2">bribery. Then I anonymously submit</p>
<p begin="01:08:25.136" end="01:08:29.736" style="s2">everything to the highest federal</p>
<p begin="01:08:26.436" end="01:08:29.736" style="s2">prosecutors in New York.</p>
<p begin="01:08:30.736" end="01:08:34.936" style="s2">The evidence was overwhelming. Richard</p>
<p begin="01:08:33.036" end="01:08:36.836" style="s2">was arrested by federal agents during a</p>
<p begin="01:08:34.936" end="01:08:39.136" style="s2">Vale group board meeting right in front</p>
<p begin="01:08:36.836" end="01:08:41.336" style="s2">of the cameras and the entire press. The</p>
<p begin="01:08:39.136" end="01:08:42.536" style="s2">Vale family trust and company collapsed</p>
<p begin="01:08:41.336" end="01:08:44.736" style="s2">overnight.</p>
<p begin="01:08:42.536" end="01:08:46.236" style="s2">Their assets were seized and liquidated,</p>
<p begin="01:08:44.736" end="01:08:48.036" style="s2">and bankruptcy followed almost</p>
<p begin="01:08:46.236" end="01:08:50.036" style="s2">immediately. In the visiting room of New</p>
<p begin="01:08:48.036" end="01:08:51.736" style="s2">York&#39;s first federal prison, I sat</p>
<p begin="01:08:50.036" end="01:08:53.536" style="s2">behind thick bulletproof glass and</p>
<p begin="01:08:51.736" end="01:08:55.736" style="s2">looked coldly at Richard. He had gone</p>
<p begin="01:08:53.536" end="01:08:57.236" style="s2">white-haired overnight. He looked old,</p>
<p begin="01:08:55.736" end="01:08:59.336" style="s2">broken, and frantic.</p>
<p begin="01:08:57.236" end="01:09:00.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scarlett, I AM YOUR FATHER. MY BLOOD</p>
<p begin="01:08:59.336" end="01:09:02.136" style="s2">RUNS IN YOUR VEINS.</p>
<p begin="01:09:00.536" end="01:09:03.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU SENT YOUR OWN FATHER TO HELL WITH</p>
<p begin="01:09:02.136" end="01:09:04.436" style="s2">YOUR OWN HANDS. You&#39;ll pay for this.</p>
<p begin="01:09:03.636" end="01:09:05.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pay for it?</p>
<p begin="01:09:04.436" end="01:09:07.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Richard, did you think about payback</p>
<p begin="01:09:05.636" end="01:09:08.936" style="s2">when you brought Monica into my mother&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:09:07.136" end="01:09:10.436" style="s2">house? Did you think about it when you</p>
<p begin="01:09:08.936" end="01:09:14.036" style="s2">let tried to sell me into the Blackwood</p>
<p begin="01:09:10.436" end="01:09:14.036" style="s2">family like a piece of property?</p>
<p begin="01:09:14.836" end="01:09:18.736" style="s2">This is your payback.</p>
<p begin="01:09:17.036" end="01:09:21.036" style="s2">Spend the rest of your life repenting in</p>
<p begin="01:09:18.736" end="01:09:21.036" style="s2">there.</p>
<p begin="01:09:24.736" end="01:09:29.137" style="s2">Monica could not survive the shock of</p>
<p begin="01:09:26.637" end="01:09:31.538" style="s2">the Vale family collapsing overnight.</p>
<p begin="01:09:29.137" end="01:09:33.438" style="s2">Her mind broke completely, and she was</p>
<p begin="01:09:31.538" end="01:09:35.338" style="s2">forced into the cheapest psychiatric</p>
<p begin="01:09:33.438" end="01:09:37.438" style="s2">hospital in New York.</p>
<p begin="01:09:35.338" end="01:09:41.538" style="s2">Every day she wandered with tangled</p>
<p begin="01:09:37.438" end="01:09:41.538" style="s2">hair, muttering nonsense to herself.</p>
<p begin="01:09:45.338" end="01:09:49.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian, please save my mother.</p>
<p begin="01:09:47.237" end="01:09:50.438" style="s2">Please save the Vale family.</p>
<p begin="01:09:49.137" end="01:09:51.838" style="s2">I know I was wrong. I will bring</p>
<p begin="01:09:50.438" end="01:09:53.338" style="s2">Scarlett back if you want. I will beg</p>
<p begin="01:09:51.838" end="01:09:54.838" style="s2">that [ __ ] to come back.</p>
<p begin="01:09:53.338" end="01:09:57.238" style="s2">Just look at me once.</p>
<p begin="01:09:54.838" end="01:10:00.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The iron gate slowly opened.</p>
<p begin="01:09:57.238" end="01:10:01.637" style="s2">Damian came out with a cane.</p>
<p begin="01:10:00.038" end="01:10:04.338" style="s2">He looked down at the woman kneeling at</p>
<p begin="01:10:01.637" end="01:10:06.538" style="s2">his feet like she was filth on the road.</p>
<p begin="01:10:04.338" end="01:10:08.137" style="s2">There was no emotion in his eyes, only</p>
<p begin="01:10:06.538" end="01:10:09.637" style="s2">disgust.</p>
<p begin="01:10:08.137" end="01:10:11.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Love,</p>
<p begin="01:10:09.637" end="01:10:12.738" style="s2">Clara, I know exactly how you and Monica</p>
<p begin="01:10:11.438" end="01:10:15.637" style="s2">schemed your way through Manhattan</p>
<p begin="01:10:12.738" end="01:10:17.738" style="s2">society and bullied Scarlett for years.</p>
<p begin="01:10:15.637" end="01:10:20.338" style="s2">I did not touch you before because you</p>
<p begin="01:10:17.738" end="01:10:21.438" style="s2">were not worth dirtying my hands.</p>
<p begin="01:10:20.338" end="01:10:24.637" style="s2">Also,</p>
<p begin="01:10:21.438" end="01:10:24.637" style="s2">I was saving you for Scarlett.</p>
<p begin="01:10:25.938" end="01:10:28.538" style="s2">Now that she has made her move, I am</p>
<p begin="01:10:27.137" end="01:10:30.338" style="s2">satisfied.</p>
<p begin="01:10:28.538" end="01:10:32.838" style="s2">Get this disgusting woman out of my</p>
<p begin="01:10:30.338" end="01:10:32.838" style="s2">sight.</p>
<p begin="01:10:35.038" end="01:10:38.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After that, a filthy, ragged woman</p>
<p begin="01:10:37.038" end="01:10:40.738" style="s2">appeared on the underground streets of</p>
<p begin="01:10:38.538" end="01:10:42.838" style="s2">Manhattan. She smelled rotten, laughed</p>
<p begin="01:10:40.738" end="01:10:44.338" style="s2">at strangers, and screamed at shadows.</p>
<p begin="01:10:42.838" end="01:10:46.637" style="s2">Damian had his men watch her from a</p>
<p begin="01:10:44.338" end="01:10:48.038" style="s2">distance. He did not allow her to die.</p>
<p begin="01:10:46.637" end="01:10:49.637" style="s2">He made sure she stayed alive long</p>
<p begin="01:10:48.038" end="01:10:51.538" style="s2">enough to suffer every humiliation the</p>
<p begin="01:10:49.637" end="01:10:53.438" style="s2">bottom of society had to offer. It was</p>
<p begin="01:10:51.538" end="01:10:55.038" style="s2">exactly what I had wanted for her. She</p>
<p begin="01:10:53.438" end="01:10:57.938" style="s2">would live like a rat in the gutter,</p>
<p begin="01:10:55.038" end="01:10:57.938" style="s2">slowly and painfully.</p>
<p begin="01:10:58.238" end="01:11:01.238" style="s2">After hearing how everything ended, I</p>
<p begin="01:10:59.938" end="01:11:02.938" style="s2">stood before the floor-to-ceiling</p>
<p begin="01:11:01.238" end="01:11:04.338" style="s2">windows of the estate in southern France</p>
<p begin="01:11:02.938" end="01:11:06.338" style="s2">and watched the sun sink below the</p>
<p begin="01:11:04.338" end="01:11:08.238" style="s2">horizon. For the first time, my heart</p>
<p begin="01:11:06.338" end="01:11:09.637" style="s2">felt strangely calm. The nightmare and</p>
<p begin="01:11:08.238" end="01:11:11.738" style="s2">karma that had followed me through two</p>
<p begin="01:11:09.637" end="01:11:13.938" style="s2">lifetimes had finally come to an end.</p>
<p begin="01:11:11.738" end="01:11:16.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bad people got what they deserved. From</p>
<p begin="01:11:13.938" end="01:11:17.038" style="s2">now on, baby, let me be the only one who</p>
<p begin="01:11:16.038" end="01:11:18.938" style="s2">gets to spoil you.</p>
<p begin="01:11:17.038" end="01:11:21.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Over the next half year, Nathaniel and I</p>
<p begin="01:11:18.938" end="01:11:23.238" style="s2">grew closer and closer. We traveled from</p>
<p begin="01:11:21.038" end="01:11:24.637" style="s2">country to country, enjoying our freedom</p>
<p begin="01:11:23.238" end="01:11:26.538" style="s2">and love anywhere in the world we</p>
<p begin="01:11:24.637" end="01:11:30.039" style="s2">wanted. We both thought the blood and</p>
<p begin="01:11:26.538" end="01:11:30.039" style="s2">storms were finally behind us.</p>
<p begin="01:11:44.709" end="01:11:47.639" style="s2">[sighs and panting]</p>
<p begin="01:11:45.539" end="01:11:49.239" style="s2">But no one expected Clara, who had long</p>
<p begin="01:11:47.639" end="01:11:51.439" style="s2">gone mad and been forgotten in the</p>
<p begin="01:11:49.239" end="01:11:55.339" style="s2">trash-filled corners of New York to be</p>
<p begin="01:11:51.439" end="01:11:55.339" style="s2">planning one last act of revenge.</p>
<p begin="01:12:05.839" end="01:12:08.839" style="s2">Nathaniel reacted instantly. With a low</p>
<p begin="01:12:07.539" end="01:12:10.139" style="s2">growl, he shoved open the car door and</p>
<p begin="01:12:08.839" end="01:12:13.239" style="s2">threw himself into the fight, doing</p>
<p begin="01:12:10.139" end="01:12:13.239" style="s2">everything he could to protect me.</p>
<p begin="01:12:17.639" end="01:12:20.639" style="s2">A burst of crazed applause rang out.</p>
<p begin="01:12:19.139" end="01:12:22.239" style="s2">Clara slowly stepped out from behind one</p>
<p begin="01:12:20.639" end="01:12:23.739" style="s2">of the vans. She wore a filthy, torn</p>
<p begin="01:12:22.239" end="01:12:25.239" style="s2">dress stained with grime. Her hair was a</p>
<p begin="01:12:23.739" end="01:12:26.739" style="s2">tangled mess, and her eyes were cloudy</p>
<p begin="01:12:25.239" end="01:12:28.239" style="s2">and insane. In her hand, she gripped a</p>
<p begin="01:12:26.739" end="01:12:29.439" style="s2">loaded Glock. Her ruined face twisted</p>
<p begin="01:12:28.239" end="01:12:31.639" style="s2">like something out of a nightmare as she</p>
<p begin="01:12:29.439" end="01:12:33.139" style="s2">laughed at me. Scarlett, you [ __ ] I</p>
<p begin="01:12:31.639" end="01:12:35.039" style="s2">have every piece of my</p>
<p begin="01:12:33.139" end="01:12:36.339" style="s2">drink it 100 times, a thousands over.</p>
<p begin="01:12:35.039" end="01:12:38.139" style="s2">You and the man you love are both going</p>
<p begin="01:12:36.339" end="01:12:39.339" style="s2">to hell today. At that deadly moment,</p>
<p begin="01:12:38.139" end="01:12:40.839" style="s2">just as one of the thugs was about to</p>
<p begin="01:12:39.339" end="01:12:42.239" style="s2">pull the trigger, the roar of an engine</p>
<p begin="01:12:40.839" end="01:12:43.939" style="s2">ripped through the sea wind. A black</p>
<p begin="01:12:42.239" end="01:12:45.639" style="s2">armored SUV came crashing in from</p>
<p begin="01:12:43.939" end="01:12:47.139" style="s2">behind, ramping the van, blocking the</p>
<p begin="01:12:45.639" end="01:12:48.739" style="s2">road and screech to a stop in the middle</p>
<p begin="01:12:47.139" end="01:12:50.639" style="s2">of the chaos. A thin figure with a</p>
<p begin="01:12:48.739" end="01:12:52.739" style="s2">slight limp stepped out, carrying an</p>
<p begin="01:12:50.639" end="01:12:55.039" style="s2">automatic rifle and surrounded by cold,</p>
<p begin="01:12:52.739" end="01:12:56.639" style="s2">murderous intent. Damian, he had been</p>
<p begin="01:12:55.039" end="01:12:58.239" style="s2">following my movements from a distance</p>
<p begin="01:12:56.639" end="01:13:00.139" style="s2">all along. When he found out Clara had</p>
<p begin="01:12:58.239" end="01:13:01.539" style="s2">disappeared under strange circumstances,</p>
<p begin="01:13:00.139" end="01:13:04.639" style="s2">he sensed something was wrong and</p>
<p begin="01:13:01.539" end="01:13:04.639" style="s2">tracked the ride route here.</p>
<p begin="01:13:08.339" end="01:13:14.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let her go, Clara.</p>
<p begin="01:13:10.239" end="01:13:14.239" style="s2">Get that filthy gun away from her head.</p>
<p begin="01:13:16.410" end="01:13:19.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:13:17.939" end="01:13:22.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian, you came too?</p>
<p begin="01:13:19.739" end="01:13:23.939" style="s2">Good. Perfect. The head of the Blackwood</p>
<p begin="01:13:22.139" end="01:13:25.939" style="s2">family and Nathaniel&#39;s family are both</p>
<p begin="01:13:23.939" end="01:13:26.739" style="s2">here. I can send all of you to hell</p>
<p begin="01:13:25.939" end="01:13:28.839" style="s2">together.</p>
<p begin="01:13:26.739" end="01:13:30.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you want?</p>
<p begin="01:13:28.839" end="01:13:33.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I give you every Blackwood trust,</p>
<p begin="01:13:30.740" end="01:13:36.140" style="s2">every share, every asset I have.</p>
<p begin="01:13:33.940" end="01:13:38.740" style="s2">Take my life if you want.</p>
<p begin="01:13:36.140" end="01:13:41.640" style="s2">Just let Scarlett go.</p>
<p begin="01:13:38.740" end="01:13:44.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seth, I do not want anything anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:13:41.640" end="01:13:46.040" style="s2">I want her to suffer.</p>
<p begin="01:13:44.240" end="01:13:48.140" style="s2">I want you, the high and mighty king of</p>
<p begin="01:13:46.040" end="01:13:50.040" style="s2">Manhattan, to watch with your own eyes</p>
<p begin="01:13:48.140" end="01:13:52.140" style="s2">while I tear her up, watching both men</p>
<p begin="01:13:50.040" end="01:13:53.540" style="s2">suffer because of me tore my heart open</p>
<p begin="01:13:52.140" end="01:13:55.940" style="s2">and tears blurred my vision.</p>
<p begin="01:13:53.540" end="01:13:56.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, stop! Nathaniel, Damian, just go. Do</p>
<p begin="01:13:55.940" end="01:13:58.540" style="s2">not worry about me.</p>
<p begin="01:13:56.640" end="01:14:00.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want her alive? Fine. Damian, king</p>
<p begin="01:13:58.540" end="01:14:01.240" style="s2">of Manhattan, get on your knees. Kneel</p>
<p begin="01:14:00.440" end="01:14:02.840" style="s2">and beg me.</p>
<p begin="01:14:01.240" end="01:14:04.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian looked at my deathly pale face</p>
<p begin="01:14:02.840" end="01:14:06.040" style="s2">and did not hesitate for even a second.</p>
<p begin="01:14:04.640" end="01:14:07.040" style="s2">He threw away the rifle in his hand and</p>
<p begin="01:14:06.040" end="01:14:08.440" style="s2">dropped to his knees on rough</p>
<p begin="01:14:07.040" end="01:14:09.640" style="s2">gravel-covered road. The heavy sound of</p>
<p begin="01:14:08.440" end="01:14:11.340" style="s2">his bones hitting the ground tore</p>
<p begin="01:14:09.640" end="01:14:12.840" style="s2">through the seawind. This was a man who</p>
<p begin="01:14:11.340" end="01:14:14.240" style="s2">had been pathologically proud in both</p>
<p begin="01:14:12.840" end="01:14:15.740" style="s2">lifetimes, a man who had never lowered</p>
<p begin="01:14:14.240" end="01:14:19.340" style="s2">his head to anyone. For my life, he</p>
<p begin="01:14:15.740" end="01:14:19.340" style="s2">threw away every last bit of dignity.</p>
<p begin="01:14:20.601" end="01:14:22.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:14:23.640" end="01:14:28.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at you.</p>
<p begin="01:14:25.140" end="01:14:29.340" style="s2">You finally know what it feels like.</p>
<p begin="01:14:28.040" end="01:14:32.740" style="s2">Beat him.</p>
<p begin="01:14:29.340" end="01:14:32.740" style="s2">Beat him until he cannot move.</p>
<p begin="01:14:44.940" end="01:14:48.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In that split second, no one saw where</p>
<p begin="01:14:46.740" end="01:14:50.040" style="s2">Damian found the strength. Like a black</p>
<p begin="01:14:48.440" end="01:14:51.440" style="s2">panther burning through its last breath,</p>
<p begin="01:14:50.040" end="01:14:52.740" style="s2">he threw himself up from the ground and</p>
<p begin="01:14:51.440" end="01:14:54.140" style="s2">slammed me with that ounce of life he</p>
<p begin="01:14:52.740" end="01:14:55.440" style="s2">had left. He knocked me hard onto the</p>
<p begin="01:14:54.140" end="01:14:57.140" style="s2">road and covered completely with his</p>
<p begin="01:14:55.440" end="01:14:58.640" style="s2">broad bloodied back, leaving no gap</p>
<p begin="01:14:57.140" end="01:15:00.040" style="s2">between me and the bullet. The sound</p>
<p begin="01:14:58.640" end="01:15:01.740" style="s2">that followed tore into his back,</p>
<p begin="01:15:00.040" end="01:15:02.840" style="s2">exploding only a few millimeters from</p>
<p begin="01:15:01.740" end="01:15:05.040" style="s2">his heart.</p>
<p begin="01:15:02.840" end="01:15:07.640" style="s2">Blood sprayed across the air and</p>
<p begin="01:15:05.040" end="01:15:10.540" style="s2">instantly stained my white dress,</p>
<p begin="01:15:07.640" end="01:15:10.540" style="s2">a shocking red.</p>
<p begin="01:15:12.940" end="01:15:16.240" style="s2">For a moment, the whole world seemed to</p>
<p begin="01:15:14.340" end="01:15:18.140" style="s2">stop. Damian heavy body pressed down</p>
<p begin="01:15:16.240" end="01:15:20.440" style="s2">over mine. With impossible effort, he</p>
<p begin="01:15:18.140" end="01:15:21.940" style="s2">slowly raised his head. His deathly pale</p>
<p begin="01:15:20.440" end="01:15:23.640" style="s2">face was covered in blood. When he saw</p>
<p begin="01:15:21.940" end="01:15:25.140" style="s2">that I was safe,</p>
<p begin="01:15:23.640" end="01:15:26.840" style="s2">without a count, he saw his mouth lifted</p>
<p begin="01:15:25.140" end="01:15:28.340" style="s2">into a relieved smile. And that smile</p>
<p begin="01:15:26.840" end="01:15:30.040" style="s2">was a kind of longing and regret I had</p>
<p begin="01:15:28.340" end="01:15:31.940" style="s2">never seen from him in either lifetime.</p>
<p begin="01:15:30.040" end="01:15:33.642" style="s2">He struggled to raise his bleeding hand</p>
<p begin="01:15:31.940" end="01:15:35.542" style="s2">as if he wanted to touch my face one</p>
<p begin="01:15:33.642" end="01:15:37.342" style="s2">last time, but his fingers shook</p>
<p begin="01:15:35.542" end="01:15:39.142" style="s2">violently in the air, never quite</p>
<p begin="01:15:37.342" end="01:15:40.542" style="s2">reaching me before falling weakly into</p>
<p begin="01:15:39.142" end="01:15:42.242" style="s2">the mud.</p>
<p begin="01:15:40.542" end="01:15:43.642" style="s2">He looked at me as the light in his eyes</p>
<p begin="01:15:42.242" end="01:15:47.542" style="s2">began to scatter.</p>
<p begin="01:15:43.642" end="01:15:47.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scarlet, I am sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:15:48.642" end="01:15:53.242" style="s2">This time,</p>
<p begin="01:15:50.142" end="01:15:56.142" style="s2">I finally protected you.</p>
<p begin="01:15:53.242" end="01:15:58.442" style="s2">Live well with Nathaniel.</p>
<p begin="01:15:56.142" end="01:15:58.442" style="s2">Goodbye.</p>
<p begin="01:16:06.142" end="01:16:08.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian!</p>
<p begin="01:16:06.712" end="01:16:08.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:16:16.342" end="01:16:19.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But I only held the blood-covered man in</p>
<p begin="01:16:17.842" end="01:16:21.942" style="s2">arms, tears streaming down my face. Did</p>
<p begin="01:16:19.742" end="01:16:23.342" style="s2">I hate him? Did I resent him? The moment</p>
<p begin="01:16:21.942" end="01:16:24.942" style="s2">that bullet tore through his body, the</p>
<p begin="01:16:23.342" end="01:16:26.942" style="s2">chains from my past life and the hatred</p>
<p begin="01:16:24.942" end="01:16:28.442" style="s2">from this life were shattered with it.</p>
<p begin="01:16:26.942" end="01:16:30.242" style="s2">With his own life, he completed a</p>
<p begin="01:16:28.442" end="01:16:32.542" style="s2">redemption that had come two lifetimes</p>
<p begin="01:16:30.242" end="01:16:32.542" style="s2">too late.</p>
<p begin="01:16:32.942" end="01:16:36.242" style="s2">Above the Southeast Asian island, the</p>
<p begin="01:16:34.642" end="01:16:37.442" style="s2">roar of a rescue helicopter tore through</p>
<p begin="01:16:36.242" end="01:16:38.942" style="s2">the humid air.</p>
<p begin="01:16:37.442" end="01:16:40.542" style="s2">A team of top international medics</p>
<p begin="01:16:38.942" end="01:16:41.942" style="s2">carefully lifted Damian, covered in</p>
<p begin="01:16:40.542" end="01:16:43.742" style="s2">blood and deep in shock, onto a</p>
<p begin="01:16:41.942" end="01:16:45.342" style="s2">stretcher. His face had turned ashen,</p>
<p begin="01:16:43.742" end="01:16:46.842" style="s2">almost like a corpse. His breathing and</p>
<p begin="01:16:45.342" end="01:16:48.842" style="s2">heartbeat were so weak the machines</p>
<p begin="01:16:46.842" end="01:16:50.642" style="s2">could barely detect them. I stood beside</p>
<p begin="01:16:48.842" end="01:16:52.842" style="s2">the helicopter, his warm blood still on</p>
<p begin="01:16:50.642" end="01:16:54.242" style="s2">my face and clothes. My face and clothes</p>
<p begin="01:16:52.842" end="01:16:55.542" style="s2">now wrapped in bandages and looking</p>
<p begin="01:16:54.242" end="01:16:56.842" style="s2">grim, forced self through the pain of</p>
<p begin="01:16:55.542" end="01:16:58.642" style="s2">his fractures and pulled me hard into</p>
<p begin="01:16:56.842" end="01:17:00.042" style="s2">his arms, using his broad chest to hold</p>
<p begin="01:16:58.642" end="01:17:01.442" style="s2">me up. My eyes were complicated as he</p>
<p begin="01:17:00.042" end="01:17:02.842" style="s2">watched Damian, he&#39;d always despised,</p>
<p begin="01:17:01.442" end="01:17:04.542" style="s2">had really been willing to trade his</p>
<p begin="01:17:02.842" end="01:17:06.242" style="s2">life for my freedom. The helicopter</p>
<p begin="01:17:04.542" end="01:17:07.942" style="s2">rushed toward the nearest International</p>
<p begin="01:17:06.242" end="01:17:09.942" style="s2">Medical Center.</p>
<p begin="01:17:07.942" end="01:17:12.242" style="s2">The doors of the operating room stayed</p>
<p begin="01:17:09.942" end="01:17:14.942" style="s2">shut, and the red light above them</p>
<p begin="01:17:12.242" end="01:17:16.942" style="s2">burned for 12 full hours.</p>
<p begin="01:17:14.942" end="01:17:18.742" style="s2">Nathaniel and I waited in the hallway as</p>
<p begin="01:17:16.942" end="01:17:21.342" style="s2">time stretched until it felt like a</p>
<p begin="01:17:18.742" end="01:17:21.342" style="s2">century.</p>
<p begin="01:17:22.442" end="01:17:25.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The surgery succeeded.</p>
<p begin="01:17:24.042" end="01:17:26.942" style="s2">The bullet is out,</p>
<p begin="01:17:25.342" end="01:17:29.242" style="s2">but he&#39;s not out of danger.</p>
<p begin="01:17:26.942" end="01:17:32.542" style="s2">Recovery will be long. The damage</p>
<p begin="01:17:29.242" end="01:17:32.542" style="s2">severe, irreversible.</p>
<p begin="01:17:41.143" end="01:17:46.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damian remained unconscious in the</p>
<p begin="01:17:42.943" end="01:17:47.743" style="s2">sterile ICU for more than half a month.</p>
<p begin="01:17:46.143" end="01:17:49.143" style="s2">During that time with no one in control</p>
<p begin="01:17:47.743" end="01:17:50.743" style="s2">of Blackwood Group, rival financial</p>
<p begin="01:17:49.143" end="01:17:52.143" style="s2">powers in New York began tearing into</p>
<p begin="01:17:50.743" end="01:17:53.543" style="s2">it. The stock price plunged and the</p>
<p begin="01:17:52.143" end="01:17:54.943" style="s2">company started from the inside. Through</p>
<p begin="01:17:53.543" end="01:17:56.343" style="s2">Nathaniel&#39;s underground channels, I</p>
<p begin="01:17:54.943" end="01:17:57.943" style="s2">annoy passed Damian&#39;s confidential</p>
<p begin="01:17:56.343" end="01:17:59.743" style="s2">medical trial into a relatively loyal</p>
<p begin="01:17:57.943" end="01:18:01.743" style="s2">elder inside the Blackwood family. That</p>
<p begin="01:17:59.743" end="01:18:03.443" style="s2">elder stepped in and barely stabilized</p>
<p begin="01:18:01.743" end="01:18:05.343" style="s2">the chaos in New York. Half a month</p>
<p begin="01:18:03.443" end="01:18:07.243" style="s2">later, Damian finally opened his eyes to</p>
<p begin="01:18:05.343" end="01:18:08.943" style="s2">the beeping of medical machines. His</p>
<p begin="01:18:07.243" end="01:18:10.743" style="s2">vision slowly focused until he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:18:08.943" end="01:18:12.743" style="s2">standing outside the sterile glass. Our</p>
<p begin="01:18:10.743" end="01:18:14.843" style="s2">eyes met and the air in the room seemed</p>
<p begin="01:18:12.743" end="01:18:16.243" style="s2">to freeze. My gaze was complicated.</p>
<p begin="01:18:14.843" end="01:18:18.143" style="s2">There was concern in it. There was</p>
<p begin="01:18:16.243" end="01:18:20.043" style="s2">release. There was no love left. There</p>
<p begin="01:18:18.143" end="01:18:22.243" style="s2">was no hatred left either. Damian wore</p>
<p begin="01:18:20.043" end="01:18:23.843" style="s2">an oxygen mask. His dry lips parted as</p>
<p begin="01:18:22.243" end="01:18:25.843" style="s2">if he wanted to say my name, but only a</p>
<p begin="01:18:23.843" end="01:18:27.843" style="s2">weak wheezy breath came out. He saw the</p>
<p begin="01:18:25.843" end="01:18:29.443" style="s2">calm in my eyes. He also saw Nathaniel</p>
<p begin="01:18:27.843" end="01:18:30.943" style="s2">behind me, covered in casts and</p>
<p begin="01:18:29.443" end="01:18:32.943" style="s2">bandages, still gripping my shoulder in</p>
<p begin="01:18:30.943" end="01:18:34.543" style="s2">a posture of absolute protection. Damian</p>
<p begin="01:18:32.943" end="01:18:36.243" style="s2">understood that the last faint</p>
<p begin="01:18:34.543" end="01:18:38.043" style="s2">impossible hope in his soul went out</p>
<p begin="01:18:36.243" end="01:18:39.843" style="s2">like a candle in the wind. Two silent</p>
<p begin="01:18:38.043" end="01:18:41.543" style="s2">lines of tears slid from the corners of</p>
<p begin="01:18:39.843" end="01:18:43.143" style="s2">his eyes into his hair.</p>
<p begin="01:18:41.543" end="01:18:44.743" style="s2">He had used his life to save me.</p>
<p begin="01:18:43.143" end="01:18:47.443" style="s2">Whatever remained between us had died</p>
<p begin="01:18:44.743" end="01:18:47.443" style="s2">with that redemption.</p>
<p begin="01:18:48.043" end="01:18:51.743" style="s2">3 months later, at Geneva International</p>
<p begin="01:18:49.843" end="01:18:53.143" style="s2">Airport in Switzerland, morning fog</p>
<p begin="01:18:51.743" end="01:18:54.943" style="s2">covered up the runway bound for one of</p>
<p begin="01:18:53.143" end="01:18:56.743" style="s2">Switzerland&#39;s top private rehabilitation</p>
<p begin="01:18:54.943" end="01:18:58.143" style="s2">clients waited in silence. Damian could</p>
<p begin="01:18:56.743" end="01:18:59.143" style="s2">barely sit in a wheelchair now. He</p>
<p begin="01:18:58.143" end="01:19:00.843" style="s2">looked older and thinner than he</p>
<p begin="01:18:59.143" end="01:19:02.043" style="s2">disability in his left leg. For the rest</p>
<p begin="01:19:00.843" end="01:19:04.143" style="s2">of his life, he would have to rely on a</p>
<p begin="01:19:02.043" end="01:19:06.143" style="s2">cane and a wheelchair to move. His body</p>
<p begin="01:19:04.143" end="01:19:08.443" style="s2">had been drained almost beyond repair.</p>
<p begin="01:19:06.143" end="01:19:09.943" style="s2">He never tried to contact me again. He</p>
<p begin="01:19:08.443" end="01:19:12.143" style="s2">even refused visits from the core</p>
<p begin="01:19:09.943" end="01:19:14.143" style="s2">members of the Blackwood family. Before</p>
<p begin="01:19:12.143" end="01:19:16.043" style="s2">boarding, he calmly signed every equity</p>
<p begin="01:19:14.143" end="01:19:18.043" style="s2">transfer document and full management</p>
<p begin="01:19:16.043" end="01:19:20.043" style="s2">authorization agreement, handing away</p>
<p begin="01:19:18.043" end="01:19:21.943" style="s2">the business empire he had once treated</p>
<p begin="01:19:20.043" end="01:19:23.543" style="s2">as his life. He sold all of his</p>
<p begin="01:19:21.943" end="01:19:25.343" style="s2">Manhattan properties, poured every</p>
<p begin="01:19:23.543" end="01:19:27.943" style="s2">dollar into a newly established Global</p>
<p begin="01:19:25.343" end="01:19:29.243" style="s2">Wildlife and Freedom Photography Trust.</p>
<p begin="01:19:27.943" end="01:19:31.043" style="s2">It was an anonymous gift that would</p>
<p begin="01:19:29.243" end="01:19:32.943" style="s2">benefit me forever without requiring my</p>
<p begin="01:19:31.043" end="01:19:34.443" style="s2">signature. The medical plane&#39;s engines</p>
<p begin="01:19:32.943" end="01:19:35.843" style="s2">roared. Damian leaned beside the window</p>
<p begin="01:19:34.443" end="01:19:37.743" style="s2">and looked out at the endless freezing</p>
<p begin="01:19:35.843" end="01:19:39.144" style="s2">white cloud sea above the Alps. His eyes</p>
<p begin="01:19:37.743" end="01:19:40.744" style="s2">held nothing but quiet acceptance and</p>
<p begin="01:19:39.144" end="01:19:42.344" style="s2">deathly stillness. He had finally</p>
<p begin="01:19:40.744" end="01:19:43.945" style="s2">removed himself from my world.</p>
<p begin="01:19:42.344" end="01:19:45.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scarlett, I love you.</p>
<p begin="01:19:43.945" end="01:19:46.344" style="s2">Not because I want to lock you in a</p>
<p begin="01:19:45.045" end="01:19:47.545" style="s2">house like some pretty bird and not</p>
<p begin="01:19:46.344" end="01:19:49.244" style="s2">because what you&#39;re following owning any</p>
<p begin="01:19:47.545" end="01:19:50.945" style="s2">damn family rules.</p>
<p begin="01:19:49.244" end="01:19:53.744" style="s2">I love you exactly like this, wild,</p>
<p begin="01:19:50.945" end="01:19:55.144" style="s2">proud, bright, and impossible to tame.</p>
<p begin="01:19:53.744" end="01:19:56.744" style="s2">Let me be the man who protects you for</p>
<p begin="01:19:55.144" end="01:19:59.045" style="s2">the rest of your life.</p>
<p begin="01:19:56.744" end="01:19:59.045" style="s2">Marry me.</p>
<p begin="01:20:02.644" end="01:20:05.445" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:20:04.045" end="01:20:07.144" style="s2">I will marry you.</p>
<p begin="01:20:05.445" end="01:20:08.744" style="s2">The last light of sunset wrapped around</p>
<p begin="01:20:07.144" end="01:20:09.844" style="s2">us in gold as he pulled me into his</p>
<p begin="01:20:08.744" end="01:20:11.144" style="s2">arms.</p>
<p begin="01:20:09.844" end="01:20:13.545" style="s2">The chains from my past life were</p>
<p begin="01:20:11.144" end="01:20:17.344" style="s2">finally broken. In this life, I finally</p>
<p begin="01:20:13.545" end="01:20:17.344" style="s2">had the wide open sky I deserved.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
